#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Mark a spot for crafting.  Crafting tasks next to this tile will "
"automatically use this location instead of attempting to craft in your "
"hands, with the usual crafting speed penalty for working on the ground.  "
"Does not prevent using a proper workbench, if available.  Deconstruct or "
"smash to remove."
msgstr ""
"Marca una posición como lugar donde fabricar. Las tareas de fabricación "
"junto a esta posición automáticamente usarán este sitio en vez de intentar "
"fabricar con tus manos, con la penalización habitual de velocidad de "
"fabricación por trabajar en el suelo. No te impide usar un banco de trabajo "
"adecuado, si está disponible. Desmóntalo o golpealo para retirarlo."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json data/mods/innawood/mining/construction.json
msgid "Can be deconstructed without tools."
msgstr "Puede ser desmontado sin herramientas."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid "Must be supported on at least two sides."
msgstr "Debe apoyarse el al menos dos lados."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Can be deconstructed without tools.  Must be adjacent to a palisade wall "
"that is itself adjacent to a palisade gate in order to open said gate."
msgstr ""
"Puede ser desmontado sin herramientas. Debe estar al lado de un muro de "
"empalizada que a su vez esté al lado de una puerta de empalizada para poder "
"abrir dicha puerta."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Must be between palisade walls to function, and at least one wall must have "
"an adjacent rope & pulley system."
msgstr ""
"Debe estar entre los muros de la empalizada para funcionar, y al menos un "
"muro debe tener un sistema de cuerdas y poleas adyacentes."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid "Needs to be supported on both sides by fencing, walls, etc."
msgstr "Necesita apoyarse en ambos lados por vallas, muros, etc."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Can be deconstructed without tools.  Must be supported on at least two "
"sides."
msgstr ""
"Puede ser desarmado sin herramientas. Debe estar puesto sobre al menos dos "
"lados."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"This is a slow, hard process that could be accelerated with power tools.  "
"Mi-go structures are dangerously hot -- you'll likely need to take breaks "
"outside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Your power tool is effective at cutting through the resin cage, but it's "
"still a hard process.  Mi-go structures are dangerously hot -- you'll likely"
" need to take breaks outside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Build an earth ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding"
" ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The high end of a "
"ramp must be built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels in both "
"directions."
msgstr ""
"Construye una rampa de tierra que conduzca al siguiente nivel z superior, y "
"la correspondiente rampa hacia abajo que conduzca desde el nivel z superior "
"a este nivel. El extremo superior de una rampa debe construirse adyacente "
"para permitir el movimiento entre niveles z en ambas direcciones."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Build an earth ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding"
" ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It must be built "
"next to a low end of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels in both "
"directions."
msgstr ""
"Construye una rampa de tierra que conduzca al siguiente nivel z superior, y "
"la correspondiente rampa hacia abajo que conduzca desde el nivel z superior "
"a este nivel. Debe construirse junto a un extremo bajo de una rampa para "
"poder moverse entre niveles z en ambas direcciones."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Build a concrete ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The "
"high end of a ramp must be built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""
"Construye una rampa de hormigón que conduzca al siguiente nivel z superior, "
"y la correspondiente rampa hacia abajo que conduzca desde el nivel z "
"superior a este nivel. El extremo superior de una rampa debe construirse "
"adyacente para permitir el movimiento entre niveles z en ambas direcciones."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Build a concrete ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It "
"must be built next to a low end of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""
"Construye una rampa de hormigón que conduzca al siguiente nivel z superior, "
"y la correspondiente rampa hacia abajo que conduzca desde el nivel z "
"superior a este nivel. Debe construirse junto a un extremo bajo de una rampa"
" para poder moverse entre niveles z en ambas direcciones."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid "You need a deep pit to construct a root cellar."
msgstr "Necesitas una fosa profunda para construir una bodega de raices."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Firewood or other flammable materials on a nearby tile marked in this way "
"may be used to automatically refuel fires.  This will be done to maintain "
"light during long-running tasks that require it such as crafting or reading,"
" but not (for example) if you are simply waiting nearby."
msgstr ""
"La leña u otros materiales inflamables que se encuentren en un espacio "
"cercano marcada de este modo, pueden utilizarse para reabastecer "
"automáticamente el fuego. Esto se hará para mantener la luz durante tareas "
"de larga duración que lo requieran, como la fabricación o la lectura, pero "
"no (por ejemplo) si simplemente estás esperando cerca."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Mark a spot for target practice.  Firing will automatically target the first"
" practice target location found in gun range, if no enemies are around."
msgstr ""
"Marca un lugar para practicar el tiro. Los disparos se dirigirán "
"automáticamente a la primera ubicación del objetivo de práctica que se "
"encuentre en el campo de tiro, si no hay enemigos cerca."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Must be adjacent to ordinary, concrete, brick, or rock wall that is itself "
"adjacent to a metal gate in order to open said gate."
msgstr ""
"Debe estar al lado de una pared de hormigón ordinario, ladrillo o roca que a"
" su vez este al lado de una puerta metálica para poder abrir dicha puerta."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Must be between ordinary, concrete, brick, or rock walls to function, and at"
" least one wall must have an adjacent mechanical winch."
msgstr ""
"Debe estar al lado de una pared de hormigón ordinario, ladrillo o roca para "
"funcionar, y por lo menos un muro debe tener un cabrestante mecánico "
"adyacente."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid "Must be built indoors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid "Built in a tree."
msgstr "Construir en un árbol."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction.json
msgid ""
"Mark a spot to stack cut grain for drying outdoors.  Once placed, put "
"unrotten undried grain stalks on the stooking spot and examine it to get "
"started."
msgstr ""
"Marca un lugar para almacenar el grano cortado para secado en exteriores. "
"Una vez colocado, pon tallos de grano no descompuesto sin secar en el lugar "
"de secado y examina para comenzar."

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
