msgstr "Tomaste Antiasmático"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Antiasthmatic Drugs"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have taken an antiasthmatic drug recently."
msgstr "Ha tomado un medicamento antiasmático recientemente."

