#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Alcohol Dependence"
msgstr "Adicción a Alcohol"

#. ~ Description of profession "Alcohol Dependence" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"One drink became two, two became too many, and before long you were only "
"able to find solace at the bottom of a bottle.  God-damn, you need a drink."
msgstr ""
"Un trago se convirtió en dos, dos se convirtieron en demasiados, y en poco "
"tiempo sólo pudiste encontrar consuelo en el fondo de una botella. Maldita "
"sea, necesitas un trago."

