"Despite firearms making traditional melee weapons largely obsolete, you have"
" extensive experience fighting in hand-to-hand combat with tools of war.  "
"Maybe it was full-contact HEMA or SCA sparring, or maybe you're just a "
"badass commando with a machete.  You start with your choice of Barbaran "
"Montante, Bōjutsu, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, Medieval "
