msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Vegetarian Foraging"
msgstr "Forrajeador Vegetariano"

#. ~ Description of profession "Vegetarian Foraging" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have been a vegetarian for so long that eating meat makes you feel sick."
"  You like to supplement your diet with wild plants and mushrooms foraged in"
" the woods."
msgstr ""
"Llevas tanto tiempo siendo vegetariano que comer carne te hace sentir mal. "
"Te gusta complementar tu dieta con plantas silvestres y setas recogidas en "
"el bosque."

