msgstr ""
"Las circunstancias te dejaron vagando por el mundo, solo. Ahora no hay nada "
"a lo que volver, aunque lo quisieras. Tal vez tu experiencia en valerte por "
"tí mismo te resulte útil en este nuevo mundo."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente"

#. ~ Description of profession "Survivor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Some would say that there's nothing particularly notable about you, but "
"you've survived, and that's more than most could say right now."
msgstr ""
"Algunos dirían que no hay nada particularmente notable en ti, pero has "
"sobrevivido, y eso es más de lo que la mayoría podría decir ahora mismo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente"

#. ~ Description of profession "Survivor" for female
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
