"condecorada. En el lado negativo, los años de trabajo de oficina han dejado "
"oxidadas tus habilidades de tiro, y todas las medallas del mundo no te "
"protegerán ahora."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Marine Infantryman"
msgstr "Soldado de Infantería Marina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Marine Infantryman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are one of the few and the proud: a member of the US Marine Corps.  Now "
"that military command has collapsed in on itself as far as you can tell, you"
" suppose that it falls to you to carry the memory of the Corps forward into "
"the future.  Semper fi."
msgstr ""
"Eres uno de los pocos y orgullosos miembros del US Marine Corps. Ahora que "
"el mando militar ha colapsado, que tu sepas, supones que en ti recae llevar "
"la memoria de los Corps adelante en el futuro. Semper fi."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Marine Infantrywoman"
msgstr "Soldado de Infantería Marina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Marine Infantrywoman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
