"that military command has collapsed in on itself as far as you can tell, you"
" suppose that it falls to you to carry the memory of the Corps forward into "
"the future.  Semper fi."
msgstr ""
"Eres una de los pocas y orgullosas miembros del US Marine Corps. Ahora que "
"el mando militar ha colapsado, que tu sepas, supones que en ti recae llevar "
"la memoria de los Corps adelante en el futuro. Semper fi."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Navy Sailor"
msgstr "Marino Naval"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Sailor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You’re a sailor of the US Navy, and spent the last few years working "
"shipside aboard an aircraft carrier.  Though you're trained in combat, "
"maintenance of the vessel has been your primary duty.  After some event "
"beyond your understanding, the carrier has become a floating graveyard in "
"the middle of nowhere.  This is going to take more than a cup of coffee and "
"a monkey wrench to fix."
msgstr ""
"Eres un marino de la US Navy, y has pasado los últimos años trabajando a "
"borde de un portaaviones. Aunque estas entrenado en combate, el "
"mantenimiento del barco ha sido tu función principal. Después de un evento "
"que se escapa a tu comprensión, el portaaviones se ha convertido en un "
"cementerio flotante en medio de la nada. Esto va a llevar mucho mas que un "
"vaso de café y una llave inglesa para arreglarlo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Navy Sailor"
msgstr "Marino Naval"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Sailor" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You’re a sailor of the US Navy, and spent the last few years working "
"shipside aboard an aircraft carrier.  Though you're trained in combat, "
"maintenance of the vessel has been your primary duty.  After some event "
"beyond your understanding, the carrier has become a floating graveyard in "
"the middle of nowhere.  This is going to take more than a cup of coffee and "
"a monkey wrench to fix."
msgstr ""
"Eres una marina de la US Navy, y has pasado los últimos años trabajando a "
"borde de un portaaviones. Aunque estas entrenado en combate, el "
"mantenimiento del barco ha sido tu función principal. Después de un evento "
"que se escapa a tu comprensión, el portaaviones se ha convertido en un "
"cementerio flotante en medio de la nada. Esto va a llevar mucho mas que un "
"vaso de café y una llave inglesa para arreglarlo."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Navy Diver"
msgstr "Buzo de Marina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a Naval Special Warfare diving group, a skilled soldier"
" adept at underwater infiltration and marine combat.  You were suiting up "
"for a practice dive when the aircraft carrier you were stationed on was "
"somehow flung from the Yellow Sea to who knows where.  You seem to be the "
"only one who survived with your sanity intact, but it's not safe to stay "
"here.  At least you're already dressed to abandon ship."
msgstr ""
"Eras un miembro de un grupo de buzos de la Naval Special Warfare, un soldado"
" adepto en infiltración subacuática y combate de abordaje. Te estabas "
"vistiendo para una práctica cuando el portaaviones en el que estabas "
"estacionado fue transportado del mar Amarillo a vete a saber donde. Pareces "
"ser el único que sobrevivió con su mente sana intacta, pero no es seguro "
"quedarse aquí. Por lo menos ya estas vestido para abandonar el barco."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Navy Diver"
msgstr "Buzo de Marina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a Naval Special Warfare diving group, a skilled soldier"
" adept at underwater infiltration and marine combat.  You were suiting up "
"for a practice dive when the aircraft carrier you were stationed on was "
"somehow flung from the Yellow Sea to who knows where.  You seem to be the "
"only one who survived with your sanity intact, but it's not safe to stay "
"here.  At least you're already dressed to abandon ship."
msgstr ""
"Eras un miembro de un grupo de buzos de la Naval Special Warfare, una "
"soldado adepta en infiltración subacuática y combate de abordaje. Te estabas"
" vistiendo para una práctica cuando el portaaviones en el que estabas "
"estacionado fue transportado del mar Amarillo a vete a saber donde. Pareces "
"ser la única que sobrevivió con su mente sana intacta, pero no es seguro "
"quedarse aquí. Por lo menos ya estas vestida para abandonar el barco."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Veteran"
msgstr "Militar Veterano"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After being discharged from the armed forces, you were sent to a veterans' "
"hospital for treatment.  Just when you thought you'd overcome your traumas "
"and readjusted to civilian life, the world has come to an end and your worst"
" nightmare has become a reality: life in an endless battlefield."
msgstr ""
"Después de haber sido dado de baja en las fuerzas armadas, fuiste enviado a "
"uno de los centros de veteranos para recibir tratamiento. Justo cuando "
"parecía que ibas a recuperarte de tus traumas de guerra y ajustarte a la "
"vida normal, el mundo se acabo y tu peor pesadilla se ha convertido en "
"realidad: vivir en un campo de batalla interminable."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Veteran"
msgstr "Militar Veterana"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After being discharged from the armed forces, you were sent to a veterans' "
"hospital for treatment.  Just when you thought you'd overcome your traumas "
"and readjusted to civilian life, the world has come to an end and your worst"
" nightmare has become a reality: life in an endless battlefield."
msgstr ""
