#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "Camionero"

#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Una vez gobernaste la carretera en tu gran camión. Cuando llegaron los "
"disturbios, te subiste y condujiste hasta un lugar seguro. Ahora sólo estas "
"tú y tu camión contra el mundo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "Camionera"

#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
