#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Computer Hacker"
msgstr "Hacker"

#. ~ Description of profession "Computer Hacker" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen made you an "
"expert at writing and cracking code.  The power's gone out, and suddenly "
"your elite skills seem significantly less useful.  At least there's no one "
"stopping you from your dream of breaking into a military mainframe now."
msgstr ""
"Las pastillas de cafeína y las noches enteras frente a la pantalla del "
"ordenador te han convertido en un experto en escribir y desensamblar código."
" Por desgracia, se ha ido la luz y, de repente, tus habilidades de élite "
"parecen mucho menos útiles. Al menos, ahora nadie te impide cumplir tu sueño"
" de entrar en un ordenador central militar."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Computer Hacker"
msgstr "Hacker"

#. ~ Description of profession "Computer Hacker" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
