msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Quadruple Amputee"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Quadruple Amputee" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost all of your limbs.  Since then, you"
" have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a relatively normal life with a bit of help.  What are you "
"going to do now that all the doctors are dead?"
msgstr ""

