"encontrar."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Holdout"
msgstr "Militar Rezagado"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Holdout" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You must have paid attention to your survival training in boot camp; "
"otherwise, you would never have lived long enough to outlast the chain of "
"command and find yourself in this predicament.  The only mission now is to "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"Debiste prestar atención a tu entrenamiento de supervivencia en el "
"campamento de principiantes; de lo contrario, nunca habrías vivido lo "
"suficiente como para sobrevivir a la cadena de mando y encontrarte en esta "
"situación. La única misión que queda ahora es sobrevivir."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Holdout"
msgstr "Militar Rezagada"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Holdout" for female
