"gamberros adolescentes y ladrones de poca monta. Tu formación laboral no te "
"proporcionó ninguna habilidad terriblemente útil, pero tienes tu fiel tazer,"
" tu porra y tu navaja."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Naturalist"
msgstr "Naturalista"

#. ~ Description of profession "Naturalist" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "naturalist" for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Over long years of self-imposed exile in the wilderness, you have come to an"
" understanding with Mother Nature.  The world as they knew it might have "
"ended for your forsaken species, but you can hardly tell the difference."
msgstr ""
"Durante largos años de exilio autoimpuesto en la naturaleza, has llegado a "
"un acuerdo con la Madre Naturaleza. Puede que el mundo, tal y como lo "
"conocías, haya terminado para tu especie abandonada, pero apenas puedes "
"notar la diferencia."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
