#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "Maestro"

#. ~ Description of profession "Teacher" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and "
"aggravation of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If zombies have any "
"interest in education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""
"Llevas toda la vida enseñando a los niños, experimentando la alegría y el "
"agobio de impartir conocimientos a las mentes jóvenes. Si los zombis tienen "
"algún interés en la educación, no lo demuestran."

