#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Relief Volunteer"
msgstr "Voluntario de Ayuda"

#. ~ Description of profession "Relief Volunteer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a nonprofit organization dedicated to helping out where"
" help was needed.  When the riots happened, you were eager to lend a hand.  "
"But you had to cut your plans short when everyone was less interested in "
"handouts, and more interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro de una organización sin ánimo de lucro que se dedicaba a ayudar"
" donde se necesitaba. Cuando se produjeron los disturbios, estabas deseando "
"echar una mano. Pero tuviste que interrumpir tus planes cuando todo el mundo"
" estaba menos interesado en las limosnas y más en comerte."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Relief Volunteer"
msgstr "Voluntario de Ayuda"

#. ~ Description of profession "Relief Volunteer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
