#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ninja"
msgstr "Ninja"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ninja" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are obsessed with the techniques and aesthetics of the ninja, so you "
"practiced your movements, dressed all in black, and spent big bucks to "
"acquire some tools of the trade.  Some may question your historical "
"authenticity, but you're perfectly happy living out your fantasy regardless."
msgstr ""
"Estas obsesionado con las técnicas y la estética del ninja, así que has "
"practicado movimientos, vestido totalmente de negro y gastado mucho dinero "
"en comprar herramientas para el trabajo. Algunos podrían cuestionar tu "
"autenticidad histórica, pero eres feliz viviendo tu fantasía de todas "
"formas."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Kunoichi"
msgstr "Kunoichi"

#. ~ Description of profession "Kunoichi" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
