#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ship Captain"
msgstr "Capitán de Barco"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ship Captain" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the captain of your small ship, making a living by ferrying divers "
"and tourists across the waves.  The last excursion went bad after your "
"passengers tried to mutiny, but you managed to escape.  Will you ever sail "
"the open ocean again?"
msgstr ""
"Eras el capitán de tu pequeño barco y te ganabas la vida llevando a "
"buceadores y turistas por el mar. La última excursión salió mal después de "
"que tus pasajeros intentaran un motín, pero lograste escapar con tu precioso"
" barco intacto. ¿Volverás algún día a navegar en medio del océano?"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Ship Captain"
msgstr "Capitana de Barco"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ship Captain" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
