"al campo de tiro hayan mantenido tus habilidades afiladas."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Urban Explorer"
msgstr "Explorador Urbano"

#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Explorer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always admired the beauty of urban desolation, and were ready for "
"your next excursion when the end of the world hit.  You suppose that pretty "
"much every building could be considered abandoned now."
msgstr ""
"Siempre admiraste la belleza de la desolación urbana, y estabas preparado "
"para tu próximo viaje a la ciudad cuando llego el fin del mundo. Ahora "
"supones que casi cualquier edificio se puede considerar abandonado."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Urban Explorer"
msgstr "Exploradora Urbana"

#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Explorer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've always admired the beauty of urban desolation, and were ready for "
"your next excursion when the end of the world hit.  You suppose that pretty "
"much every building could be considered abandoned now."
msgstr ""
"Siempre admiraste la belleza de la desolación urbana, y estabas preparada "
"para tu próximo viaje a la ciudad cuando llego el fin del mundo. Ahora "
"supones que casi cualquier edificio se puede considerar abandonado."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Office Worker"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Office Worker" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You felt years of your life being sapped away, slaving at your computer as "
"you subsisted on a daily pot of coffee, microwave burritos and an endless "
"supply of crumpled paper to toss.  Perhaps the Cataclysm is a refreshing "
"change of pace…"
msgstr ""
"Sentiste cómo se te iban años de tu vida, esclavizado frente a tu ordenador "
"mientras subsistías con una taza diaria de café, burritos de microondas y un"
" suministro interminable de papel arrugado para tirar. Tal vez el Cataclismo"
" sea un cambio refrescante de ritmo..."

