msgid "Challenge - Trans-Coast Logistics Concourse"
msgstr "Desafío - Vestíbulo de Trans-Coast Logistics"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Trans-Coast Logistics Concourse" for
#. male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the"
" facility's evacuation.  You'd better find your lanyard with your badge "
"before the automated defenses notice that you don't have one."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste considerado un empleado esencial y se te exigió que te quedaras "
"durante la evacuación de las instalaciones. Será mejor que encuentres tu "
"collar con tu credencial extraviado antes de que las defensas automáticas se"
" den cuenta de que no lo tienes."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Trans-Coast Logistics Concourse" for
#. female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
