msgid ""
"You were trying to scavenge for supplies, and now some rough group of "
"bandits has dragged monsters in with them where you were hiding!"
msgstr ""
"Estabas intentando rebuscar suministros, ¡y ahora un grupo de rudos bandidos"
" ha arrastrado monstruos hasta el sitio donde te escondías!"

