#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Blackpowder fouling"
msgstr "La suciedad de la pólvora negra"

#. ~ Description of fault "Blackpowder fouling"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid ""
"Firing blackpowder loads from a gun fouls it, which reduces reliability and,"
" if left uncleaned, leads to rust.  It fouls the gun much faster than the "
"use of modern smokeless powder cartridges.  Fouling is only a significant "
"impact on reliability at high levels, but black powder fouling accumulates "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"Disparar cargas de pólvora negra de un arma la ensucia, lo que reduce la "
"fiabilidad y, si se deja sin limpiar, conduce a la oxidación. Ensucia el "
"arma mucho más rápido que el uso de los modernos cartuchos de pólvora sin "
"humo. El ensuciamiento sólo tiene un impacto significativo en la fiabilidad "
"a altos niveles, pero el ensuciamiento de la pólvora negra se acumula "
"rápidamente."

#. ~ Prefix for item's name "Blackpowder fouling"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "rusting"
msgstr "oxidación"

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Spent casing in chamber"
msgstr "Casquillo gastado en la camara"

#. ~ Description of fault "Spent casing in chamber"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid ""
"This gun currently has an empty casing chambered.  It will have to be "
"removed before firing."
msgstr ""
"Esta pistola tiene actualmente un casquillo vacío en la cámara. Tendrá que "
"ser retirada antes de disparar."

#. ~ Prefix for item's name "Spent casing in chamber"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "jammed"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Unlubricated"
msgstr "Sin lubricación"

#. ~ Description of fault "Unlubricated"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid ""
"Either this gun is brand new and came without lubrication or it was recently"
" cleaned with a solvent without oiling afterwards.  Either way, it's not "
"lubricated and will not cycle properly, and can even be damaged."
msgstr ""
"O bien esta pistola es nueva y vino sin lubricación o fue limpiada "
"recientemente con un disolvente sin aceite después. De cualquier manera, no "
"está lubricada y no funcionará correctamente, e incluso puede ser dañada."

#. ~ Prefix for item's name "Unlubricated"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "unlubricated"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid "Fouling"
msgstr "Ensuciamiento"

#. ~ Description of fault "Fouling"
#: data/json/faults/faults_guns.json
msgid ""
"Fouling is caused by firing gunpowder loads repeatedly, which reduces "
"reliability and can eventually cause damage to the gun.  Fouling accumulates"
" slowly (unless blackpowder is used) due to the design of modern smokeless "
"powder found in the vast majority of retail cartridges and it is not a "
"significant problem until high levels of fouling are reached due to firing "
"thousands of rounds without cleaning your firearm."
msgstr ""
"El suciedad se produce al disparar cargas de pólvora repetidamente, lo que "
"reduce la fiabilidad y puede llegar a causar daños en el arma. El "
"ensuciamiento se acumula lentamente (a menos que se utilice la pólvora "
"negra) debido al diseño de la moderna pólvora sin humo que se encuentra en "
"la gran mayoría de los cartuchos de venta al por menor y no es un problema "
"significativo hasta que se alcanzan altos niveles de suciedad debido a que "
"se disparan miles de cartuchos sin limpiar el arma de fuego."

