msgid "catalytic cracking reactor"
msgid_plural "catalytic cracking reactors"
msgstr[0] "reactor de craqueo catalítico"
msgstr[1] "reactor de craqueo catalítico"
msgstr[2] "reactor de craqueo catalítico"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "catalytic cracking reactor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift extraction system, or as makeshift as you can consider something"
" that was purpose-built in a laboratory by a group of experts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
