#. ~ Description of "disconnected refrigerator"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected household refrigerator.  If connected to a power source, it "
"will cool its contents to extend the time before they spoil."
msgstr ""
"Una nevera casera desconectada. Si se conecta a la corriente, enfriara el "
"contenido hasta cierto punto antes de pudrirse."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected glass door refrigerator"
msgid_plural "disconnected glass door refrigerators"
msgstr[0] "refrigerador con puerta de cristal desconectado"
msgstr[1] "refrigeradores con puerta de cristal desconectados"
msgstr[2] "refrigeradores con puerta de cristal desconectados"

#. ~ Description of "disconnected glass door refrigerator"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial refrigerator with a glass door.  If connected to a"
" power source, it will cool its contents to extend the time before they "
"spoil."
msgstr ""
"Un refrigerador comercial con puerta de cristal desconectado. Si se conecta "
"a una fuente de corriente, enfriada el contenido para extender la caducidad "
"antes de pudrirse."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected freezer"
msgid_plural "disconnected freezers"
msgstr[0] "congelador desconectado"
msgstr[1] "congeladores desconectados"
msgstr[2] "congeladores desconectados"

#. ~ Description of "disconnected freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected chest freezer.  If connected to a power source, it will "
"freeze and preserve its contents."
msgstr ""
"Un congelador desconectado. Si se conecta a la corriente, congelara y "
"preservara el contenido."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected oven"
msgid_plural "disconnected ovens"
msgstr[0] "horno desconectado"
msgstr[1] "hornos desconectados"
msgstr[2] "hornos desconectados"

#. ~ Description of "disconnected oven"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected electric convection-based oven, commonly used for heating and"
" cooking food.  Plug it into a vehicle or power grid to get cooking."
msgstr ""
"Un horno eléctrico desconectado basado en convección, comúnmente utilizado "
"para calentar y cocinar alimentos. Conectalo a un vehículo o red eléctrica "
"para empezar a cocinar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected large water purifier"
msgid_plural "disconnected large water purifiers"
msgstr[0] "purificador de agua grande desconectado"
msgstr[1] "purificadores de agua grandes desconectados"
msgstr[2] "purificadores de agua grandes desconectados"

#. ~ Description of "disconnected large water purifier"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A device that effectively sterilizes water, but it doesn't take batteries.  "
"You'll need to connect it to a power source."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo que esteriliza agua de manera efectiva, pero no  usa "
"baterías. Necesitaras conectarlo a la corriente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected arcade machine"
msgid_plural "disconnected arcade machines"
msgstr[0] "máquina arcade desconectada"
msgstr[1] "máquinas arcade desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "máquinas arcade desconectadas"

#. ~ Description of "disconnected arcade machine"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A bulky upright arcade cabinet, brightly painted and slightly worn with age."
"  Ready to be plugged in and played."
msgstr ""
"Un voluminoso armario arcade vertical, pintado de forma brillante y "
"ligeramente desgastado por el paso del tiempo. Listo para ser enchufado y "
"jugar."

#. ~ Based off JET J-2500 Drill Press
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected drill press"
msgid_plural "disconnected drill presses"
msgstr[0] "prensa de taladro desconectada"
msgstr[1] "prensas de taladro desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "prensas de taladro desconectadas"

#. ~ Based off JET J-2500 Drill Press
#. ~ Description of "disconnected drill press"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  "
"Useful in all kinds of projects, from industrial fabrication to home "
"woodworking.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Un potente taladro montado sobre una corredera que le permite descender con "
"precisión. Útil en todo tipo de proyectos, desde la fabricación industrial "
"hasta la carpintería doméstica. Se puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de "
"alimentación."

#. ~ Based off Powermatic PM1000 Table Saw
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected table saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected table saws"
msgstr[0] "sierra de mesa desconectada"
msgstr[1] "sierras de mesa desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "sierras de mesa desconectadas"

#. ~ Based off Powermatic PM1000 Table Saw
#. ~ Description of "disconnected table saw"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A rotating sawblade set into a large, flat table.  Used for making straight,"
" measured cuts, it's a key tool in any carpenter's arsenal.  Needs to be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra giratoria colocada en una gran mesa plana, para realizar "
"cortes rectos medidos, una herramienta clave en el arsenal de cualquier "
"carpintero. Se puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Based off DEWALT 12-Inch Sliding Compound Miter Saw
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected mitre saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected mitre saws"
msgstr[0] "sierra de inglete desconectada"
msgstr[1] "sierras de inglete desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "sierras de inglete desconectadas"

#. ~ Based off DEWALT 12-Inch Sliding Compound Miter Saw
#. ~ Description of "disconnected mitre saw"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A circular sawblade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several "
"directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry.  Needs to be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra circular en un brazo que puede deslizarse y girar en "
"varias direcciones, es una herramienta básica para casi cualquier "
"carpintería. Se puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Based off JET JWBS-18-3 Woodworking Band Saw
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "disconnected band saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected band saws"
msgstr[0] "sierra de cinta desconectada"
msgstr[1] "sierras de cinta desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "sierras de cinta desconectadas"

#. ~ Based off JET JWBS-18-3 Woodworking Band Saw
#. ~ Description of "disconnected band saw"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A ribbonlike sawblade runs in a single direction in this tool, allowing "
"precise cuts at almost any angle.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a "
"power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra en forma de cinta se desplaza en una sola dirección en "
"esta herramienta, permitiendo cortes precisos en casi cualquier ángulo. Se "
"puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Based off Powermatic TS29 Shaper.  TODO: When support for multi-tile
