#. ~ Description of "military parachute"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"This is a big, bulky military-level parachute, designed to slow the fall of "
"up to a thousand kilograms of cargo dropped from an aircraft.  You have no "
"clue how to put all the straps back in their place."
msgstr ""

