#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This is a heavy and bulky 40x48-inch palette."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "training dummy"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  "
"This one is made from wood and it some duct tape to mark the striking "
"points.  You need to embed it into the ground for training."
msgstr ""
"Una figura humanoide hecha a mano, útil para entrenar el combate de "
"proximidad. Está hecha de madera y tiene cinta americana para marcar los "
"puntos de golpe. Hay que empotrarla en el suelo para entrenar."

#. ~ Description of "armored training dummy"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  "
"This one is covered in scrap armor and looks on guard.  You need to embed it"
" into the ground for training."
msgstr ""
"Una figura humanoide hecha a mano, útil para entrenar el combate cuerpo a "
"cuerpo. Ésta está cubierta con una armadura de chatarra y parece estar en "
"guardia. Hay que empotrarla en el suelo para entrenar."

#. ~ Description of "box archery target"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A soft target for archery, consisting of tightly-packed cloth stuffed into a"
" cardboard box, with a bullseye marked on the front.  Must be set up to use."
msgstr ""
"Una diana blanda para el tiro con arco que consiste en una tela apretada "
"metida en una caja de cartón, con una diana marcada en la parte delantera. "
"Hay que prepararla para usarla."

