#. ~ Description of ".50 Beowulf Xtreme Penetrator"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50_beowulf.json
msgid ""
".50-caliber Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a solid-copper 420-grain Xtreme "
"Penetrator bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- to medium-range "
"chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had gained some "
"popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  With a blunt nose "
"construction for better initial energy transfer, this 12.7mm-wide bullet’s "
"solid copper design allows it to punch through entry barriers while "
"resulting in a larger wound column."
msgstr ""
"Munición calibre .50 Beowulf, cargada con una bala de punta de cobre sólida "
"de 25.2 gramos eXtreme Penetrator. Desarrollada en 2001 como un cartucho "
"poderoso a corto y medio alcance para rifles estilo AR-15, este robusto "
"cartucho fue algo popular para deporte antes del Cataclismo. Con una "
"construcción de punta plana para mejor transferencia de la energía, su "
"diseño de bala de cobre de 12.7mm de ancho permite perforar barreras "
"produciendo una herida mas larga."

