"edge replacement of its day.  Hinges within the fingers and a simple locking"
" system allow basic function of this prosthetic, such as holding a sword.  "
"Often given to knights and nobility, this arm is quite heavy, but extremely "
"durable.  This one is for the left arm."
msgstr ""

