#. ~ Description of "padded gambeson"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid ""
"A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting readily available fabric and "
"stuffing the layers with waste fabric or horse hair that was intended as "
"standalone armor, being too thick to comfortably fit a cuirass over.  Likely"
" either a historical artifact or a low-quality reproduction.  Though "
"inferior to a proper layered aketon or gambeson it still offers decent "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"Una gran cota acolchada ensamblada acolchando tejido disponible y rellenando"
" las capas con restos de tejido o pelo de caballo que se usaba como armadura"
" en solitario, demasiado gruesa para poner una coraza encima. Seguramente un"
" artefacto histórico o una reproducción de baja calidad. Aunque es inferior "
"a una chaqueta o gambesón ofrece una protección decente."

