#. ~ Description of "wolf skull helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid ""
"The top part of a large wolf skull, equipped with leather straps to secure "
"it on your head.  Every inch of the skull has been carved with a maze of "
"fine, intertwined symbols that make your eyes water."
