#. ~ The weight assumes one large sheet of about 75cm x 40cm x 1.5mm and one
#. circular sheet with a diameter of 24cm as the crown, and one gambeson hood.
#. ~ Description of "sheet metal great helm"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
msgid ""
"Massively heavy, extremely uncomfortable, very crude, and looks like a "
"bucket with a slit cut out the front, but it'll keep zombie claws off your "
"face.  Comes with a bevor to help spread the weight out onto your shoulders "
"and protect your neck, and some cloth padding to keep your bell from being "
"rung."
msgstr ""
"Es enormemente pesado, extremadamente incómodo, muy rudimentario y parece un"
" balde con una ranura adelante, PERO evitará que las garras de los zombis te"
" toquen la cara. Incluye una babera que ayuda a esparcir su peso en los "
"hombros y proteger el cuello, y un poco de relleno de tela para evitar que "
"te resuene la cabeza."

