#. ~ Description of "heavy combat exoskeleton (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"Colloquially known as a 'tank suit' in the media, these bulky exoskeletons, "
"covered in thick segmented armor plates, were tested in military service a "
"few years back and determined to be too heavy and expensive for regular use."
"  Now that it's in your hands, though, you have a massive suit of power "
"armor capable of resisting almost any small arms fire and most other forms "
"of attack.  On the other hand, it doubles your effective weight, and it's "
"almost impossible not to bump into things.  There is an integrated chemical-"
"resistant bodyglove that precludes wearing other clothing.  It is turned on "
"and continually drawing power.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Conocido coloquialmente como \"traje de tanque\" en los medios de "
"comunicación, estos voluminosos exoesqueletos, cubiertos de gruesas placas "
"de blindaje segmentadas, se probaron en el servicio militar hace unos años y"
" se determinó que eran demasiado pesados y caros para su uso habitual. Sin "
"embargo, ahora que está en tus manos, tienes una enorme armadura de energía "
"capaz de resistir casi cualquier fuego de armas pequeñas y la mayoría de "
"otras formas de ataque. Por otro lado, duplica tu peso efectivo, y es casi "
"imposible no chocar con las cosas. Hay un guante corporal integrado "
"resistente a los productos químicos que impide llevar otra ropa. Se enciende"
" y consume continuamente energía. Usar para apagar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "environmental combat helmet"
msgid_plural "environmental combat helmets"
msgstr[0] "casco de combate ambiental"
msgstr[1] "cascos de combate ambiental"
msgstr[2] "cascos de combate ambiental"

#. ~ Description of "environmental combat helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A fully enclosed combat helmet for hazardous environments, this was designed"
" to fit with a powered exoskeleton, using cameras to expand visual range.  "
"In practice, the cameras were unreliable and easily fouled.  The "
"environmental controls function best with direct-skin contact."
msgstr ""
"Un casco de combate totalmente cerrado para entornos peligrosos, diseñado "
"para acoplarse a un exoesqueleto motorizado, que utiliza cámaras para "
"ampliar el alcance visual. En la práctica, las cámaras eran poco fiables y "
"se ensuciaban con facilidad. Los controles ambientales funcionan mejor con "
"contacto directo con la piel."

