#. the closest approx. (canvas is always waterproofed and these suits are not)
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "canine bite suit"
msgid_plural "canine bite suits"
msgstr[0] "traje de mordida canina"
msgstr[1] "trajes de mordida canina"
msgstr[2] "trajes de mordida canina"

#. ~ real bite suits are made with linen, but we don't have linen, so denim is
#. the closest approx. (canvas is always waterproofed and these suits are not)
#. ~ Description of "canine bite suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Designed to stop the injuries of dog bites, this thick, one piece suit is "
"often used in the rehabilitation of abused animals and in training dogs by "
"the police and military.  A base layer of aramid fabric has had strips of "
"soft body armor sewn into it to mimic quilting, and to soften the blunt of "
"animals jumping, slashing, or pouncing on the wearer."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para detener las heridas por mordeduras de perro, este grueso traje"
" de una pieza es a menudo usado en la rehabilitación de animales maltratados"
" y el entrenamiento de perros por la policía y los militares. Una capa base "
"de tejido de aramida que contiene tiras de armadura suave cosida para "
"parecer acolchado, y para ablandar el impacto de animales saltando, "
"desgarrando o punzando al portador."

