msgid_plural "copies of the Helliand"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Helliand"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid ""
"A English translation of the Helliand, an Old Saxon epic poem that narrates "
"the life and Passion of Jesus Christ.  It begins with the Annunciation to "
"the Virgin Mary and continues with the birth of Jesus.  It then narrates the"
" story of Jesus’s childhood, his baptism by John the Baptist, and his public"
" ministry.  This poem also includes various miracles performed by Jesus, "
"such as healing the sick, raising the dead, and calming the storm.."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
