msgid_plural "copies of 'Some Answered Questions'"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "'Some Answered Questions'"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid ""
"A hardcover book containing a collection of transcriptions of table talks "
"given by ‘Abdu’l‑Bahá in ‘Akká between 1904 and 1906 in response to "
"questions posed by Laura Dreyfus-Barney, an American Bahá’í resident in "
"Paris, and first published in 1908.  This book provides clarity, guidance, "
"and understanding to Baha’is and those seeking to learn more about the "
"religion."
msgstr ""

