"A handful of lucky gastropods that have been prepared for cooking by "
"repeatedly boiling and washing them to remove their mucus and pathogens."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de gasterópodos afortunados que han sido preparados para su "
"cocción hirviéndolos y lavándolos repetidamente para eliminar sus "
"mucosidades y patógenos."

