msgstr[2] "carne cocinada"

#. ~ Description of "cooked meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of cooked meat.  It's filling and nutritious, but unseasoned and a "
"bit bland."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de carne cocida. Es saciante y nutritivo, pero sin condimentar y un"
" poco soso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked pepper meat"
msgid_plural "cooked pepper meat"
msgstr[0] "carne de pimiento cocinada"
msgstr[1] "carne de pimiento cocinada"
msgstr[2] "carne de pimiento cocinada"

#. ~ Description of "cooked pepper meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A piece of cooked meat, properly seasoned with black pepper and salt.  It's "
"nutritious, yet basic seasoning adds a welcoming taste to this simple dish."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de carne cocinada, apropiadamente sazonada con pimienta negra y "
"sal. Es nutritiva, aunque sazonarla añade una sabrosa bienvenida a un simple"
" plato."

#. ~ Luxury good.
#. ~ Item name
