msgstr[1] "achuras en escabeche"
msgstr[2] "achuras en escabeche"

#. ~ Description of "pickled offal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A mass of entrails and organ meat, preserved in brine.  Packed with "
"essential vitamins, and although it looks like a lab specimen, it actually "
"tastes pretty palatable."
msgstr ""
"Una masa de vísceras y carne de órganos, conservada en salmuera. Repleta de "
"vitaminas esenciales, y aunque parece un espécimen de laboratorio, su sabor "
"es bastante agradable."

#. ~ Item name
