"An alcohol-free mixed drink made from grenadine syrup and lemon-lime soda, "
"lemonade or orange juice."
msgstr ""
"Un combinado sin alcohol hecho con granadina y gaseosa de lima limón, "
"limonada o jugo de naranja."

