msgstr[2] "Tarros de vidrio de 0,5L"

#. ~ Description of "0.5L glass jar"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A half-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  "
"Preserves its contents from rot until opened (assuming it was sterile before"
" sealing)."
msgstr ""
"Un tarro de vidrio de medio litro con una tapa metálica de rosca, usado para"
" enlatar. Preserva el contenido de la putrefacción hasta su apertura. "
"(asumiendo que fuera estéril antes de sellarlo)."

