#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid "RM228 PDW"
msgid_plural "RM228 PDWs"
msgstr[0] "RM228 PDW"
msgstr[1] "RM228 PDW"
msgstr[2] "RM228 PDW"

#. ~ Description of gun "RM228 PDW"
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid ""
"Chambering the powerful 20x66mm caseless shotgun cartridge, the Rivtech "
"RM228 PDW was designed for the civilian personal defense market with "
"durability and ease of use as priorities.  While lauded for its small size "
"and light weight, its hefty price tag kept it out of the reach of casual "
"collectors."
msgstr ""
"Utilizando el poderoso cartucho de escopeta 20x66mm sin casquillo, la "
"Rivtech RM228 PDW fue diseñada para el mercado de defensa personal civil con"
" la durabilidad y la facilidad de uso como prioridades. Aunque elogiada por "
"su pequeño tamaño y peso ligero, su elevado precio la mantuvo fuera del "
"alcance de los coleccionistas ocasionales."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ".22 caliber submachine gun"
msgid_plural ".22 caliber submachine guns"
msgstr[0] "subfusil calibre .22"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles calibre .22"
msgstr[2] "subfusiles calibre .22"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 caliber submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A dramatically uncommon automatic weapon, making use of high-capacity pan "
"magazines and firing the low power .22 calibre cartridge: an unusual "
"ammunition choice for a submachine gun.  With negligible recoil on account "
"of its modest cartridge and a suppressively high rate of fire, a burst of "
".22 LR rounds from this little machine gun can be best likened with a swarm "
"of hornets… an incredibly angry swarm of hornets."
msgstr ""
"Un arma automática dramáticamente poco común, que usa cargadores planos de "
"alta capacidad y que dispara el cartucho de poco empuje calibre .22: una "
"elección de munición inusual para un subfusil. Con poco retroceso debido a "
"su modesta cartucho y con una elevada cadencia de disparo, una ráfaga de "
"balas .22 LR de esta pequeña ametralladora se podría comparar con un "
"enjambre de avispas... un enjambre de avispas increíblemente cabreadas."

#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 caliber submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "American-180"
msgid_plural "American-180"
msgstr[0] "American-180"
msgstr[1] "American-180"
msgstr[2] "American-180"

#. ~ Description of variant ".22 caliber submachine gun" of gun "American-180"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The American-180 is a submachine gun developed in the 1960s that fires .22 "
"LR, unusual for an SMG.  Though the round is low-powered, the high rate of "
"fire and large magazine makes the 180 a formidable weapon."
msgstr ""
"El American-180 es un subfusil desarrollado en la década de 1960. Dispara "
"munición calibre .22 LR, lo que es inusual para un subfusil. Aunque esa bala"
" es de bajo poder, el ritmo alto de disparo y el cargador grande hace que el"
" 180 sea un arma formidable."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
msgid "small game rifle"
msgid_plural "small game rifles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "small game rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A venerable .22 caliber lever-action rifle, with a 19-round tube magazine "
"and a classic design that dates back over a century.  Generally used for the"
" hunting of small game like rabbits, the strict taxonomic classification of "
"zombies as 'small game' is debatable, but this decades-old weapon can still "
"be counted upon to help manage the undead population."
msgstr ""
"Un venerable rifle de palanca calibre .22, con un cargador de tubo de 19 "
"balas y un diseño clásico desde hace una centuria. Generalmente usado para "
"la caza menor de conejos, la estricta clasificación taxonómica de los zombis"
" como 'caza menor' es debatible, pero este arma con décadas de antigüedad "
"todavía sirve para manejar la población no muerta."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "small game rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Marlin 39A"
msgid_plural "Marlin 39A"
msgstr[0] "Marlin 39A"
msgstr[1] "Marlin 39A"
msgstr[2] "Marlin 39A"

#. ~ Description of variant "small game rifle" of gun "Marlin 39A"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The oldest and longest-produced shoulder firearm in the world.  Though it "
"fires the weak .22 round, it is highly accurate and damaging, and has "
"essentially no recoil."
msgstr ""
"La más antigua y más producida de las armas de fuego del mundo. Aunque "
"dispara el débil calibre .22, es muy precisas y hace mucho daño, y casi que "
"no posee retroceso."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ".22 deringer pistol"
msgid_plural ".22 deringer pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola deringer calibre .22"
msgstr[1] "pistolas deringer calibre .22"
msgstr[2] "pistolas deringer calibre .22"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 deringer pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A four barreled, adorably tiny pocket pistol, firing the equally minuscule "
".22 LR cartridge.  Produced in the early 20th century for trappers, its "
"combat effectiveness is questionable to say the least."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 deringer pistol"
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
