#: data/json/items/gun/45.json data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
#: data/json/items/gun/9x18.json
msgid ""
"A home-made rifle.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer "
"to strike the single round it holds."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle hecho en casa. Es simplemente un tubo con una culata y un percutor "
"para golpear la bala que contiene."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight and modular pistol caliber hunting carbine, firing the low "
"power .22 LR cartridge.  Before the Cataclysm, a mix of high "
"customizability, cheap ammunition, and low recoil made this a very popular "
"varmint rifle amongst civilian shooters."
msgstr ""
"Una carabina de caza ligera y modular con calibre de pistola, que dispara el"
" cartucho con poco empuje calibre .22 LR. Antes del Cataclismo, una mezcla "
"de personalización, munición barata y bajo retroceso hizo que este rifle de "
"caza menor fuera muy popular entre los tiradores civiles."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger 10/22"
msgid_plural "Ruger 10/22"
msgstr[0] "Ruger 10/22"
msgstr[1] "Ruger 10/22"
msgstr[2] "Ruger 10/22"

#. ~ Description of variant "varmint rifle" of gun "Ruger 10/22"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A combination of negligible recoil, high customization, and inexpensive "
"ammunition made the Ruger 10/22 a popular choice among enthusiasts and small"
" game hunters.  Even though it fires the weak .22 round, it's perfectly "
"capable of killing."
msgstr ""
"La combinación de un retroceso insignificante, mucha personalización y "
"munición barata, hace del Ruger 10/22 una elección popular entre los "
"entusiastas y los cazadores de animales pequeños. Aunque dispara el débil "
"calibre .22, es perfectamente capaz de matar."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ".22 caliber revolver"
msgid_plural ".22 caliber revolvers"
msgstr[0] "revólver calibre .22"
msgstr[1] "revólveres calibre .22"
msgstr[2] "revólveres calibre .22"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 caliber revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A comparatively dainty revolver, chambered for 8 tiny rounds of .22 LR."
msgstr ""
"Un revolver comparativamente delicado, con recamara para 8 pequeños "
"cartuchos .22 LR."

#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 caliber revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger LCR .22"
msgid_plural "Ruger LCR .22"
msgstr[0] "Ruger LCR .22"
msgstr[1] "Ruger LCR .22"
msgstr[2] "Ruger LCR .22"

#. ~ Description of variant ".22 caliber revolver" of gun "Ruger LCR .22"
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger LCR .38"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"A compact, double-action-only revolver designed for easy concealment, with a"
" stainless steel cylinder and aluminum frame."
msgstr ""
"Un revólver compacto de doble acción, diseñado para ser fácil de ocultar, "
"con cilindro de acero inoxidable y estructura de aluminio."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "SIG training pistol"
msgid_plural "SIG training pistols"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "SIG training pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "SIG training pistol" of gun "SIG Mosquito"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A medium sized, .22 caliber semi-automatic pistol, for training with a "
"pistol similar to more powerful pistols.  Built from aluminum and polymer "
"components, the weapon is lightweight and concealable, but its chambering is"
" not very powerful."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of gun "SIG training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "SIG Mosquito"
msgid_plural "SIG Mosquito"
msgstr[0] "SIG Mosquito"
msgstr[1] "SIG Mosquito"
msgstr[2] "SIG Mosquito"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "S&W target pistol"
msgid_plural "S&W target pistols"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "S&W target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A modest offering from the Smith and Wesson (S&W) gun company, this is a "
"medium sized pistol that fires the .22 LR cartridge.  Featuring an "
"integrated rail for optics mounting, it was a popular .22 handgun amongst "
"shooters of the low-power cartridge."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of gun "S&W target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "S&W 22A"
msgid_plural "S&W 22A"
msgstr[0] "S&W 22A"
msgstr[1] "S&W 22A"
msgstr[2] "S&W 22A"

#. ~ Description of variant "S&W target pistol" of gun "S&W 22A"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A modest offering from the Smith and Wesson (S&W) gun company, this is a "
"medium sized pistol that fires the .22 LR cartridge.  Featuring an "
"integrated rail for optics mounting, it was a popular .22 handgun amongst "
"target shooters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "cheap .22 caliber pistol"
msgid_plural "cheap .22 caliber pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola barata calibre .22"
msgstr[1] "pistolas baratas calibre .22"
msgstr[2] "pistolas baratas calibre .22"

#. ~ Description of gun "cheap .22 caliber pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"Made from only the cheapest of budget metals, firing one of the weakest "
"cartridges, and having a hearty laugh at the concept of user safety, this "
".22 caliber pocket pistol is of questionable utility at best.  Affordably "
"priced before the Cataclysm, the pistol’s price point was arguably its only "
"positive element, an element which pertains zero bearing on your current "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"Fabricada con los metales mas baratos, disparando el cartucho mas débil y "
"con una gran sonrisa ante el concepto de seguridad del usuario, esta pistola"
" de bolsillo calibre .22 es como mucho de una utilidad cuestionable. Su "
"precio asequible antes del Cataclismo era su mejor elemento positivo, un "
"elemento que tiende a cero teniendo en cuenta tu situación actual."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "cheap .22 caliber pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Jennings J-22"
msgid_plural "Jennings J-22s"
msgstr[0] "Jennings J-22"
msgstr[1] "Jennings J-22s"
msgstr[2] "Jennings J-22s"

#. ~ Description of variant "cheap .22 caliber pistol" of gun "Jennings J-22"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"One of the quintessential 'Saturday night specials', the Jennings J-22 was "
"very affordably priced with its injection-molded zinc slide and frame.  "
"Intended to fill the void left after small pocket pistols were banned from "
"import, these were more commonly used by criminals unfazed by their glaring "
"safety issues."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los \"especiales del sábado por la noche\" por excelencia, el "
"Jennings J-22 tenía un precio muy asequible con su tobogán y marco de zinc "
"moldeado por inyección.  Con la intención de llenar el vacío dejado por las "
"pistolas de bolsillo prohibidas para la importación, estas fueron usadas más"
" comúnmente por criminales que no se preocupaban por sus evidentes problemas"
" de seguridad."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Walther training pistol"
msgid_plural "Walther training pistols"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Walther training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A dainty training pistol offered by the Walther Arms company, making use of "
"the .22 LR cartridge, for training on a pistol very similar to more powerful"
" pistols."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Walther training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Walther P22"
msgid_plural "Walther P22s"
msgstr[0] "Walther P22"
msgstr[1] "Walther P22s"
msgstr[2] "Walther P22s"

#. ~ Description of variant "Walther training pistol" of gun "Walther P22"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The Walther P22 is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol intended for "
"training with a platform very similar to more defensive handguns.  It is "
"about half the size of most Walthers.  It is made mostly with plastic, with "
"the slide and key components (other than the barrel) being made of die-cast "
"zinc alloy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "AR-15"
msgid_plural "AR-15s"
msgstr[0] "AR-15"
msgstr[1] "AR-15s"
msgstr[2] "AR-15s"

#. ~ Description of gun "AR-15"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"This ubiquitous rifle is the forefather of the M16 rifle series.  It is "
"lightweight and accurate, but will malfunction if not properly maintained.  "
"This one is a semi-automatic civilian version."
msgstr ""
"Este ubicuo rifle es el antepasado de la serie de rifles M16. Es liviano y "
"preciso, pero puede fallar si no es mantenido en buenas condiciones. Este es"
" la versión civil semiautomática."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "AR pistol"
msgid_plural "AR pistols"
msgstr[0] "Pistola AR"
msgstr[1] "Pistolas AR"
msgstr[2] "Pistolas AR"

#. ~ Description of gun "AR pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A compact, 7.5 inch barrel version of the classic AR-15 design, commercially"
" marketed as a home defense weapon."
msgstr ""
"Una versión compacta con cañón de 7.5 pulgadas del diseño clásico del AR-15,"
" comercializada como arma de defensa doméstica."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "Rifle caliber pistol"
msgid_plural "Rifle caliber pistols"
msgstr[0] "Pistola con calibre de rifle"
msgstr[1] "Pistolas con calibre de rifle"
msgstr[2] "Pistolas con calibre de rifle"

#. ~ Description of gun "Rifle caliber pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol chambered in 5.56x45, using a gas piston to "
"reduce length and a frame constructed from reinforced polymer to make it "
"both durable and light-weight.  This one comes with a plastic handguard."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pistola semiautomática con recamara 5.56x45, usando un pistón a "
"gas para reducir tamaño a lo largo y un armazón construido con polímeros "
"reforzados para hacerla durable y ligera. Esta viene con una funda de "
"plástico."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Rifle caliber pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "Kel-Tec PLR16"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec PLR16"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Rifle caliber pistol" of gun "Kel-Tec PLR16"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol chambered in 5.56 NATO, using a gas piston "
"to reduce length and a frame constructed from reinforced polymer to make it "
"both durable and light-weight.  This one comes with a plastic handguard."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pistola semiautomática con recamara 5.56 NATO, usando un pistón "
"a gas para reducir tamaño a lo largo y un armazón construido con polímeros "
"reforzados para hacerla durable y ligera. Esta viene con una funda de "
"plástico."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "MAS .223"
msgid_plural "MAS .223"
msgstr[0] "MAS .223"
msgstr[1] "MAS .223"
msgstr[2] "MAS .223"

#. ~ Description of gun "MAS .223"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A bullpup assault rifle that was used by French armed forces only until "
"recently.  While the FAMAS was famous for its high fire rate, the MAS .223 "
"is a semi-auto only variation imported to the US in the late eighties.  It "
"retains the integral bipod, though."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil de asalto bullpup que fue utilizado por las fuerzas armadas "
"francesas sólo hasta hace poco. Mientras que el FAMAS era famoso por su alta"
" cadencia de fuego, el MAS .223 es una variante sólo semiautomática "
"importada a Estados Unidos a finales de los años ochenta. Sin embargo, "
"conserva el bípode integral."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "FS2000"
msgid_plural "FS2000s"
msgstr[0] "FS2000"
msgstr[1] "FS2000s"
msgstr[2] "FS2000s"

#. ~ Description of gun "FS2000"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A sleek bullpup carbine designed by FN Herstal, complete with an integrated "
"sight accessory rail.  The forward ejecting action and ambidextrous controls"
" make firing comfortable for both left and right-handed shooting.  The whole"
" rifle is well sealed from mud and dust for reliability, but this makes it "
"incompatible with many aftermarket magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una elegante carabina bullpup diseñada por FN Herstal, completa con un "
"carril para accesorios de mira integrado. La acción de expulsión hacia "
"delante y los controles ambidiestros hacen que el disparo sea cómodo tanto "
"para zurdos como para diestros. Todo el rifle está bien sellado contra el "
"barro y el polvo para mayor fiabilidad, pero esto lo hace incompatible con "
"muchos cargadores del mercado de accesorios."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "M27 assault rifle"
msgid_plural "M27 assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de asalto M27"
msgstr[1] "rifles de asalto M27"
msgstr[2] "rifles de asalto M27"

#. ~ Description of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4 Carbine, the M27 assault rifle features most of "
"the former's strengths, while being considerably more durable.  It is "
"chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para reemplazar a la carabina M4, el fusil de asalto M27 cuenta con"
" la mayoría de los puntos fuertes de la primera, aunque es considerablemente"
" más duradero. Está cargado con una cámara de 5.56x45 mm y acepta cargadores"
" STANAG."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "H&K416 A5"
msgid_plural "H&K416 A5s"
msgstr[0] "H&K416 A5"
msgstr[1] "H&K416 A5s"
msgstr[2] "H&K416 A5s"

#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "H&K416 A5"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4A1, the Heckler and Koch 416A5 features most of "
"the former's strengths, while being considerably more durable."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para reemplazar el M4A1, el Heckler and Koch 416A5 mantiene la "
"mayoría de las ventajas de su predecesor, y es considerablemente más "
"duradero."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "M27 IAR"
msgid_plural "M27 IARs"
msgstr[0] "M27 IAR"
msgstr[1] "M27 IAR"
msgstr[2] "M27 IAR"

#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "M27 IAR"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A H&K416 carbine outfitted with a heavier barrel to enable higher amounts of"
" suppressive fire while retaining a good degree of mobility."
msgstr ""
"Es la carabina H&K 416 equipada con un cañón más pesado, para permitir "
"mayores cantidades de disparo supresivo manteniendo un buen grado de "
"movilidad."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "M38 DMR"
msgid_plural "M38 DMRs"
msgstr[0] "M38 DMR"
msgstr[1] "M38 DMRs"
msgstr[2] "M38 DMRs"

#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "M38 DMR"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"The M38 Designated Marksman Rifle is an M27 IAR, itself derived from a "
"H&K416, selected for accuracy, and outfitted with a variable power scope and"
" a QDSS suppressor."
msgstr ""
"El M38 Designated Marksman Rifle es un M27 IAR, derivado a su vez de un "
"H&K416, seleccionado por su precisión, y equipado con un visor de potencia "
"variable y un supresor QDSS."

