msgstr[1] "cañones agujereados"
msgstr[2] "cañones agujereados"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "ported barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"A ported barrel redirects exhaust gases to compensate for muzzle climb, "
"improving recoil but increasing noise and reducing accuracy slightly."
msgstr ""
"El cañón agujereado permite liberar los gases de la combustión de la pólvora"
" para compensar el levantamiento de la bocacha, mejorando el retroceso pero "
"aumentando el ruido y reduciendo un poco la precisión."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "shortened barrel"
msgid_plural "shortened barrels"
msgstr[0] "cañón recortado"
msgstr[1] "cañones recortados"
msgstr[2] "cañones recortados"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "shortened barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"A shortened barrel results in markedly reduced accuracy and a minor increase"
" in noise, but also greatly improves the ease with which the weapon can be "
"carried and wielded."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón recortado reduce marcadamente la precisión, y un pequeño aumento "
"del ruido pero también mejora mucho la facilidad de llevar y empuñar el "
"arma."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "upstest"
msgid_plural "upstests"
msgstr[0] "upstest"
msgstr[1] "upstests"
msgstr[2] "upstests"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "upstest"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"Test mod for UPS drain on mods, this should never spawn, if you see this, "
"it's a bug.  50x more UPS drain."
msgstr ""
"Mod de prueba para el uso de UPS en modificaciones, esto no debería aparecer"
" nunca, si lo ves, es un error. Multiplica por 50 el uso de UPS."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "brass catcher"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/brass_catcher.json
msgid ""
"A bag that hangs off the side of your gun and catches ejected casings so you"
" don't have to pick them up."
msgstr ""
"Es una bolsa que cuelga a un costado del arma y recolecta los casquillos "
"eyectadas, así no tienes que levantarlas."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "rifle .223 upper receiver"
msgid_plural "rifle .223 upper receivers"
msgstr[0] "receptor superior de rifle .223"
msgstr[1] "receptores superiores de rifle .223"
msgstr[2] "receptores superiores de rifle .223"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "rifle .223 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, "
"and bolt carrier group that, given the right knowledge, is installable upon "
"an AR-15-style rifle’s lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible "
"firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with "
"this kit providing a weapon with a 20-inch barrel chambered for .223 "
"Remington ammunition, commonly installed on full-length M16 rifles."
msgstr ""
"Este es un ensamblaje de receptor superior completo que contiene un cañón, "
"guardamanos y cerrojo, que con los conocimientos adecuados, se puede "
"instalar en la parte baja de un rifle estilo AR-15. Los receptores "
"intercambiables permiten que armas compatibles sean reconvertidas para "
"diferentes municiones y longitudes de cañón, que este equipo provee a un "
"arma con un cañón de 50 centímetros con calibre .223 Remington, comúnmente "
"instalado en rifles M16 completos."

