msgid "replaceable stock kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable stock kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de culata reemplazable"
msgstr[1] "kits de culata reemplazable"
msgstr[2] "kits de culata reemplazable"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "replaceable stock kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
msgid ""
"A kit consisting of various steel parts.  When installed, it will remove the"
" weapon's original fixed stock, install a new stock mount in its place, "
"modify the original stock to fit it and then reattach it to the gun, or "
"simply attach a stock mount if the gun had no stock to start with.  This "
"allows easy installation of any kind of more advanced stocks."
msgstr ""
"Un equipo que consiste en varias partes de acero que cuando se instala, "
"quitará la culata fija original del arma, instalará una nueva montura de "
"culata, modificará la culata original para que sea compatible y volverá a "
"ponerla en el arma, o solamente unirá la montura de culata si el arma no "
"tenía una originalmente. Esto permite una fácil instalación de cualquier "
"culata mejorada."

#. ~ Target of gun mod "replaceable stock kit"
