#. ~ Description of magazine "Bren 2 30-round magazine"
#: data/json/items/magazine/762.json
msgid ""
"A proprietary polymer box magazine, capable of containing 30 7.62x39mm "
"rounds and compatible with the Czech Bren 2 carbine.  Unlike conventional "
"7.62x39mm magazines, this one is inserted straight up into the magazine well"
" rather than rocked in, in order to facilitate a bolt-hold open mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Un cargador de caja de polímero propietario, capaz de contener 30 balas "
"7.62x39mm y compatible con la carabina checa Bren 2. A diferencia de los "
"cargadores convencionales calibre 7.62x39mm, este esta insertado "
"directamente en el cargador en vez de incrustado, para facilitar un "
"mecanismo de apertura de cerrojo."

