msgstr[1] "rifles de balines"
msgstr[2] "rifles de balines"

#. ~ Description of gun "BB gun"
#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid ""
"An air gun modeled to look like a small lever-action rifle.  Designed for "
"young shooters and low-risk target practice, it's fairly accurate, but the "
"BBs it fires deal nearly no damage."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de aire hecha a semejanza de un rifle de cerrojo. Diseñado para "
"tiradores jóvenes y de bajo riesgo para practicar puntería, es bastante "
"preciso, pero las bolas que dispara apenas hacen daño."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
