msgid "charcoal smoker"
msgid_plural "charcoal smokers"
msgstr[0] "ahumador de carbón"
msgstr[1] "ahumadores de carbón"
msgstr[2] "ahumadores de carbón"

#. ~ contains up to 10 liters of charcoal. Or the same amount of coal by
#. weight, 1u coal weighs about as much as 1u of charcoal and has the same
#. energy although it is 5x smaller.
#. ~ Description of "charcoal smoker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A portable charcoal smoker.  Good for weekend barbecuing and preserving meat"
" with smoke.  Cannot be used with coal; the toxic fumes would ruin the meat."
msgstr ""
"Un ahumador portátil de carbón vegetal. Bueno para la barbacoa del fin de "
"semana y para preservar la carne con humo. No se puede usar con carbón; el "
"humo toxico arruinaría la carne."

#. ~ contains up to 2 liters of charcoal. Or the same amount of coal by
