msgstr "Sacas el gancho de la granada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active grenade"
msgid_plural "active grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This fragmentation grenade is active, and will explode any second now.  "
"Better throw it!"
msgstr ""
"Esta granada de fragmentación esta activada, y va a explotar en cualquier "
"momento. ¡Tírala ya!"

#. ~ Something this useful doesn't come cheap after the apocalypse
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada PEM"
msgstr[1] "granadas PEM"
msgstr[2] "granadas PEM"

#. ~ Something this useful doesn't come cheap after the apocalypse
#. ~ Description of "EMP grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A grenade that generates an electromagnetic pulse with a low-inductance "
"capacitor bank discharged into a single-loop antenna.  It also produces a "
"mild electric shock cloud.  Use this item to pull the pin and light the "
"fuse, turning it into an active EMP grenade.  You will then have three "
"seconds before it detonates, creating an EMP field that damages robots and "
"drains bionic energy."
msgstr ""
"Una granada que genera un pulso electromagnético con un banco condensador de"
" baja inducción descargado en una antena de espira. También produce una leve"
" nube de choque eléctrico. Utiliza este objeto para tirar del pasador y "
"encender el fusible, convirtiéndola en una granada EMP activa. Tendrás tres "
"turnos antes de que detone, creando un campo EMP que daña a los robots y "
"drena la energía biónica."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "EMP grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "scrambler grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#, c-format
