msgstr ""
"Una granada casera de bote llena de solución insecticida. Usa este objeto "
"para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola en una granada "
"insecticida activa. En cinco segundos comenzará a expulsar un aerosol "
"volátil que es altamente tóxico para las formas de vida de los insectos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada de gas insecticida improvisada activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas de gas insecticida improvisadas activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas de gas insecticida improvisadas activadas"

#. ~ Description of "armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift insecticidal grenade has had its pin removed and is (or will "
"shortly be) expelling highly toxic gas."
msgstr ""
"Esta granada de gas insecticida casera no tiene el gancho de seguridad y "
"está (o lo hará pronto) soltando un gas muy tóxico."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "packed M72 LAW"
msgid_plural "packed M72 LAWs"
msgstr[0] "M72 LAW empaquetado"
msgstr[1] "M72 LAW empaquetados"
msgstr[2] "M72 LAW empaquetados"

#. ~ Description of "packed M72 LAW"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"An M72 LAW, packed in its storage form.  Activate it to pop it out and make "
"it ready to fire.  Once it is activated, it cannot be repacked."
msgstr ""
"Es un M72 LAW empaquetado para almacenamiento. Úsar para abrirlo y dejarlo "
"listo para disparar. Una vez que está activado, ya no puede ser empaquetado."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "packed M72 LAW"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the activating lever, readying the LAW to fire."
msgstr "Tiras de la palanca activadora, preparando el LAW para disparar."

#. ~ This is based on the B54 Mod 1, all other man-portable nuclear weapons
#. have far too high a yield.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "SADM mininuke"
msgid_plural "SADM mininukes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ This is based on the B54 Mod 1, all other man-portable nuclear weapons
#. have far too high a yield.
#. ~ Description of "SADM mininuke"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"The B54 Special Atomic Demolition Munition is an extremely powerful weapon, "
"a portable nuclear bomb, using the smallest nuclear warhead in US inventory."
"  It is housed inside a extremely sturdy transit container.  Use it to "
"activate the timer.  You guess that the explosion would be large enough to "
"take out a small house."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active SADM mininuke"
msgid_plural "active SADM mininukes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "active SADM mininuke"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"The nuclear bomb looks no different from the outside, yet you know that the "
"device is armed and counting down.  You should probably get far, far away "
"from it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "cóctel molotov"
msgstr[1] "cócteles molotov"
msgstr[2] "cócteles molotov"

#. ~ Description of "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a rag inserted.  Use this item to light "
"the rag.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your inventory "
"to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"Es una botella con líquido inflamable y un trapo metido adentro. Úsalo para "
"encender fuego el trapo. Vas a necesitar un encendedor o fósforos en tu "
"inventario para usarlo. Después de encenderlo, tíralo para prender fuego en "
"el impacto."

#. ~ Description of "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a flaming rag stoppered in its neck.  "
"Throwing it will shatter the bottle on impact and ignite a fireball.  "
"Dropping it will set you on fire, so don't do that unless you want to burn "
"to death."
msgstr ""
"Es una botella con un líquido inflamable y un trapo llameante metido en el "
"cuello. Al tirarlo se rompe la botella y se prende como una bola de fuego. "
"Si se te cae, te vas a prender fuego a ti mismo, así que no hagas eso "
"excepto que te quieras morir quemado."

#. ~ Something this useful doesn't come cheap after the apocalypse
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada emisora de interferencias"
msgstr[1] "granadas emisoras de interferencias"
msgstr[2] "granadas emisoras de interferencias"

#. ~ Something this useful doesn't come cheap after the apocalypse
#. ~ Description of "scrambler grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A specialized grenade designed to scramble robots' IFF control chips.  This "
"converts the robot to your side for a short time, before the backup systems "
"kick in.  Use this item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into "
"an active scrambler grenade."
msgstr ""
"Una granada especializada, diseñada para alterar los chips de control IFF de"
" los robots. Esto convierte al robot a su lado por un corto tiempo, antes de"
" que los sistemas de respaldo hagan efecto. Usa este elemento para tirar del"
" pasador y encender el fusible, convirtiéndolo en una granada codificadora "
"activa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "active scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada emisora de interferencias activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas emisoras de interferencias activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas emisoras de interferencias activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active scrambler grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This scrambler grenade is active and will soon detonate, releasing a control"
" wave that temporarily converts robots to your side."
msgstr ""
"Esta granada emisora de interferencias está activada, y en cualquier momento"
" detonará enviando una onda de control que convertirá temporalmente a los "
"robos en tus aliados."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de humo"
msgstr[1] "bombas de humo"
msgstr[2] "bombas de humo"

#. ~ Description of "smoke bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A canister grenade filled with a variety of pyrotechnic chemicals.  Use this"
" item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active smoke "
"bomb.  Five seconds after you do that, it will begin to expel a thick black "
"smoke.  This smoke will slow those who enter it, as well as obscuring vision"
" and scent."
msgstr ""
"Una granada de bote llena de una variedad de productos químicos "
"pirotécnicos. Usa este artículo para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, "
"convirtiéndola en una bomba de humo activa. Cinco segundos después de hacer "
"eso, comenzará a expulsar un humo negro y espeso. Este humo frenará a "
"quienes entren en él, además de oscurecer la visión y el olor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "armed smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de humo activada"
msgstr[1] "bombas de humo activadas"
msgstr[2] "bombas de humo activadas"

#. ~ Description of "armed smoke bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This smoke bomb has had its pin removed and is (or will shortly be) "
"expelling thick smoke."
msgstr ""
"Esta bomba de humo no tiene el gancho de seguridad, indicando que está (o lo"
" estará en cualquier momento) soltando un humo denso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "rocket candy"
msgid_plural "rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "combustible de caramelo"
msgstr[1] "combustible de caramelo"
msgstr[2] "combustible de caramelo"

#. ~ Description of "rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A pear-shaped chunk of rocket candy obtained by heating saltpeter with sugar"
" and casting the obtained liquid.  Can serve as a rocket fuel, but also as a"
" smokescreen - if you light the narrow end, you should be able to throw it "
"before the flame reaches the broad end."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo en forma de pera con combustible de caramelo obtenido calentando el"
" salitre con azúcar y vertiendo el líquido obtenido. Puede servir como "
"combustible para cohetes, pero también como cortina de humo - si se enciende"
" el extremo estrecho, debería ser capaz de lanzarlo antes de que la llama "
"llegue al extremo ancho."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Light candy"
msgstr "Encender caramelo"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the rocket candy on fire.  Throw it!"
msgstr "Enciendes el cohete de caramelo. ¡Suéltalo!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "burning rocket candy"
msgid_plural "burning rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"
msgstr[1] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"
msgstr[2] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"

#. ~ Description of "burning rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of rocket candy that has been lit on fire and burns with a loud "
"hiss, spewing forth large amounts of smoke."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de cohete de caramelo, que ha sido encendido, quemado y que está "
"siseando, arrojando grandes cantidades de humo."

#. ~ "message" action message of item "burning rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already lit the fuse - get rid of it immediately!"
msgstr "Ya has encendido la mecha, ¡deshazte de ella inmediatamente!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "pequeña granada casera de explosivo militar"
msgstr[1] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar"
msgstr[2] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar"

#. ~ Description of "military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "military explosive homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts.  Use this item "
"to light the fuse.  You will then have five seconds before it explodes; "
"throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Un artefacto explosivo improvisado, hecho de piezas sueltas. Usa este objeto"
" para encender la mecha. Tendrás 5 segundos antes de que explote; lanzarlo "
"sería una buena idea."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"You light the fuse on the improvised grenade.  Throw it before it blows up "
"in your face!"
msgstr ""
"Enciendes la mecha de la granada improvisada. ¡Lánzala antes de que te "
"explote en la cara!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "active military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "pequeña granada casera de explosivo militar activada"
msgstr[1] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar activadas"
msgstr[2] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"The fuse on this improvised grenade is lit, and it will explode any second "
"now.  Better throw it!"
msgstr ""
"La mecha de esta granada casera esta encendida, y va a explotar en cualquier"
" momento. ¡Tírala ya!"

#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive small
#. homemade grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive homemade
#. grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#, c-format
msgid "You've already lit the %s's fuse, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "Ya has encendido la mecha de %s, intenta tirarla en su lugar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "military explosive homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada casera de explosivo militar"
msgstr[1] "granadas caseras de explosivo militar"
msgstr[2] "granadas caseras de explosivo militar"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "active military explosive homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada casera de explosivo militar activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas caseras de explosivo militar activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas caseras de explosivo militar activadas"

#. ~ Only one third (410 g) of a whole pipe is being used
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "military explosive pipebomb"
msgid_plural "military explosive pipebombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de tubo de explosivo militar"
msgstr[1] "bombas de tubo de explosivo militar"
msgstr[2] "bombas de tubo de explosivo militar"

#. ~ Only one third (410 g) of a whole pipe is being used
#. ~ Description of "military explosive pipebomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A section of steel pipe filled with military explosives.  Use this item to "
"pull the pin, giving you six seconds to get away from it before it "
"detonates."
msgstr ""
"Una sección de una tubería llena de explosivos militares. Usa este objeto "
"para tirar de la clavija, lo que te da seis segundos para alejarte de ella "
"antes de que detone."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive pipebomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the pipebomb."
msgstr "Tiras de la clavija de la bomba de tubo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active military explosive pipebomb"
msgid_plural "active military explosive pipebombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de tubo de explosivo militar activa"
msgstr[1] "bombas de tubo de explosivo militar activas"
msgstr[2] "bombas de tubo de explosivo militar activas"

#. ~ Description of "active military explosive pipebomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This pipebomb's pin is pulled, and it will explode any second now.  Throw it"
" immediately!"
msgstr ""
"La clavija de esta bomba de tubo está sacada, y explotará en cualquier "
"momento. ¡Lánzala inmediatamente!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "military explosive bomb"
msgid_plural "military explosive bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de explosivo militar"
msgstr[1] "bombas de explosivo militar"
msgstr[2] "bombas de explosivo militar"

#. ~ Description of "military explosive bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A homemade explosive device, consisting of a large plastic jug filled with "
"military explosives and scrap metal, equipped with a delayed fuse.  Use this"
" item to pull the pin.  Once you do, it should explode after about 20 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Un artefacto explosivo de fabricación casera, que consiste en una gran jarra"
" de plástico llena de explosivos militares y chatarra, equipada con una "
"mecha retardada. Utiliza este objeto para tirar del pasador. Una vez que lo "
"hagas debería explotar en unos 20 segundos."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"You pull the pin on the small bootleg fragmentation device.  Get rid of it "
"quickly!"
msgstr ""
"Tiras de la clavija de la réplica pequeña del dispositivo de fragmentación. "
"¡Deshazte de él rápidamente!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active military explosive bomb"
msgid_plural "active military explosive bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de explosivo militar activada"
msgstr[1] "bombas de explosivo militar activadas"
msgstr[2] "bombas de explosivo militar activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active military explosive bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A homemade explosive device, consisting of a large plastic jug filled with "
"military explosives and scrap metal.  Its fuse has been lit, its final "
"countdown starting."
msgstr ""
"Un artefacto explosivo de fabricación casera, consistente en una gran jarra "
"de plástico llena de explosivos militares y chatarra, cuya mecha se ha "
"encendido, comenzando su cuenta atrás."

#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already pulled the pin - run!"
msgstr "Ya has tirado de la anilla: ¡corre!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "military explosive 50L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "military explosive 50L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "barril bomba de 50L de explosivo militar"
msgstr[1] "barriles bomba de 50L de explosivo militar"
msgstr[2] "barriles bomba de 50L de explosivo militar"

#. ~ Description of "military explosive 50L barrel bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A metal keg filled with military explosives.  Once it has been activated, it"
" will explode after 100 seconds, raining fire and steel on everything in "
"sight."
msgstr ""
"Un barril de metal de lleno de un montón de explosivos militares. Una vez "
"activado, explotará en 100 segundos, haciendo llover fuego y acero sobre "
"todo lo que esté a la vista."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "military explosive 50L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "military explosive 100L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "50L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "100L barrel bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Activate fuze"
msgstr "Activar mecha"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive 50L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive 100L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "50L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "100L barrel bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You activate the fuze on the barrel bomb.  Clear the area!"
msgstr "Activa la mecha del barril bomba. ¡Despeja la zona!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active military explosive 50L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "active military explosive 50L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "barril bomba de 50L de explosivo militar activado"
msgstr[1] "barriles bomba de 50L de explosivo militar activados"
msgstr[2] "barriles bomba de 50L de explosivo militar activados"

#. ~ Description of "active military explosive 50L barrel bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A metal keg filled with military explosives.  It has been activated and will"
" soon explode, delivering its entire destructive power to everything in "
"sight."
msgstr ""
"Un barril de metal lleno de un montón de explosivos militares. Ha sido "
"activado y pronto explotará, repartiendo todo su poder destructivo a todo lo"
" que esté a la vista."

#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive 50L barrel
#. bomb"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive 100L barrel
#. bomb"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active 50L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active 100L barrel bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already activated the bomb - clear the area immediately!"
msgstr "Ya has activado la bomba, ¡despeja la zona inmediatamente!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "military explosive 100L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "military explosive 100L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "barril bomba de 100L de explosivo militar"
msgstr[1] "barriles bomba de 100L de explosivo militar"
msgstr[2] "barriles bomba de 100L de explosivo militar"

#. ~ Description of "military explosive 100L barrel bomb"
#. ~ Description of "100L barrel bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A 100L metal barrel filled with military explosives.  Once it has been "
"activated it will explode after 100 seconds, raining fire and steel on "
"everything in sight."
msgstr ""
"Un barril de metal de 100L, lleno de un montón de explosivos militares. Una "
"vez activado, explotará en 100 segundos, haciendo llover fuego y acero sobre"
" todo lo que esté a la vista."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active military explosive 100L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "active military explosive 100L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "barril bomba de 100L de explosivo militar activado"
msgstr[1] "barriles bomba de 100L de explosivo militar activados"
msgstr[2] "barriles bomba de 100L de explosivo militar activados"

#. ~ Description of "active military explosive 100L barrel bomb"
#. ~ Description of "active 100L barrel bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A 100L metal barrel filled with military explosives.  It has been activated "
"and will soon explode, delivering its entire destructive power to everything"
" in sight."
msgstr ""
"Un barril de metal de 100L, lleno de un montón de explosivos militares. Ha "
"sido activado y pronto explotará, repartiendo todo su poder destructivo a "
"todo lo que esté a la vista."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada casera pequeña"
msgstr[1] "granadas caseras pequeñas"
msgstr[2] "granadas caseras pequeñas"

