#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A section of steel pipe filled with explosives.  Use this item to light the "
"fuse, giving you six seconds to get away from it before it detonates.  "
"You'll need a lighter or some matches to use it."
msgstr ""
"Una sección de una tubería llena de explosivos. Usa este objeto para "
