"A durable tool consisting of a sturdy fiberglass shaft tipped with a set of "
"3 hooks, one large opposed by two small.  Hot sticks are used to maintain "
"some standoff distance when manual manipulation of explosives is necessary, "
"and robot assistance is unavailable."
msgstr ""

