#. ~ Description of "anvil"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A heavy block of oddly-shaped steel complete with a pritchel hole and hardy "
"hole.  Once installed, it can be used in most metalworking fabrication "
"recipes."
msgstr ""
"Un pesado bloque de acero con una extraña forma, con un agujero de Pritchel "
"y un agujero resistente. Una vez instalado, se puede usar para la mayoría de"
" recetas de fabricación metalúrgica."

#. ~ Description of "bronze anvil"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A block of oddly-shaped bronze complete with a pritchel hole and hardy hole."
"  Once installed, it can be used in most metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "heavy anvil"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"An absolutely enormous block of oddly-shaped steel with all the bells and "
"whistles a blacksmith could ask for on an anvil.  Necessary for heavy-duty "
"metalworking or dropping on roadrunners."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque de acero absolutamente enorme con una forma extraña con todos los "
"utensilios que un forjador podría necesitar de un yunque. Necesario para "
"trabajo metalúrgico pesado o para tirárselo a corre caminos."

#. ~ Description of "crude anvil"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"An anvil-shaped object cut out of some form of metal stock or a railroad "
"track.  Usable on its own for simpler metalworking, but could be improved "
"for more advanced recipes."
msgstr ""
"Un objeto cortado con forma de yunque hecho con alguna forma de culata "
"metálica o vía de tren. Útil por si misma para simples trabajos de "
"metalurgia, pero puede ser mejorado para recetas mas avanzadas."

#. ~ Based on https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YH5T9DV
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "pair of bolt cutters"
msgid_plural "pairs of bolt cutters"
msgstr[0] "cizallas"
msgstr[1] "cizallas"
msgstr[2] "cizallas"

#. ~ Based on https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YH5T9DV
#. ~ Description of "pair of bolt cutters"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A large pair of bolt cutters.  You could use them to cut padlocks or heavy "
"gauge wire."
msgstr ""
"Un gran par de cizallas. Se puede usar para cortar candados o alambres "
"gruesos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "charcoal forge"
msgid_plural "charcoal forges"
msgstr[0] "forja de carbón vegetal"
msgstr[1] "forjas de carbón vegetal"
msgstr[2] "forjas de carbón vegetal"

#. ~ Description of "charcoal forge"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A portable, charcoal-fired metalworking forge.  With the right tools, you "
"could use this for metalworking."
msgstr ""
"Una forja portátil para metalurgia, alimentada por carbón vegetal. Si se "
"combina con las herramientas adecuadas, puedes usarla para hacer trabajo de "
"metalurgia."

#. ~ Description of "charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A stout metal box used for producing charcoal via pyrolysis: the incomplete "
"burning of organic materials in the absence of oxygen."
msgstr ""
"Una caja gruesa de metal usada para producir carbón vegetal mediante "
"pirólisis: quemado incompleto de materiales orgánicos en ausencia de "
"oxígeno."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "metalworking chisel"
msgid_plural "metalworking chisels"
msgstr[0] "cincel para metal"
msgstr[1] "cinceles para metal"
msgstr[2] "cinceles para metal"

#. ~ Description of "metalworking chisel"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A short, stout metalworking chisel.  It's used in some metalworking "
