#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid ""
"WARNING!  ERROR A101; FAILURE DETECTED IN POWER SUPPLY.\n"
" RESERVE POWER ACTIVATED.  CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT IMMEDIATELY!\n"
"\n"
" WARNING!  ERROR B231; UNABLE TO CONNECT TO MESSAGING SERVER.\n"
" ERROR REFRESHING MESSAGES.  NOT ALL MESSAGES MAY BE DISPLAYED.\n"
" CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT IMMEDIATELY!"
msgstr ""
"¡ADVERTENCIA! ERROR A101; FALLO DETECTADO EN LA ALIMENTACIÓN ELÉCTRICA.\n"
" ENERGÍA DE RESERVA ACTIVADA. ¡CONTACTAR AL DEPARTAMENTO DE INFORMACIÓN TECNOLÓGICA DE MANERA INMEDIATA!\n"
"\n"
" ¡ADVERTENCIA! ERROR B231; NO SE PUDO ESTABLECER CONEXIÓN CON EL SERVIDOR DE MENSAJERÍA.\n"
" ERROR ACTUALIZANDO MENSAJES. NO SE MUESTRAN TODOS LOS MENSAJES.\n"
" ¡CONTACTAR AL DEPARTAMENTO DE INFORMACIÓN TECNOLÓGICA DE MANERA INMEDIATA!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid "[!]RE: Important Status Update"
msgstr "[!]RE: Actualización Importante de Estado"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid "RETURN TO MAIN PAGE"
msgstr "VOLVER A PÁGINA PRINCIPAL"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
"  TO: [Branch Managers], [Community Managers]\n"
"  RE: Important Status Update\n"
"\n"
" Everyone,\n"
" You are to follow your appropriate lockdown protocols at your discretion.  With the recent events as they are, we must do our utmost to ensure that our goals remain priority.\n"
"\n"
" Branch Managers - your deliveries will have an altered schedule.  I will send a separate email with details.  Ensure the hidden safe rooms are properly secured.\n"
" Community Managers - Lockdown the community appropriately.  Tell the residents that it is for their protection, but do not let them leave.  We need them for the Big Pappy project to be successful.  I am going to send you some contacts who can discreetly install a heavy security gate.\n"
"\n"
" You will continue to receive your bonus pay as agreed upon.  Do not lose sight of our important endgame."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
"  PARA: [Gerentes de Sucursal], [Community Managers]\n"
"  RE: Actualización Importante de Estado\n"
"\n"
" Para todos,\n"
" Deben seguir el protocolo indicado de cierre de emergencia a su propia discreción. Con los eventos recientes, debemos hacer nuestro máximo esfuerzo para asegurar que los objetivos sigan teniendo prioridad.\n"
"\n"
" Gerentes de Sucursal - sus envíos serán reprogramados. Enviaré un correo aparte con los detalles. Asegúrense que las habitaciones de seguridad sean apropiadamente seguras.\n"
" Community Managers - Hay que cerrar apropiadamente de emergencia la comunidad. Díganle a los residentes que es por su propia protección pero no dejen que salgan. Los necesitamos para que el proyecto Gran Papi tenga éxito. Voy a enviarles unos contactos que pueden instalar de manera discreta una verja de seguridad.\n"
"\n"
" Continuarán recibiendo la bonificación al pago como fue acordado. No pierdan de vista nuestro objetivo final."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid "RETURN TO MESSAGES"
msgstr "VOLVER A MENSAJES"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid "ERROR ACCESSING SERVER"
msgstr "ERROR CONECTANDO AL SERVIDOR"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "RETURN TO PREVIOUS PAGE"
msgstr "VOLVER A LA PÁGINA ANTERIOR"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Hey, I didn't expect to live long enough to see another living human!"
msgstr "¡Oye, no esperaba vivir lo suficiente para ver a otro humano vivo!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "I've been here since shit went down.  Just my luck I had to work."
msgstr ""
"He estado aquí desde que la mierda cayó. Qué suerte que tuve que trabajar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "How are you alive?"
msgstr "¿Cómo es que estás vivo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Well, the dishwasher made a break for it three days after things got weird."
"  He was ripped to shreds before he made it to the street.  I figure this "
"place has gotta be safer than my apartment, and at least I've got all this "
"food here."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, el lavavajillas se rompió tres días después de que las cosas se "
"pusieran raras. Fue despedazado antes de llegar a la calle. Me imagino que "
"este lugar debe ser más seguro que mi apartamento, y al menos tengo toda "
"esta comida aquí."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I "
"heard glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving "
"window to see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke "
"something.  What I witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm "
"not even sure I could go over it again."
msgstr ""
"Yo... um... me escondí. Estaba en la cocina, preparando otra obra maestra "
"cuando oí el vidrio romperse seguido de gritos. Corrí a la ventana de "
"servicio para ver lo que pasó, asumiendo que un invitado se había caído y se"
" había roto algo. Lo que presencié fue la cosa más horrible que he visto "
"nunca. Ni siquiera estoy seguro de que pueda volver a recordarlo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began "
"to crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"Algún lunático cubierto con una película de sustancia viscosa, negra como el"
" aceite, había caído a través de una de las grandes ventanas de vidrio. "
"Había fragmentos de vidrio pegados en su cabeza y cuello. Creí que el pobre "
"tipo, la chica, lo que sea, estaba muerto. La gente empezó a agolparse a su "
"alrededor, algunos estaban tomando fotos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Horrible.  Did you get any pictures yourself?"
msgstr "Horrible. ¿Conseguiste alguna foto tú mismo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"No!  I figured the thing dead until it started writhing and spazzing out for"
" a moment.  Everyone jumped back, a few screamed, and one curious stranger "
"stepped in closer, kneeling a little… it attacked him!"
msgstr ""
"¡No! Me imaginé que la cosa estaba muerta hasta que empezó a retorcerse y a "
"desvanecerse por un momento. Todo el mundo saltó hacia atrás, unos cuantos "
"gritaron, y un extraño curioso se acercó, arrodillándose un poco... ¡eso lo "
"atacó!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "What'd you do?"
msgstr "¿Qué has hecho?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were"
" gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked "
"all the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded "
"myself in here."
msgstr ""
"Corrí a la parte de atrás de la cocina y me escondí lo mejor que pude. La "
"gente afuera estaba gritando y pude oírlos correr. De repente oí más "
"cristales rotos y algo que se escabullía del restaurante. Esperé un momento "
"y luego fui a revisar el área del comedor. Tanto el desconocido como la cosa"
" se habían ido. La gente corría por las calles, algunos incluso tenían "
"armas, así que cerré todas las puertas y bloqueé las ventanas con lo que "
"pude y me atrincheré aquí."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Crazy, so you have been here ever since?"
msgstr "Locura, ¿así que has estado aquí desde entonces?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds:"
" explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"Sí, pasó un tiempo antes de que volviera a estar tranquilo. Escuché todo "
"tipo de sonidos: explosiones, cazas volando, helicópteros, gritos y disparos"
" rápidos. ¡Juro que incluso oí lo que sonó como un maldito tanque pasando en"
" un momento! Me he estado escondiendo aquí desde entonces."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I've been a cook since forever, this wasn't the best joint, but management "
"was cool."
msgstr ""
"He sido cocinero desde siempre, este no era el mejor sitio, pero la gestión "
"era genial."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greetings friend, it's nice to see you."
msgstr "Saludos amigo, me alegro de verte."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "So you're back… explain yourself!"
msgstr "Así que has vuelto... ¡Explícate!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "What sorcery is this?"
msgstr "¿Qué brujería es esta?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Welcome home Foodkid!"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido a casa, Foodkid!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Still here?  Take your time, it's rough out there."
msgstr "¿Todavía aquí? Tómate tu tiempo, es duro ahí fuera."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greeting citizen, what brings you to the FoodLair?"
msgstr "Saludos ciudadanos, ¿qué te trae a la GuaridaComida?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greetings… Foodperson?"
msgstr "Saludos... ¿Comidapersona?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am you but from an alternate reality."
msgstr "Yo soy tú, pero de una realidad alternativa."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am Foodperson, who are YOU?"
msgstr "Soy Comidapersona, ¿quién eres TÚ?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There is only one real Foodperson!"
msgstr "¡Sólo hay un verdadero Comidapersona!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am the REAL Foodperson!"
msgstr "¡Soy el verdadero Comidapersona!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"So, you are a REAL FOODPERSON, right?  You know my <name_g> over there?  You"
" know that you ruined his legacy?"
msgstr ""
"Así que, eres una VERDADERA PERSONACOMIDA, ¿verdad? ¿Sabes mi <name_g> allí?"
" ¿Sabes que arruinaste su legado?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Nevermind me, I'm just going to leave."
msgstr "No te preocupes, me voy a ir."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Indeed it is I!  The one and only FOODPERSON!"
msgstr "¡De hecho soy yo! ¡El único PERSONACOMIDA!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wow!  Such an honor to meet you in person!"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¡Es un honor conocerte en persona!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Are you joking?  Foodperson is not real, it's a restaurant mascot!"
msgstr ""
"¿Estás bromeando? Comidapersona no es real, ¡es la mascota de un "
"restaurante!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"The great Foodperson in the flesh!  Such an honor to finally meet you in "
"person!"
msgstr ""
"¡El gran Comidapersona en carne y hueso! ¡Es un gran honor conocerle por fin"
" en persona!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ah… well, nice to meet you Foodperson."
msgstr "Ah... Bueno, encantado de conocerte Comidapersona."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Do not mock me, for my strength is quite real!  Get out of here now!"
msgstr ""
"¡No te burles de mí, porque mi fuerza es muy real! ¡Vete de aquí ahora!¡No "
"te burles de mí, porque mi fuerza es muy real! ¡Vete de aquí ahora!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sheesh, ok, calm down, I'm leaving!"
msgstr "Sheesh, ok, cálmate, me voy!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Forgive me, I didn't mean to disrespect you."
msgstr "Perdóname, no quise faltarte el respeto."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Oh yeah?  Show me what you can do!"
msgstr "¿Ah, sí? ¡Muéstrame lo que puedes hacer!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "A common mistake, but I can assure you that I'm very real!"
msgstr "Un error común, pero puedo asegurarte que soy muy real."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "Sure, whatever."
msgstr "Claro, lo que sea."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ok… I believe you."
msgstr "Ok... Te creo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Anyway, do you need something?"
msgstr "De todos modos, ¿Necesitas algo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Are you interested in some trading?"
msgstr "¿Está interesado en algún tipo de comercio?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Let's trade?"
msgstr "¿Negociamos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm looking for a place to stay."
msgstr "Estoy buscando un lugar para quedarme."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I want to get stronger.  Please teach me."
msgstr "Quiero ser más fuerte. Por favor, enséñame."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Please share your knowledge."
msgstr "Por favor comparte tu conocimiento."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm building up a team, people with special abilities."
msgstr "Estoy formando un equipo, gente con habilidades especiales."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Can you tell me again about this sidekick offer?"
msgstr "¿Puedes decirme otra vez sobre la oferta de compinche?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright, I thought about this, what do you say about we team up?"
msgstr "Muy bien, he pensado en esto, ¿qué dices de que formemos un equipo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm good, bye."
msgstr "Estoy bien, adiós."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I already have everything I need here in the FoodLair!"
msgstr "¡Ya tengo todo lo que necesito aquí en la GuaridaComida!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright let's see what you've got."
msgstr "Muy bien, veamos lo que tienes."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "You're not ready for this."
msgstr "No estás preparado para esto."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "But I am worthy!"
msgstr "¡Pero soy digno!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I can teach you a few tricks."
msgstr "Puedo enseñarte algunos trucos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_fabricate.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Nevermind."
msgstr "Olvidate."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "This is no place for a civilian.  You should go to the refugee center."
msgstr "Este no es lugar para un civil. Deberías ir al centro de refugiados."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Damn!"
msgstr "¡Maldición!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Well… You seem like a decent sort, I might have an offer for you."
msgstr "Bueno... Pareces un tipo decente, podría tener una oferta para ti."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "Estoy escuchando."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sorry but I work alone."
msgstr "Perdón pero trabajo solo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "We could really use your help!"
msgstr "¡Nos vendría muy bien tu ayuda!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal si demuestras tu valor y te unes a mí como mi compinche?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "That sounds great!"
msgstr "¡Suena genial!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ok…"
msgstr "Ok…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I need to think about it."
msgstr "Tengo que pensarlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Huh… no thanks."
msgstr "Eh... No gracias."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There's other things I'd like to discuss."
msgstr "Hay otras cosas que me gustaría discutir."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright bye."
msgstr "Muy bien, adiós."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "The way you talk, the way you move… You're… You're me?  But how?"
msgstr ""
"La forma en la que hablas, la forma como te mueves... Tú eres... ¿Tú eres "
"yo? ¿Pero cómo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"I… I don't know.  It probably has something to do with <the_cataclysm>!  "
"What do you say we team up to find out?"
msgstr ""
"No... no lo sé. ¡Probablemente tenga algo que ver con <the_cataclysm>! ¿Qué "
"dices si nos unimos para averiguarlo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"It might have something to do with <the_cataclysm>, mind if I stay here "
"while we try to figure this out?"
msgstr ""
"Podría tener algo que ver con <the_cataclysm>, ¿te importa si me quedo aquí "
"mientras intentamos resolver esto?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "This can't be true, you're trying to trick me!"
msgstr "Esto no puede ser verdad, ¡estás tratando de engañarme!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I need time to think."
msgstr "Necesito tiempo para pensar."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wha… but.  But… how?"
msgstr "¿Qué... Pe. Pero... Cómo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"No time to explain, the world is at an end and we must join forces to save "
"it!"
msgstr ""
"No hay tiempo para explicaciones, el mundo se ha acabado y debemos unir "
"fuerzas para salvarlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm weakened the space-time continuum, I accidentally fell through"
" a tear in reality and ended up here.  I will need access to your resources "
"to keep fighting."
msgstr ""
"El cataclismo debilitó el continuo espacio-tiempo, caí accidentalmente a "
"través de un desgarro en la realidad y terminé aquí. Necesitaré acceso a tus"
" recursos para seguir luchando."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"I am the ultimate Foodperson, I travel the multiverse consuming powers from "
"all the Foodpersons.  And now I've come for you!"
msgstr ""
"Soy el último Comidapersona, viajo por los multiversos consumiendo a todos "
"los Comidapersonas. ¡Y ahora he venido por ti!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Can't tell you now.  In due time all will be revealed."
msgstr "No puedo decírtelo ahora. A su debido tiempo todo será revelado."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Of course, whatever you need… Foodperson."
msgstr "Por supuesto, lo que necesites... Comidapersona."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Thank you Foodperson!  It's good to know I have a friend here."
msgstr "Gracias Comidapersona! Es bueno saber que tengo un amigo aquí."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"It's crazy out there, it's going to be a tough journey but I'm with you!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es una locura allá afuera, va a ser un viaje difícil pero estoy contigo!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Let's go, we have a world to save!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, tenemos un mundo que salvar!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There can be only one!"
msgstr "¡Sólo puede haber uno!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I AM THE ONE!"
msgstr "¡SOY EL ÚNICO!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wow, calm down, it's just a prank bro."
msgstr "Wow, cálmate, era una broma hermano."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "WAIT!  There might be another way!"
msgstr "¡ESPERA! ¡Puede haber otra manera!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I don't want to fight you.  I'm leaving."
msgstr "No quiero pelear contigo. Me voy a ir."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Umm, I'm not sure I'm following you…"
msgstr "mmm, no estoy seguro de seguirte..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"You know what, <name_b>, I don't want to talk to you anymore.  <kill_npc> "
"<name_b>!"
msgstr "Sabes que, <name_b>,  Yo no quiero hablarte más. ¡<kill_npc><name_b>!"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json data/json/npcs/portal_storm/Portal_NPC.json
msgid "No class"
msgstr "Sin clase"

#. ~ Job description of "No class" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Fisherman" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
msgid "I'm just wandering."
msgstr "Solo estoy dando vueltas."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Debug Dude"
msgstr "Tio de Depurado"

#. ~ Job description of "Debug Dude" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
msgid "I'm helping you test the game."
msgstr "Te estoy ayudando a que pruebes el juego."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Shopkeep"
msgstr "Tendero"

#. ~ Job description of "Shopkeep" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#. ~ Job description of "Merchant" NPC class
#. ~ Smokes is a firefighter that volunteered to take stock of what was
#. available and keep inventory. He's gradually had more lumped onto him as
#. the Free Merchants struggle to put themselves together, but he feels
#. obligated to help, even though he doesn't really want to have all the
#. responsibility he does.
#. ~ Retained to prevent errors.
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json data/json/npcs/godco/classes.json
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/NPC_Smokes.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "I'm a local shopkeeper."
msgstr "Soy un comerciante local."

#. ~ Job description of "Soldier" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Operator" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Thug" NPC class
#. ~ These are here to workaround the bug of NPCs spawning without weapons due
#. to either marksmanship or melee being their highest skill, and thus not
#. knowing what weapon to give them.
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json data/mods/Military_Professions/npc/classes.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_bandits.json
msgid "I'm just here for the paycheck."
msgstr "Solo estoy aquí por la paga."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json data/mods/Military_Professions/npc/classes.json
msgid "Operator"
msgstr "Operador"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Hacker"
msgstr "Hacker"

#. ~ Job description of "Hacker" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Thawed Hacker" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "I'm looking for some choice systems to hack."
msgstr "Estoy buscando algún sistema de elección para hackear."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the refugee center as a source of missions and info.  Faction
#. critical.
#. ~ Provides advanced medical attention.
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json data/json/npcs/godco/classes.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Doctor"
msgstr "Doctor"

