"cerveza fría en la mano."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"While we chat, what say you we open a beer and just… pretend the world isn't"
" ending."
msgstr ""
"Mientras charlamos, ¿qué te parece si abrimos una cerveza y simplemente... "
"fingimos que el mundo no se esta acabando."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Pass me one and let's talk, <name_g>."
msgstr "Pasame una y hablamos, <name_g>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Yeah, this summer heat is hitting me hard, you know?"
msgstr "Sí, este calor de verano me está afectando mucho, ¿entiendes?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Enjoying the summer."
msgstr "Disfrutando el verano."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Not quite like the summers from before, huh?"
msgstr "No es como los veranos de antes, ¿eh?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Can't wait for this summer to be over."
msgstr "No puedo esperar a que termine este verano."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Kinda wishing it would cool off a bit, to be honest."
msgstr "Deseando enfriarme un poquito, para ser honesto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "OK, maybe it'll stop me from freezing in this weather."
msgstr "Bien, tal vez evite que me congele con este tiempo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Gotta say, I'm not minding the snow."
msgstr "Tengo de decirlo, no me preocupa la nieve."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Not quite like the winters from before, huh?"
msgstr "No es como los inviernos de antes, ¿eh?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Can't wait for this winter to be over."
msgstr "No puedo esperar a que termine este invierno."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "It's weird the zombies don't freeze."
msgstr "Es raro que los zombis no se congelen."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "A nice chat might improve my health somewhat."
msgstr "Una buena charla podría mejorar mi salud de alguna forma."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Alright, but I'm feeling a bit under the weather."
msgstr "Está bien, pero me siento un poco mal."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm not feeling too well, but I can still talk for a bit."
msgstr "No me siento muy bien, pero todavía puedo hablar un poco."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "We can talk, even though I'm not feeling too well."
msgstr "Podemos hablar, aunque no me siento muy bien."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Well, I'm feeling pretty sick… but sure."
msgstr "Bueno, me siento bastante mal... pero claro."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
msgstr "<thoughtfulchitchat>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I need a break anyway, how are you?"
msgstr "Necesito un descanso, ¿Cómo estas?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, how's it going?"
msgstr "eh, ¿Cómo vas?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's shoot the shit!  You OK, <name_g>?"
msgstr "  ¡Vamos a darle al pico! ¿estás bien, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm OK with that, what's up?"
msgstr "Me parece bien, ¿cómo va?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I guess I can spare a few minutes, how's things?"
msgstr "  Supongo que puedo perder unos minutos, ¿cómo van las cosas?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sure thing <name_g>, you good?"
msgstr "Claro<name_g>, ¿estás bien?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Alright, you got something to get off your chest?"
msgstr "De acuerdo, ¿tienes algo que quieras sacarte del pecho?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Always ready for a good chat!  But why, you OK?"
msgstr "¡Siempre listo para una buena charla! Pero por qué, ¿estás bien?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "OK <name_g>, how are you coping?"
msgstr "Bien <name_g>, ¿cómo lo llevas?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm game.  How you holding up?"
msgstr "Me apunto, ¿Cómo lo llevas?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's forget the world for a while.  How you doin'?"
msgstr "Olvidemos el resto del mundo por un rato. ¿Qué tal estas?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What the heck.  How's life been treating you?"
msgstr "Que demonios. ¿Qué tal te esta tratando la vida?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, how about that weather, eh?"
msgstr "Bueno, ¿Y qué tal el tiempo ,eh?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Nice of you to make time.  How's it been for you lately?"
msgstr "Qué bien que hayas sacado tiempo. ¿Cómo te ha ido últimamente?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "My dogs've been barkin' lately, you know?"
msgstr "Mis perros han estado ladrando últimamente, ¿sabes?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I feel great today.  Not sure what it is, just one of those days."
msgstr ""
"Hoy me siento muy bien. No estoy seguro de lo que es, sólo uno de esos días."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I just can't believe it's over.  I keep running my head back to the days it "
"all fell apart.  The riots.  The lies.  The psychos.  It never really felt "
"like it was going to go like this."
msgstr ""
"No puedo creer que se haya acabado. Sigo dándole vueltas a la cabeza a los "
"días en que todo se vino abajo. Los disturbios. Las mentiras. Los "
"psicópatas. Nunca sentí que fuera a ser así."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think there's any truth to the crap they were spouting before the "
"world ended?  Mind control drugs in the water, bio-terrorism?  Some of it "
"would make sense, but it seems so far-fetched.  Then again, we're dealing "
"with actual zombies."
msgstr ""
"¿Alguna vez has pensado que hay algo de verdad en la mierda que decian antes"
" del fin del mundo? ¿Drogas de control mental en el agua, bioterrorismo? "
"Algo de eso tendría sentido, pero parece tan inverosímil. Por otra parte, "
"estamos tratando con zombis reales."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if I should be getting more religious now, or less.  You know what "
"I'm sayin', <name_g>?"
msgstr ""
"Me pregunto si debería ser más religioso ahora, o menos. ¿Sabes a qué me "
"refiero?Me pregunto si debería ser más religioso ahora, o menos. ¿Sabes lo "
"que digo?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I been thinkin' about rearranging my gear.  It's a real mess.  Don't wanna "
"go for my weapon and accidentally pull out a granola bar, right?"
msgstr ""
"He estado pensando en ordenar mi equipo. Es un desastre. No quiero ir por mi"
" arma y accidentalmente sacar una barra de granola, ¿me entiendes?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder why we even bother?  We're all just gonna be zombies "
"eventually anyway.  I mean, not that I'm gonna stop fighting, but what's the"
" damn point?"
msgstr ""
"¿Alguna vez te has preguntado por qué nos molestamos? De todos modos, todos "
"vamos a ser zombis. Quiero decir, no es que vaya a dejar de luchar, pero "
"¿cuál es el maldito significado?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wish I could go bust a cap in one of those zombies right now, without all "
"the fuss about being scared for my life."
msgstr ""
"Me gustaría poder ir a reventar una gorra de uno de esos zombis ahora mismo,"
" sin todo el rollo del miedo por mi vida."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Every time I close my eyes, I can still see the riots.  Do you get that, or "
"is it just me?"
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que cierro los ojos, sigo viendo los disturbios. ¿Te pasa eso, o "
"soy sólo yo?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole time before <the_cataclysm> was just a dream "
"you're waking up from?"
msgstr ""
"¿Alguna vez sientes que todo ese tiempo antes del <the_cataclysm> fue solo "
"un sueño y ahora estamos despertando?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"When do you think you realized the world was ending?  For me, it was that "
"damned YouTube video with the lady killing the baby.  Holy shit, you know?"
msgstr ""
"¿Cuándo crees que te diste cuenta de que el mundo se acababa? Para mí, fue "
"ese maldito vídeo de YouTube con la señora matando al bebé. Hostia puta, "
"¿sabes?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I wonder if the government's still out there, holed up in some bunker."
msgstr "Me pregunto si el gobierno sigue ahí, escondido en algún búnker."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember some of the crazy news from the end of the world?  The stuff that "
"got drowned out by the riot coverage I mean.  Like, didn't the governor of "
"Rhode Island secede from the Union or something?"
msgstr ""
"¿Recuerdas algunas de las noticias locas del fin del mundo? Las cosas que "
"fueron ahogadas por la cobertura de los disturbios, quiero decir. Como, ¿no "
"se separó el gobernador de Rhode Island de la Unión o algo así?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I keep having dreams that zombies still remember who they were as people, "
"and are just trapped inside the bodies watching everything happen.  Haven't "
"been sleeping well."
msgstr ""
"Sigo teniendo sueños en los que los zombis aún recuerdan quiénes eran como "
"personas, y sólo están atrapados dentro de los cuerpos viendo cómo sucede "
"todo. No he estado durmiendo bien."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Those mind-control drugs they put in the water to make people riot… you "
"think they're still in there?"
msgstr ""
"Esas drogas de control mental que ponen en el agua para que la gente se "
"rebele... ¿crees que todavía están ahí?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't stop wondering who fucked up to make all this happen.  Obviously we "
"can't trust the news, they claimed the zombies were \"rioters\" for weeks.  "
"Why?  Where did this come from?"
msgstr ""
"No puedo dejar de preguntarme quién la ha cagado para que todo esto ocurra. "
"Obviamente no podemos confiar en las noticias, durante semanas afirmaron que"
" los zombis eran \"alborotadores\". ¿Por qué? ¿De dónde salió esto?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"If what they told us about the Chinese was even partly true, do you think "
"it's like this in China?  Or maybe the US is some kind of quarantine zone, "
"and at least some of the world is still out there."
msgstr ""
"Si lo que nos contaron sobre los chinos era parcialmente cierto, aunque "
"fuera en parte, ¿crees que en China es así? O tal vez los EE.UU. es una "
"especie de zona de cuarentena, y al menos una parte del mundo está todavía "
"por ahí."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Have you noticed injuries aren't healing the same as usual?  I started "
"spotting it before the world ended, but it's become more pronounced.  "
"There's hardly even a granulation step after a cut closes."
msgstr ""
"¿Has notado que las heridas no se curan como de costumbre? Empecé a notarlo "
"antes de que se acabara el mundo, pero se ha vuelto más pronunciado. Apenas "
"hay tiempo entre la herida y el cerrado de la misma."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I still don't understand how these zombies are powered.  They're like "
"perpetual motion machines."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no entiendo cómo se mueven estos zombis. Son como máquinas de "
"movimiento perpetuo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"So many parts of this still don't fit together.  Who created the zombies?  "
"What powers them?  Maybe the rumors of mind control drugs were true all "
"along, and someone found a way to bioengineer living dead."
msgstr ""
"Muchas cosas todavía no encajan. ¿Quién creó a los zombis? ¿Qué les da "
"energía? Tal vez los rumores sobre las drogas de control mental fueron "
"ciertos todo el tiempo, y alguien encontró una manera de desarrollar la "
"bioingeniería de los muertos vivientes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "<neutralchitchat>"
msgstr "<neutralchitchat>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"How do these zombies even keep going?  What are they eating?  Do you think "
"they'll ever rot away?"
msgstr ""
"¿Cómo se mantienen estos zombis? ¿Qué están comiendo? ¿Crees que alguna vez "
"se pudrirán?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I been thinkin', one of these days, we're gonna run out of toilet paper.  "
"What then?"
msgstr ""
"He estado pensando que uno de estos días nos quedaremos sin papel higiénico."
" ¿Y entonces qué?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think it's weird how we'll, like, open a locked building and find a "
"lone zombie inside?  How'd it even get there?"
msgstr ""
"¿Te parece raro que al abrir un edificio cerrado encontremos un zombi "
"solitario dentro? ¿Cómo llegó hasta ahí?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're all psychos, not just the ones that went crazy "
"and rioted.  I never would have thought I could do the things I've done "
"since the world ended."
msgstr ""
"A veces me pregunto si todos somos psicópatas, no sólo los que se volvieron "
"locos y se rebelaron. Nunca hubiera pensado que podría hacer las cosas que "
"he hecho desde que se acabó el mundo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "You read any good books lately?  I'm glad we still got books."
msgstr ""
"¿Has leído algún buen libro últimamente? Me alegro de que todavía tengamos "
"libros."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know what I miss?  Movie theaters.  You think Hollywood survived this?  "
"Maybe there's a bunch of zombie actors out there, filmin' shit out of "
"reflex.  Hah, I'd watch that shit."
msgstr ""
"¿Sabes lo que echo de menos? Las salas de cine. ¿Crees que Hollywood ha "
"sobrevivido a esto? Tal vez hay un montón de actores zombis por ahí, "
"filmando mierda como reflejo. Ja, yo vería esa mierda."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I hear you, <name_g>…"
msgstr "Te escucho, <name_g>..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "That reminds me of something…"
msgstr "Eso me hace acordar a algo…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Right, right.  Say, you ever thought about…"
msgstr "Sí, sí. Oye, alguna vez pensaste sobre..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/backgrounds_table_of_contents.json
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_girl.json
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_BR_tableofcontents_AFS.json
msgid "<BGSS_intro_question>"
msgstr "<BGSS_intro_question>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/backgrounds_table_of_contents.json
msgid "How did you come to be a merc working for the Free Merchants, anyway?"
msgstr ""
"¿Cómo llegaste a ser un mercenario trabajando para los Mercaderes Libres, de"
" todos modos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/backgrounds_table_of_contents.json
msgid "So, you got your whisky.  Tell me that story."
msgstr "Ya tienes tu whisky. Cuéntame esa historia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/backgrounds_table_of_contents.json
msgid "<BOSS_intro_question>"
msgstr "<BOSS_intro_question>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/backgrounds_table_of_contents.json
msgid "<CWH_intro_question>"
msgstr "<CWH_intro_question>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I was just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather "
"was a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole "
"life, until some american <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do "
"anything about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I "
"have a chance to get my revenge!  And I got my revenge, thanks to a special "
"someone."
msgstr ""
"Yo era un pizzaiolo cualquiera. Mi padre era pizzaiolo, mi abuelo era "
"pizzaiolo y yo también me hice pizzaiolo. Hice pizza toda mi vida, hasta que"
" <name_b>americano me arruino el negocio. No pude hacer nada al respecto, "
"pero ahora, con <the_cataclysm>y <zombies> alrededor, ¡tengo la oportunidad "
"de vengarme! Y me he vengado gracias a una persona especial."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "He-he, that was a fun ride, <name_g>."
msgstr "Je je, ese fue un paseo divertido,<name_g> ."

