"Thank you for saving me.  It's a shame my mother didn't make it… you did "
"everything you could, and I don't blame you for it…"
msgstr ""
"Gracias por salvarme. Es una pena que mi madre no lo consiguiera... hiciste "
"todo lo que pudiste, y no te culpo por ello..."

