"I don't have much to tell, sorry.  I'm busy with helping my mom, tiding this"
" place to make it our new home.  You should talk to my dad, he doesn't look "
"busy right now.  Or always…"
msgstr ""
"No tengo mucho que contar, lo siento. Estoy ocupado ayudando a mi madre, "
"arreglando este lugar para que sea nuestro nuevo hogar. Deberías hablar con "
"mi padre, no parece estar ocupado ahora. O siempre..."

