"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Do Your Job\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Do you not conduct thorough background checks and reviews on new hires?  Joe is related to the Mayor of Springfield.  His 90 day New Employee evaluation is coming up.  Do your job."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Hacé Tu Trabajo\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" ¿No chequeaste el historial y las revisiones de las nuevas contrataciones? Joe es pariente del intendente de Springfield. Se acerca su evaluación de 90 días de Empleado Nuevo. Haz tu trabajo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Performance Evaluation\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, I look forward to seeing you Tuesday for my evaluation.  I've been working really hard to show that I am Shady Hills material!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Evaluación de Desempeño\n"
"\n"
" Hola, Sr. Rooters, espero con ganas verlo el martes para mi evaluación. ¡He estado trabajando mucho para demostrar que puedo trabajar en Shady Hills!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Connie has been asking a lot of weird questions about 'Ghosts' and other such nonsense.\n"
" This could look bad for us.  To make it worse, she is hanging out with Joe Shert a lot.\n"
" Shut it down."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Connie estuvo preguntando muchas cosas raras acerca de 'Fantasmas' y otros sinsentidos.\n"
" Esto podría hacernos quedar mal. Y para hacerlo peor, pasa mucho tiempo con Joe Shert.\n"
" Termina con esto."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, with all due respect I feel that I may have been assigned more of these tasks than the other Receptionists.\n"
" Jim said he hasn't had to do any cleaning in two weeks, yet I have been on cleaning duty 3 times.\n"
" To be clear, I certainly do not mind the extra work!  I just want to ensure you're aware in case there is a computer glitch.\n"
" Thank you and have a great day!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Servicio de Limpieza\n"
"\n"
" Hola, Sr. Rooters, con respeto quiero decirle que siento que me han asignado más de estas tareas que al resto de los recepcionistas.\n"
" Jim dijo que no tuvo que hacer ninguna tarea de limpieza en dos semanas, y sin embargo yo he estado en turno de limpieza 3 veces.\n"
" Para ser claro, ¡no me molesta el trabajo extra! Solo quiero asegurarme que usted está al tanto por si hay algún error con el ordenador.\n"
" ¡Gracias y que tenga un buen día!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Amanda Hugentskis, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Seriously?  This is ridiculous.  This place was a mess even with housekeeping personnel.\n"
" I quit."
msgstr ""
"DE: Amanda Hugentskis, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Servicio de Limpieza\n"
"\n"
" ¿En serio? Es ridículo, Este lugar era un desastre incluso con el personal de limpieza.\n"
" Renuncio."

