#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Leah Shepherds keeps sending me emails, and we just received the papers for yet another lawsuit.\n"
" I don't know what you're thinking but this one is going to be really difficult and could cost us.\n"
" The Board is going to be furious."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" Para: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Leah Shepherds me sigue mandando correos y acabamos de recibir los papeles de otra demanda judicial.\n"
" No sé qué piensas acerca de esto pero esta va a ser muy difícil y nos puede llegar a costar mucho.\n"
" La junta se va a poner furiosa."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Vincent Fuels, Researcher\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: This is bad!\n"
"\n"
" While you were gone last night, the old man started to wake up and become cranky.\n"
" We had to give him another dose of that elephant tranquilizer!\n"
" I think he might actually be strong enough to break out of his cell now.\n"
" We really need to do something before he kills someone!\n"
" I know this experiment meant a lot to you, but it isn't worth the risk anymore!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Vincent Fuels, Investigador\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Estamos complicados!\n"
"\n"
" Cuando saliste anoche, el viejo empezó a despertarse y se puso de mal humor.\n"
" ¡Le tuvimos que dar otra dosis de tranquilizante de elefantes!\n"
" Creo que en realidad es lo suficientemente fuerte como para escaparse de su celda ahora.\n"
" ¡Tenemos que hacer algo antes de que mate a alguien!\n"
" ¡Ya sé que este experimento significa mucho para ti pero ya no vale la pena el riesgo!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Budget\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" You need to find a way to reverse what you did ASAP.\n"
" What exactly do you expect me to do to get us out of this?\n"
" The police are investigating us now for foul play."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Presupuesto\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Tienes que encontrar una manera de revertir lo que hiciste lo antes posible.\n"
" ¿Qué esperas que haga yo para sacarnos es esto?\n"
" La policía nos está investigando buscando algo raro."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Unknown Sender\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Results\n"
"\n"
" Looking forward to your report at the next meeting.\n"
" I put a lot on the line for you, don't disappoint me, Peter.\n"
" Get me results."
msgstr ""
"DE: Desconocido\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Resultados\n"
"\n"
" Espero con ansias tu reporte en la próxima reunión.\n"
" Arriesgué mucho por ti, no me decepciones, Peter.\n"
" Quiero resultados."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Will Higgins, VP Information Technology\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Security\n"
"\n"
" Hello sir,\n"
" I understand your concerns about security.  Rest assured, myself and my team take this very seriously.  I assure you that high-level encryption protects all of our systems.\n"
" Nobody will be able to access any of our PCs without use of the owner's fingerprint authentication, even in the event that the main power supply is cut.\n"
" Nobody unauthorized will ever be able to read our emails or documents."
msgstr ""
"DE: Will Higgins, VP Información Tecnológica\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Seguridad\n"
"\n"
" Buenos días, señor,\n"
" Entiendo sus preocupaciones por la seguridad. Quédese tranquilo, mi equipo y yo tomamos esto de una manera muy seria. Le aseguro que el cifrado de alto nivel protege todos nuestros sistemas.\n"
" Nadie podrá acceder a ninguno de nuestros PC sin utilizar la autenticación por huella digital, incluso llegado el caso de que el sistema eléctrico esté cortado.\n"
" Nadie que no esté autorizado podrá nunca leer nuestros correos ni documentos."

