#. ~ Description of "XS faux fur winter survivor mask"
#: data/json/obsoletion/obsolete_items.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built, faux fur-trimmed gas mask that covers the face and eyes.  "
"Provides excellent protection from smoke, tear gas, and shrapnel, and while "
"not quite as warm as real fur, it's pretty good.  It must be prepared before"
" use."
msgstr ""
"Una máscara de gas de piel sintética personalizada que cubre la cara y los "
"ojos. Proporciona una excelente protección contra el humo, los gases "
"lacrimógenos y la metralla y, aunque no es tan cálida como la piel real, es "
"bastante buena. Debe ser preparada antes de usarse."

