msgid "spears (beginner)"
msgstr "lanzas (principiante)"

#. ~ Description of practice "spears (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice the basics of spears, the most popular melee weapon throughout "
"history.  Learn the footwork, how to thrust with power, where to place your "
"hands, and the right way to hold the damn thing.  Dominant hand back, non-"
"dominant forward!"
msgstr ""
"Practica los fundamentos básicos de la lucha con lanzas, el arma de c.a.c. "
"mas popular de la historia. Aprende el juego de pies, como lanzar con "
"potencia, donde poner tus manos, y la manera correcta de aguantar la dichosa"
" cosa. ¡La mano dominante detrás, y la otra delante!"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "spears (intermediate)"
msgstr "lanzas (intermedio)"

#. ~ Description of practice "spears (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice advanced spear moves and accurate thrusts against a training dummy."
"  It's not glamorous, but spears were the workhorses of armed combat for "
"millenia with good reason."
msgstr ""
"Practica movimientos avanzados con lanza y ataques de avance contra un "
"maniquí de entrenamiento. No es glamuroso, pero las lanzas fueron los "
"caballos de batalla del combate armado durante miles de años por una buena "
"razón."

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "long thrusting swords (beginner)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "long thrusting swords (beginner)"
