msgid "knives (beginner)"
msgstr "cuchillos (principiante)"

#. ~ Description of practice "knives (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice the brutal art of shanking the shit out of something until it dies."
"  Learn the form, where and how to stab to avoid your knife glancing off "
"bone, and whether you should actually hold the knife in reverse grip.  (It "
"depends.)"
msgstr ""
"Practica el brutal arte de acuchillar algo hasta que muere. Aprende la "
"forma, donde y como apuñalar para evitar que tu cuchillo toque hueso, y si "
"deberías sostener el cuchillo al revés. (Dependiendo de la situación.)"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "knives (intermediate)"
msgstr "cuchillos (intermedio)"

#. ~ Description of practice "knives (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Get in touch with your inner commando and practice some advanced knife-"
"fighting techniques on a training dummy."
msgstr ""
"Conecta con tu comando interior y practica algunas técnicas avanzadas con "
"cuchillo en un maniquí de entrenamiento."

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "shivs (beginner)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "shivs (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"You wouldn't think it, but there is more to stabbing someone with something "
"small and pointy.  Practice shanking an imaginary enemy where it hurts most."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "shivs (intermediate)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "shivs (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice shanking the ever living hell out of a dummy to hone your accuracy "
"and grip while you gut someone."
msgstr ""

