#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"ATOMIC DEREGULATION!  President Toffer announced to a mixed crowd today that"
" he had signed an executive order to deregulate public use of radioactive "
"compounds, allowing more widespread use of low-grade radioactive compounds "
"in home appliances.  \"Plutonium is the greenest energy we have,\" he told "
"an assembled press.  \"It's time we got over our fear and moved into the "
"light.\""
msgstr ""
"DESREGULACIÓN ATÓMICA! El Presidente Toffer anunció hoy a una multitud mixta"
" que había firmado una orden ejecutiva para desregular el uso público de "
"compuestos radioactivos, permitiendo un uso más extendido de compuestos "
"radioactivos de bajo grado en los electrodomésticos. \"El plutonio es la "
"energía más verde que tenemos\", dijo a la prensa reunida. \"Es hora de que "
"superemos nuestro miedo y salgamos a la luz.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"CELEBRATED PHYSICIST GOES MISSING.  Dr. Amy Takatoshi, a celebrated quantum "
"physicist at MIT dubbed by some as \"the next Hawking\" has gone missing "
"shortly before a press conference that was expected to be the announcement "
"of her newest research results, rumored to be in the field of teleportation."
msgstr ""
"EL CÉLEBRE FÍSICO DESAPARECE. La Dra. Amy Takatoshi, una célebre física "
"cuántica del MIT apodada por algunos como \"la próxima Hawking\" ha "
"desaparecido poco antes de una conferencia de prensa que se esperaba fuera "
"el anuncio de los resultados de su más reciente investigación, que se "
"rumoreaba que está en el campo de la teletransportación."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE UN SHOULD PUT ON ITS BIG-BOY PANTS.  So, driven by decreasing"
" regulation of radioactive materials in the US and China, the UN is pushing "
"hard again for nuclear disarmament.  What a tired old litany this has "
"become.  With deregulation, we've been able to slate three new green nuclear"
" reactors in the Eastern US alone, bringing greenhouse-gas free power to "
"millions of people.  Whatever happened to the UN's focus on global warming?"
"  This is a classic situation of the world painting the USA as villains no "
"matter what we do."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LA ONU DEBERÍA PONERSE SUS PANTALONES DE NIÑO GRANDE. Así que, "
"impulsada por la disminución de la regulación de los materiales radiactivos "
"en los EE.UU. y China, la ONU está presionando duro de nuevo para el desarme"
" nuclear. En qué vieja y cansada letanía se ha convertido esto. Con la "
"desregulación, hemos sido capaces de poner en la pizarra tres nuevos "
"reactores nucleares ecológicos sólo en el este de EE.UU., llevando energía "
"libre de gases de efecto invernadero a millones de personas. ¿Qué pasó con "
"el enfoque de la ONU sobre el calentamiento global? Esta es una situación "
"clásica del mundo que pinta a los EE.UU. como villanos sin importar lo que "
"hagamos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"US IGNORES UN DEMANDS: The US ambassador to the UN today turned down UN "
"requests to begin mutual nuclear disarmament of China, the US and North "
"Korea.  \"We have a right to defend ourselves,\" insisted the ambassador.  "
"\"We'll back down when they do\"."
msgstr ""
"El embajador de EE.UU. en la ONU rechazó hoy las peticiones de la ONU para "
"comenzar el desarme nuclear mutuo de China, EE.UU. y Corea del Norte. "
"\"Tenemos derecho a defendernos\", insistió el embajador. \"Nos echaremos "
"atrás cuando lo hagan\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"DISASTER IN THE SARITANIA MINES!  A copper mine west of Saritania, a small "
"town in Vermont, collapsed Wednesday, killing an estimated thirty miners in "
"the disaster.  Local officials could not be reached for comment, despite the"
" mine being Saritania's primary industry.  An anonymous but credible source "
"did contact our offices, claiming that the Saritania Mine was in fact an "
"underground military facility, and that the disaster was a cover-up for a "
"failed experiment.  These allegations were not addressed by officials."
msgstr ""
"DESASTRE EN LAS MINAS DE SARANIA! Una mina de cobre al oeste de Saritania, "
"un pequeño pueblo en Vermont, se derrumbó el miércoles, matando a unos "
"treinta mineros en el desastre. Los funcionarios locales no pudieron ser "
"contactados para hacer comentarios, a pesar de que la mina es la principal "
"industria de Saritania. Una fuente anónima pero creíble se puso en contacto "
"con nuestras oficinas, afirmando que la mina Saritania era de hecho una "
"instalación militar subterránea, y que el desastre era un encubrimiento para"
" un experimento fallido. Estas acusaciones no fueron abordadas por los "
"funcionarios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ALIENS AMONG US!  Janine Galfrizowich, of Martha's Vineyard, wrote in to our"
" Paranormal Investigation Staff with this cryptic gem.  \"They're always "
"watching, always watching from the shadows.  Stealing my avocados and "
"watching!  They took my neighbor and made him into one of them!\"  Our "
"journalists are trying to track Mrs Galfrizowich down, but it is clear "
"enough that this ties into the well known Avocado Conspiracy (see issue 24, "
"volume 7)."
msgstr ""
"EXTRATERRESTRES ENTRE NOSOTROS! Janine Galfrizowich, de Martha's Vineyard, "
"escribió a nuestro personal de investigación paranormal con esta gema "
"críptica. \"Siempre están mirando, siempre mirando desde las sombras. "
"¡Robando mis aguacates y observando! ¡Se llevaron a mi vecino y lo "
"convirtieron en uno de ellos!\" Nuestros periodistas intentaron localizar a "
"la Sra. Galfrizowich, pero está claro que esto está relacionado con la "
"conocida Conspiración de los Aguacates (ver número 24, volumen 7)."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: MORE HOMES NEED GUNS.  While visiting a friend recently, our "
"conversation turned to gun control, and I was shocked to learn that my close"
" friend didn't own a firearm.  In this day and age, not having a deadly "
"weapon in your home shows an appalling lack of personal safety, and I told "
"him so.  Weapons that can kill a man, or several men, in an instant - "
"sometimes even accidentally - are our only hope against other people armed "
"similarly.  I see a utopia of honest citizens keeping each other honest by "
"being armed to the teeth."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: MÁS HOGARES NECESITAN ARMAS. Mientras visitaba a un amigo "
"recientemente, nuestra conversación se centró en el control de armas, y me "
"sorprendió saber que mi amigo íntimo no poseía un arma de fuego. Hoy en día,"
" no tener un arma mortal en tu casa muestra una terrible falta de seguridad "
"personal, y se lo dije. Las armas que pueden matar a un hombre, o a varios "
"hombres, en un instante - a veces incluso accidentalmente - son nuestra "
"única esperanza contra otras personas armadas de manera similar. Veo una "
"utopía de ciudadanos honestos manteniéndose honestos unos a otros armados "
"hasta los dientes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: LET ME BUY MY DANG PLUTONIUM.  President Toffer made a bold and "
"unpopular move last month with nuclear regulation changes.  I, for one, "
"couldn't be more excited.  By now, we know very well what the risks of "
"radioactive materials are, and can take the measures to protect ourselves.  "
"Our citizens deserve the right to make the informed choice to purchase "
"atomic powered tools should they wish, and in this era of fossil fuel and "
"global warming concerns, what could be more appropriate than powering a home"
" with a radioisotope thermal generator?"
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: DÉJAME COMPRAR MI MALDITO PLUTONIO. El Presidente Toffer hizo un "
"movimiento audaz e impopular el mes pasado con los cambios en la regulación "
"nuclear. Yo, por mi parte, no podría estar más emocionado. A estas alturas, "
"sabemos muy bien cuáles son los riesgos de los materiales radioactivos, y "
"podemos tomar las medidas para protegernos. Nuestros ciudadanos merecen el "
"derecho a tomar la decisión informada de comprar herramientas de energía "
"atómica si así lo desean, y en esta era de preocupaciones por el combustible"
" fósil y el calentamiento global, ¿qué podría ser más apropiado que "
"alimentar una casa con un generador térmico de radioisótopos?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: ALIENS ARE BACK IN A BIG WAY.  We've all seen that autopsy video "
"that's making the rounds.  I'm not going to say if I believe it's real or "
"not (I will say \"I want to believe\" though!) but regardless of the truth, "
"one thing is clear: the public mind is completely addicted to aliens in the "
"biggest way I've seen since ET was popular.  What's brought little green men"
" back into the public eye?  It's anyone's guess, but personally I think it's"
" a concerning sign that we're culturally digging in to a second Cold War."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LOS EXTRATERRESTRES HAN VUELTO A LO GRANDE. Todos hemos visto ese"
" video de la autopsia que está rondando. No voy a decir si creo que es real "
"o no (¡diré \"quiero creer\"!) pero a pesar de la verdad, una cosa está "
"clara: la mente del público es completamente adicta a los extraterrestres de"
" la manera más grande que he visto desde que ET fue popular. ¿Qué ha traído "
"a los hombrecitos verdes de vuelta al ojo público? Es una suposición, pero "
"personalmente creo que es una señal preocupante de que estamos cavando "
"culturalmente en una segunda Guerra Fría."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"POPULAR 'ALIEN AUTOPSY' DEBUNKED.  A widely circulated video, making the "
"rounds everywhere from FriendFace to television news, has been debunked as a"
" fake.  This extremely realistic and graphic alien autopsy shows an insect-"
"like creature being dismantled by Japanese researchers, who comment on its "
"anatomy in Japanese throughout the video.  Early observations that the "
"creature was suspiciously similar to those described in the popular works of"
" horror author HP Lovecraft were not sufficient to dislodge the video's "
"viral status.  Yesterday, on the popular social media website Eddit, a "
"'making of' video was posted, clearly exposing the work as the final film "
"project of a small group of students at UCLA."
msgstr ""
"LA POPULAR \"AUTOPSIA ALIENÍGENA\" DESACREDITADA. Un video ampliamente "
"difundido, que ha estado rondando por todos lados desde FriendFace hasta las"
" noticias de televisión, ha sido desacreditado como una falsificación. Esta "
"autopsia alienígena extremadamente realista y gráfica muestra una criatura "
"parecida a un insecto que está siendo desmantelada por investigadores "
"japoneses, que comentan su anatomía en japonés a lo largo del vídeo. Las "
"primeras observaciones de que la criatura era sospechosamente similar a las "
"descritas en las populares obras de horror del autor HP Lovecraft no fueron "
"suficientes para desalojar el estatus viral del video. Ayer, en el popular "
"sitio web de medios sociales Eddit, se publicó un video \"making of\", "
"exponiendo claramente el trabajo como el proyecto final de película de un "
"pequeño grupo de estudiantes de la UCLA."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"STUDENT MISSING: A high school student vanished yesterday evening in the "
"forest near Wayland.  The 17-year-old student Brett Dong was last seen with "
"his friends in the camp.  \"Brett said that he was gonna get some firewood "
"but he never came back,\" said his classmate, Jianxiang Wang.  The search is"
" underway."
msgstr ""
"ESTUDIANTE DESAPARECIDO: Un estudiante de secundaria desapareció ayer por la"
" tarde en el bosque cerca de Wayland. El estudiante de 17 años Brett Dong "
"fue visto por última vez con sus amigos en el campo. \"Brett dijo que iba a "
"buscar leña, pero nunca volvió\", dijo su compañero de clase, Jianxiang "
"Wang. La búsqueda está en marcha."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"STILL SEARCHING: The search for Brett Dong, the high school student who went"
" missing three days ago, is still ongoing.  \"He could have played in the "
"soccer game against Weston High School yesterday,\" Brett's sorrowful "
"teammate said, \"[…] we've never stopped praying.\"  Despite the best "
"efforts of the County Search & Rescue, Brett had still not been located at "
"the time of this report."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"RUMORS DENIED: Allegations from search parties hunting for Brett Dong, that "
"a civilian research facility just outside Wayland is a front for a "
"government facility researching dangerous technologies, were addressed "
"during a press conference earlier today.  \"I have to clarify that not only "
"have we never done such research,\" said the officer on the press "
"conference.  \"These allegations are absurd.  Teleportation and aliens only "
"exist in sci-fi films, and the US certainly doesn't have the funds to build "
"these extensive underground networks people are talking about.  I can't "
"believe I even have to tell you this.  I don't know what those kids saw that"
" put these ideas in their heads, but they're going through an awful lot with"
" the loss of their friend.\""
msgstr ""
"RUMORES NEGADOS: Las alegaciones de los grupos de búsqueda que buscan a "
"Brett Dong, de que una instalación de investigación civil en las afueras de "
"Wayland es una fachada para una instalación del gobierno que investiga "
"tecnologías peligrosas, fueron tratadas durante la conferencia de prensa de "
"hoy . \"Tengo que aclarar que no sólo nunca hemos hecho tal investigación\","
" dijo el oficial en la conferencia de prensa. \"Estas acusaciones son "
"absurdas. El teletransporte y los extraterrestres sólo existen en las "
"películas de ciencia ficción, y los EE.UU. ciertamente no tiene los fondos "
"para construir estas extensas redes subterráneas de las que la gente está "
"hablando. No puedo creer que tenga que decirles esto. No sé qué vieron esos "
"chicos para meterse esas ideas en la cabeza, pero ya lo están pasando muy "
"mal con la pérdida de su amigo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"TANK SUIT!  In a press conference on Tuesday, General Ariel Dabrowski was "
"proud to unveil the new military \"tank suit\", a powered exoskeleton "
"capable of resisting small arms fire and most heavy weapons.  \"Tank suits "
"have been used in limited deployment in Afghanistan for several months "
"now,\" General Dabrowski informed the gathered press.  \"We're proud to be "
"at a point where we can formally introduce them to the public.  These suits "
"are just the first stage in a new generation of mechanized infantry.\""
msgstr ""
"¡TRAJE TANQUE! En una conferencia de prensa el martes, el General Ariel "
"Dabrowski se enorgulleció de presentar el nuevo \"traje tanque\" militar, un"
" exoesqueleto motorizado capaz de resistir el fuego de las armas pequeñas y "
"la mayoría de las armas pesadas. \"Los trajes tanque han sido usados en un "
"despliegue limitado en Afganistán desde hace varios meses\", informó el "
"General Dabrowski a la prensa reunida. \"Estamos orgullosos de estar en un "
"punto en el que podemos presentarlos formalmente al público. Estos trajes "
"son sólo la primera etapa de una nueva generación de infantería "
"mecanizada.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDISON AUTOMOTIVES UNVEILS NEW SOLAR CAR.  \"These miracles of technology "
"wouldn't be possible without the deregulations pioneered by President "
"Toffer,\" said billionaire tech mogul Elton Moosek about his company's "
"newest innovation.  \"Access to radioactive compounds and military-grade "
"fuel cells has made this possible.  At this rate, we'll be flying solar sail"
" spacecraft within my lifetime.\""
msgstr ""
"AUTOMÓVILES EDISON PRESENTA EL NUEVO COCHE SOLAR. \"Estos milagros de la "
"tecnología no serían posibles sin las desregulaciones iniciadas por el "
"Presidente Toffer\", dijo el magnate tecnológico multimillonario Elton "
"Moosek sobre la más reciente innovación de su compañía. \"El acceso a los "
"compuestos radioactivos y a las células de combustible de grado militar ha "
"hecho esto posible. A este ritmo, estaremos volando naves espaciales de vela"
" solar a lo largo de mi vida.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"REAL AI IN THE PALM OF YOUR HAND.  [Photograph: Dania Tang holds a new-"
"generation heuristic processor, weighing a mere seventy grams.]  Engineers "
"at MIT, working in conjunction with a funding grant from entrepreneur Elton "
"Moosek, have unveiled a next-generation deep learning heuristic processor.  "
"\"I'm hesitant to call it an artificial intelligence,\" spokesperson Dania "
"Tang said of the new device, \"but it's the closest we've yet achieved.  "
"It's able to instantly analyze dozens of possible outcomes of a future "
"action and choose the best one, much like a human uses deductive "
"reasoning.\"  Under a new startup, MindStone, the processors are reputedly "
"already being contracted for military use."
msgstr ""
"UNA VERDADERA I.A. EN LA PALMA DE TU MANO. [Fotografía: Dania Tang sujeta un"
" procesador heurístico de nueva generación, con un peso de sólo setenta "
"gramos.] Ingenieros del MIT, trabajando en conjunto con una subvención del "
"empresario Elton Moosek, han revelado un procesador heurístico de "
"aprendizaje profundo de nueva generación. \"No me atrevo a llamarlo "
"inteligencia artificial\", dijo la portavoz Dania Tang sobre el nuevo "
"dispositivo, \"pero es lo más parecido que hemos conseguido hasta ahora\". "
"Es capaz de analizar instantáneamente docenas de posibles resultados de una "
"acción futura y elegir la mejor, de forma muy parecida a como un humano "
"utiliza el razonamiento deductivo\". Bajo un nuevo startup, MindStone, se "
"dice que los procesadores ya han sido contratados para uso militar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GENERAL PROMOTED ONBOARD OLD IRONSIDES.  The USS Constitution was the site "
"of a promotion ceremony held by the Massachusetts National Guard at the "
"Charlestown Navy Yard.  Col. Ariel Dabrowski was promoted to the rank of "
"brigadier general in the Massachusetts National Guard in front of a crowd "
"massed on the deck of the historic ship.  General Carlsberg officiated the "
"promotion ceremony, and Maj. Gen. Michael Baker administered the oath of "
"office."
msgstr ""
"GENERAL ASCENDIDO A BORDO DEL VIEJO IRONIDES El USS Constitution fue el "
"escenario de una ceremonia de ascenso celebrada por la Guardia Nacional de "
"Massachusetts en el astillero naval de Charlestown. El coronel Ariel "
"Dabrowski fue ascendido al rango de general de brigada de la Guardia "
"Nacional de Massachusetts ante una multitud congregada en la cubierta del "
"histórico buque. El general Carlsberg ofició la ceremonia de ascenso y el "
"general de división Michael Baker prestó el juramento del cargo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE FACE BEHIND THE 'UNCANNY' MASK.  Everyone knows about James Hawthorne, "
"projected to become America's newest and fastest rising billionaire by next "
"month as stock value in his tech startup, Uncanny, grows at unprecedented "
"speeds.  We decided to explore the names behind the rise you might not have "
"heard.  Dr. Marc Silverstein, an MIT-trained researcher formerly involved "
"with Leapfrog Industries, has been along for the ride the whole time, and "
"has come out nearly as wealthy as Hawthorne himself.  Though impressively "
"reclusive, we managed to snag some pretty interesting information about Dr. "
"S.  Could he be the real mind behind the rise?  How much does James depend "
"on his right-hand scientist?  Details on page 12."
msgstr ""
"LA CARA DETRÁS DE LA MÁSCARA 'ASOMBROSO'. Todo el mundo conoce a James "
"Hawthorne, que se convertirá en el multimillonario más reciente y de más "
"rápido crecimiento de Estados Unidos el mes que viene, ya que el valor de "
"las acciones de su empresa tecnológica, Asombroso, crece a una velocidad sin"
" precedentes. Hemos decidido explorar los nombres que hay detrás de este "
"ascenso y que quizá no hayas oído. El Dr. Marc Silverstein, un investigador "
"formado en el MIT y anteriormente involucrado en Industrias SaltoDeRana, ha "
"estado en el camino todo el tiempo, y ha salido casi tan rico como el propio"
" Hawthorne. Aunque es impresionantemente reservado, hemos conseguido obtener"
" información muy interesante sobre el Dr. S. ¿Podría ser la verdadera mente "
"detrás del ascenso? ¿Cuánto depende James de su mano derecha científica? "
"Detalles en la página 12."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"FORMER RCI DIVISION PURCHASED BY FOREIGN INVESTORS.  A former division of "
"Rivet and Crimp Industries, a major subcontractor for national defense "
"manufacturers, has recently been purchased by Taiwanese American tech "
"billionaire Henry Gau.  CEO of Formosa OptoTech, Gau is known for his close "
"relationship with Chinese suppliers and manufacturers. Branding the company "
"RivTech, the company will focus on competing in the US Next Generation Squad"
" Weapons trial.  Rivet and Crimp Industries's former weapons manufactory "
"division is previously known for manufacturing a pump-action grenade "
"launcher entrant in the M32 Multiple Grenade Launcher Trial, embroiling RCI "
"and tech partner Javelin Systems in a bitter, expensive legal battle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT SCIENCE BOOST: The government has drastically increased research "
"and development budgets after UN disarmament demands.  \"This not only keeps"
" money in our country, but maintains our lead on China and keeps us "
"defended\", President Oswald said.  \"This is a fight we can't afford to "
"lose.  We're not deaf to the concerns of our population: this is a blanket "
"increase, not just to military R&D spending but civilian as well.  We've "
"authorized the construction of seventy nine new private civilian research "
"facilities along the Eastern Seaboard alone!\""
msgstr ""
"El gobierno ha aumentado drásticamente los presupuestos de investigación y "
"desarrollo después de las demandas de desarme de la ONU. \"Esto no sólo "
"mantiene el dinero en nuestro país, sino que mantiene nuestra ventaja sobre "
"China y nos mantiene defendidos\", dijo el Presidente Oswald. \"Esta es una "
"lucha que no podemos permitirnos perder. No estamos sordos a las "
"preocupaciones de nuestra población: este es un aumento general, no sólo del"
" gasto en I+D militar, sino también civil. Hemos autorizado la construcción "
"de setenta y nueve nuevas instalaciones de investigación civil privada sólo "
"a lo largo de la costa este!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"HOME GROWN SCIENCE: Several governors & legislators from the New England "
"region discussed a new regional initiative today, which relaxed laws that "
"limit the distance a hazardous-material laboratory or factory can be from a "
"city.  \"This should keep our economy going strong for years to come, with "
"all the R&D facilities being established,\", one mayor remarked.  \"With all"
" the new money coming in, we've seen a huge uptick in highly educated people"
" moving into the area too.  It's been nice, our coffee shops in particular "
"are doing very well.\""
msgstr ""
"CIENCIA CASERA: Varios gobernadores y legisladores de la región de Nueva "
"Inglaterra debatieron hoy una nueva iniciativa regional, que flexibilizó las"
" leyes que limitan la distancia que un laboratorio o fábrica de materiales "
"peligrosos puede tener de una ciudad. \"Esto debería mantener nuestra "
"economía fuerte en los años venideros, con todas las instalaciones de "
"investigación y desarrollo que se han establecido\", comentó un alcalde. "
"\"Con todo el dinero nuevo que está entrando, hemos visto un gran aumento de"
" personas altamente educadas que se mudan a la zona también. Ha sido "
"agradable, nuestras cafeterías en particular lo están llevando muy bien.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"DRIVING ON A WING AND A PRAYER: A New England man has proven it is possible "
"to create a new car from scrap parts using almost nothing but duct tape.  "
"When asked why he had done it, his answer was \"Well, I didn't have a "
"welder.\""
msgstr ""
"CONDUCIENDO CON UN ALAMBRE Y AYUDA DIVINA: Un hombre de Nueva Inglaterra ha "
"probado que es posible crear un coche desde cero usando casi solamente cinta"
" americana. Cuando se le preguntó por qué lo había hecho, su respuesta fue "
"\"Bueno, no tenía soldador.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"TECHWORLD NEWS: Toy company at the origin of the successful talking doll "
"rebrands and becomes Uncanny.  A spokesperson from the newly formed Uncanny "
"told the press, \"We think we can do more than just entertain.  We have new "
"plans, big plans, plans that will shape the very fabric of reality!\"  "
"Unconfirmed rumors suggest that Uncanny has already received large orders "
"from the government."
msgstr ""
"NOTICIAS DE TECHWORLD: La compañía de juguetes que fue el origen del exitoso"
" muñeco parlante se renueva y se convierte en Asombroso. Un portavoz de la "
"recién formada Asombroso dijo a la prensa: \"Creemos que podemos hacer algo "
"más que entretener. ¡Tenemos nuevos planes, grandes planes, planes que darán"
" forma al tejido de la realidad!\" Rumores no confirmados sugieren que "
"Asombroso ya ha recibido grandes pedidos del gobierno."

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE 'UNCANNY' SUCCESS STORY.  Everyone's talking about the meteoric rise of "
"tech startup \"Uncanny\" over the last few months.  From zero to household "
"name, the company leapt to the public eye with its, well, uncanny line of "
"talking toys.  Before we even knew what to expect, they were Wall Street's "
"new darling, with the fastest rise in manufacturing capacity of any company "
"in the last thirty years.  We spoke to James Hawthorne, America's newest "
"billionaire and the man behind the name on everyone's lips.  Interview on "
"page 3."
msgstr ""
"LA HISTORIA DE ÉXITO DE 'ASOMBROSO' Todo el mundo habla del meteórico "
"ascenso de la empresa tecnológica \"Asombroso\" en los últimos meses. De "
"cero a un nombre familiar, la empresa saltó a la palestra pública con su "
"línea de juguetes parlantes. Antes de que supiéramos lo que nos esperaba, "
"era la nueva favorita de Wall Street, con el aumento más rápido de la "
"capacidad de fabricación de cualquier empresa en los últimos treinta años. "
"Hablamos con James Hawthorne, el nuevo multimillonario de Estados Unidos y "
"el hombre que está detrás del nombre que está en boca de todos. Entrevista "
"en la página 3."

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SOYPELUSA SUITS FIND NEW AMMO:  Following the infamous disaster of the "
"DaiZoom product launch and the numerous lawsuits that sprung from its "
"failure, research from Harvard's Cognitive Neuropsychology labs has brought "
"new evidence in the ongoing litigation against the company.  We spoke with "
"lead researcher Doctor Soren Eldridge who had this to say: \"The DaiZoom "
"bar, beyond its notoriously bad taste, appears to cause in its consumers "
"symptoms similar to those of a major depressive disorder.  There is an "
"actual tangible impact on mood that lasts well beyond the initial "
"consumption of even just a few bars in a short span of time - we suspect "
"DaiZoom may actually be chemically inhibiting dopamine receptors.  This is "
"unprecedented, and quite exciting, given that it consists entirely of "
"otherwise biochemically bland ingredients.\"  Doctor Eldridge stated that "
"further research would be needed to determine the full extent of the issue "
"and whether consumption of DaiZoom had long-term health effects similar to "
"existing dopamine blocking drugs, and if there is any role for it as a "
"medical therapy in the future.  The full interview can be found on page 7."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"READY FOR THE WORST.  In response to growing public concern about a "
"potential attack from China, President Oswald announced a major funding "
"initiative for the construction of FEMA-supported evacuation shelters near "
"major population sites.  \"These shelters will provide a much-needed near "
"safety points in an emergency,\" said a spokesperson for FEMA.  \"They're to"
" be equipped with a secure basement that can resist heavy bombardment, able "
"to fit hundreds of people, and equipped to survive gas and biological "
"attacks.  They have self-contained water and power, protective gear, and "
"communications equipment.  In short, they are public survivalist bunkers.  "
"We've very excited about this initiative.\""
msgstr ""
"PREPARADO PARA LO PEOR. En respuesta a la creciente preocupación pública por"
" un posible ataque de China, el Presidente Oswald anunció una importante "
"iniciativa de financiación para la construcción de refugios de evacuación "
"apoyados por la FEMA cerca de los principales centros de población. \"Estos "
"refugios proporcionarán un muy necesario punto de seguridad cercano en caso "
"de emergencia\", dijo un portavoz de FEMA. \"Estarán equipados con un sótano"
" seguro que pueda resistir fuertes bombardeos, capaz de albergar a cientos "
"de personas y equipado para sobrevivir a ataques biológicos y con gas\". "
"Tienen agua y energía autónomas, equipo de protección y equipo de "
"comunicaciones. En resumen, son búnkeres públicos de supervivencialistas. "
"Estamos muy entusiasmados con esta iniciativa\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GRAVE BUSINESS: Recent reports show a large spike in thefts from and "
"assaults on funeral homes in the last few weeks.  Described as highly "
"strange but not especially dangerous, Homeland Security is \"looking at the "
"connections now.\""
msgstr ""
"EL NEGOCIO DE LAS TUMBAS: Informes recientes muestran un gran incremento en "
"asaltos a casas fúnebres en las últimas semanas. Descrito como muy extraño "
"pero no especialmente peligroso, Seguridad Nacional está \"buscando en este "
"momento los vínculos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"TELEPORTATION?  An unidentified source working in a major university "
"contacted multiple media outlets this week with a farfetched story that is "
"nonetheless corroborated by third-party physicists as \"shockingly "
"possible\".  This source, nicknamed \"Deep Space\", describes secret "
"government experimentation into teleportation, dating back to before 2008.  "
"\"When I read the tagline, I just scoffed,\" said Dr. Alice Feyn, a physics "
"professor at MIT.  \"Then I read on.  This is strongly reminiscent of Dr. "
"Takatoshi's lost work.  It feels bizarre to say it, but I think there's a "
"grain of truth to all of this.\"  Dr. Amy Takatoshi was a quantum physicist "
"who went missing, along with all records of her work, in July 2007."
msgstr ""
"¿TELEPORTACIÓN? Una fuente no identificada que trabaja en una universidad "
"importante contactó con múltiples medios de comunicación esta semana con una"
" historia inverosímil que, sin embargo, es corroborada por terceros físicos "
"como \"sorprendentemente posible\". Esta fuente, apodada \"Espacio "
"Profundo\", describe la experimentación secreta del gobierno en la "
"teletransportación, que se remonta a antes de 2008. \"Cuando leí el eslogan,"
" me burlé\", dijo la Dra. Alice Feyn, una profesora de física del MIT. "
"\"Luego seguí leyendo. Esto recuerda mucho al trabajo perdido de Dra. "
"Takatoshi. Se siente extraño decirlo, pero creo que hay un grano de verdad "
"en todo esto.\" La Dra. Amy Takatoshi era una física cuántica que "
"desapareció, junto con todos los registros de su trabajo, en julio de 2007."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"LASERS - NEXT BIG THING?: Top defense researchers remarked during demonstration of a prototype today: \"We are still working on it, the laser weapon lacks power, but has a technically almost unlimited range,\" Colonel Sylver, a spokesperson for the military said.  Laser weapons have been used for years in large-scale platforms, especially as anti-ordnance weapons; this marks the first field use of human-sized energy weapons.\n"
"\n"
"\"There's no real advantage over conventional weaponry at this point,\" said analyst Mark Coza in an interview.  \"I think they're rolling them out mainly to intimidate China, and in the hopes that field testing leads to further improvements.\""
msgstr ""
"LOS LÁSERES... ¿LA PRÓXIMA GRAN NOVEDAD? Los principales investigadores de defensa comentaron durante la demostración de un prototipo hoy: \"Todavía estamos trabajando en ello, el arma láser carece de potencia, pero tiene un alcance técnicamente casi ilimitado\", dijo el Coronel Sylver, un portavoz del ejército. Las armas láser se han utilizado durante años en plataformas a gran escala, especialmente como armas antiarmas; esto marca el primer uso de campo de las armas de energía de tamaño humano.\n"
"\n"
"\"No hay ninguna ventaja real sobre el armamento convencional en este momento\", dijo el analista Mark Coza en una entrevista. \"Creo que las están desplegando principalmente para intimidar a China, y con la esperanza de que las pruebas de campo conduzcan a nuevas mejoras\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"DRUG USE ON THE RISE: Recent statistic suggest drug use in New England has "
"climbed more than 20% in the last two years.  \"People are scared for their "
"jobs, their country, even their life… of course some will turn to drugs,\" "
"said an expert."
msgstr ""
"EL USO DE DROGAS EN AUMENTO: Estadísticas recientes sugieren que el uso de "
"drogas en Nueva Inglaterra ha aumentado más del 20% en los últimos dos años."
" \"La gente teme por su trabajo, su país, incluso por su vida... por "
"supuesto que algunos recurrirán a las drogas\", dijo un experto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: DRUG USE SPIKE DUE TO ECONOMY.  It's no secret that President "
"Oswald's promises of a booming new tech economy have fallen flat on their "
"face.  Whether you're a Democrat or a Republican, we should all be ready to "
"march on Washington and let Oswald know how we feel about broken promises "
"and unemployment.  Instead, people are drowning their sorrows in drugs, as "
"usual, and nothing will change."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL AUMENTO DEL CONSUMO DE DROGAS DEBIDO A LA ECONOMÍA. No es un "
"secreto que las promesas del Presidente Oswald de una economía de nueva "
"tecnología en auge han caído de bruces. Ya sea demócrata o republicano, "
"todos deberíamos estar listos para marchar a Washington y dejar que Oswald "
"sepa lo que sentimos sobre las promesas rotas y el desempleo. En cambio, la "
"gente está ahogando sus penas en las drogas, como siempre, y nada cambiará."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: SOCIAL MEDIA HAS GOTTEN OUT OF HAND, AND GONE OUT OF COUNTRY.  We"
" can no longer trust what we read, and it's all because of social media.  "
"Although our newspaper takes painstaking efforts to source our data, our "
"colleagues have forgotten what it means to be a journalist, and widespread "
"falsehoods are repeated even by reputable publications as fact.  What is the"
" ultimate source of all this misinformation?  It's anyone's guess, but I "
"think we need look no further than our largest international trade partner "
"and rival, China."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LOS MEDIOS DE COMUNICACIÓN SOCIAL SE HAN SALIDO DE CONTROL, Y SE "
"HAN IDO DEL PAÍS. Ya no podemos confiar en lo que leemos, y es todo debido a"
" las redes sociales. Aunque nuestro periódico se esfuerza por obtener "
"nuestros datos, nuestros colegas han olvidado lo que significa ser "
"periodista, y las falsedades generalizadas se repiten incluso en "
"publicaciones de renombre como un hecho. ¿Cuál es la fuente última de toda "
"esta desinformación? Es una conjetura de cualquiera, pero creo que no "
"tenemos que buscar más allá de nuestro mayor socio comercial internacional y"
" rival, China."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: HOME CANNING NEEDS TO MAKE A COMEBACK.  With food security in "
"question after severe drought this year, I think it's clear we all need to "
"get out Grandma's old books, and learn how to can again.  Grocery stores "
"could be a bit empty this winter, and now is the time to make pickles and "
"preserves while the pickling's good.  In this issue, three of our editors "
"share their uplifting stories of rediscovering the joys of home canning."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL ENLATADO CASERO NECESITA VOLVER. Con la seguridad alimentaria "
"en cuestión después de la grave sequía de este año, creo que está claro que "
"todos tenemos que sacar los libros viejos de la abuela, y aprender cómo se "
"enlatar de nuevo. Las tiendas de comestibles podrían estar un poco vacías "
"este invierno, y ahora es el momento de hacer encurtidos y conservas "
"mientras el encurtido esta bueno. En este número, tres de nuestros editores "
"comparten sus historias edificantes de redescubrir las alegrías del enlatado"
" casero.nuevo. "

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THIS IS WHERE 'ME TOO' ENDS UP.  It's been a while now since 'Me "
"Too' swept the message boards of our nation, but its repercussions are felt "
"every day.  Disconnected from our identities and our heritage by the "
"overwhelming urge to suppress the white male and hide his every achievement,"
" American citizens are turning to drugs and violence to find a place of "
"belonging.  The government swings its hefty blame-stick around, trying to "
"shine a light on the rise in crime and failing economy, but the answer is "
"obvious to anyone who simply looks: it is the loss of our racial and sexual "
"identity that's at the root.  Mark my words: within a year, there will be a "
"reckoning, and it won't be caused by the government or some outside power, "
"it will be from the broken heart of America."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: AQUÍ ES DONDE \"ME TOO\" TERMINA. Hace tiempo que 'Me Too' no "
"barre los tablones de anuncios de nuestra nación, pero sus repercusiones se "
"sienten todos los días. Desconectados de nuestras identidades y de nuestra "
"herencia por el abrumador impulso de suprimir al hombre blanco y esconder "
"todos sus logros, los ciudadanos americanos están recurriendo a las drogas y"
" a la violencia para encontrar un lugar de pertenencia. El gobierno echa la "
"culpa a todos, tratando de arrojar luz sobre el aumento de la delincuencia y"
" el fracaso de la economía, pero la respuesta es obvia para cualquiera que "
"se limite a mirar: la pérdida de nuestra identidad racial y sexual es lo que"
" está en la raíz. Recuerden mis palabras: dentro de un año, habrá un ajuste "
"de cuentas, y no será causado por el gobierno o algún poder externo, será "
"del corazón roto de América."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"TECHWORLD NEWS: Uncanny unveils its new product - the Grocery Bot!  "
"Thousands of else-if statements, pre-recorded voice from professional "
"actors, what more does this adorable android hides under its smiling face?  "
"Our expert got the answer for you!"
msgstr ""
"NOTICIAS DE TECHWORLD: Asombroso presenta su nuevo producto - ¡El "
"Mercadobot! Miles de condiciones, voces pregrabadas de actores "
"profesionales, ¿qué más esconde este adorable androide bajo su cara "
"sonriente? ¡Nuestro experto tiene la respuesta para usted!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE RISE OF THE RIGHT HAS BROUGHT US HERE.  As the wounded white "
"male ego becomes more and more of a self-stereotype, we see the cost of "
"allowing right-wing sentiment echoed all around us.  Through closet "
"capitulation to the demands of the most extremist right-wing groups, "
"President Oswald has made policies that allow foreign drugs to run rampant "
"through our nation.  Hiding under the guise of generally increased crime "
"rates, conservative extremists have taken over our cities, stalking the "
"streets at night and enacting vicious vigilante-style beatings on anyone "
"they deem different."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL ASCENSO DE LA DERECHA NOS HA TRAÍDO AQUÍ. A medida que el "
"herido ego masculino blanco se convierte más y más en un auto-estereotipo, "
"vemos el costo de permitir que el sentimiento de la derecha se haga eco a "
"nuestro alrededor. A través de la capitulación a las demandas de los grupos "
"de derecha más extremistas, el Presidente Oswald ha hecho políticas que "
"permiten que las drogas extranjeras se extiendan por toda nuestra nación. "
"Escondidos bajo el disfraz de un aumento general de los índices de "
"criminalidad, los extremistas conservadores se han apoderado de nuestras "
"ciudades, acechando en las calles por la noche y propinando despiadadas "
"palizas al estilo de los vigilantes a cualquiera que consideren diferente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"NEW LAB OPENS: The H.R. Bennett Research Facility has been officially opened"
" by the Department of Energy.  According to Deputy Secretary of Energy "
"Randall Balakrishnan, \"This facility is one of the most state-of-the-art in"
" the world.  With the opening of the H.R. Bennett research complex, New "
"England's future is looking brighter than ever.\""
msgstr ""
"NUEVO LABORATORIO ABIERTO: El Centro de Investigación H.R. Bennett ha sido "
"inaugurado oficialmente por el Departamento de Energía. Según el Secretario "
"Adjunto de Energía Randall Balakrishnan, \"Esta instalación es una de las "
"más avanzadas del mundo. Con la apertura del complejo de investigación H.R. "
"Bennett, el futuro de Nueva Inglaterra se ve más brillante que nunca.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE FOREIGN DESIGNER DRUG THEY DON'T WANT YOU TO KNOW ABOUT?  Concerning "
"reports from a source in the Boston Police Department have hinted that there"
" is a new drug on the streets.  Move over, fentanyl: this is a new "
"substance, nicknamed Forbidden City.  While it has a lower fatal overdose "
"rate, Forbidden City is many times more addictive than heroin or "
"methamphetamines, and is making its way quickly around the streets."
msgstr ""
"LA DROGA DE DISEÑO EXTRANJERA DE LA QUE NO QUIEREN QUE SEPAS? Los informes "
"de una fuente del Departamento de Policía de Boston han insinuado que hay "
"una nueva droga en las calles. Apártate, fentanilo: esta es una nueva "
"sustancia, apodada Ciudad Prohibida. Mientras que tiene una tasa de "
"sobredosis fatal más baja, Ciudad Prohibida es mucho más adictiva que la "
"heroína o las metanfetaminas, y se está abriendo paso rápidamente en las "
"calles."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"WHEN I DID MY TIME.  We spoke to Dan Huang, the Chinese-American author of the New York Times bestselling exposé \"When I Did my Time\", the story of his three years living with his extended family in China, immersed in what he describes as \"The ever-escalating anti-American propaganda of the East.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"It's a real threat,\" said Huang.  \"They are being taught to hate our freedom, and our technology.  Mark my words: there is going to be a reckoning, and we need to be ready.\""
msgstr ""
"CUANDO CUMPLÍ MI CONDENA. Hablamos con Dan Huang, el autor chino-americano del bestseller del New York Times \"Cuando Cumplí mi Condena\", la historia de sus tres años viviendo con su familia extensa en China, inmerso en lo que él describe como \"La siempre creciente propaganda anti-americana de Oriente\".\n"
"\n"
"\"Es una verdadera amenaza\", dijo Huang. \"Se les está enseñando a odiar nuestra libertad, y nuestra tecnología. Recuerden mis palabras: habrá un ajuste de cuentas, y tenemos que estar preparados.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"MAN EATING FLOWERS?  Italian biologist Dr. Flavio Bianchi responded to an "
"ethics board denial of his work with an unusual announcement last Tuesday.  "
"\"I do not need your permission to do my work,\" stated Dr. Bianchi in a "
"letter to the University of Milan.  \"I will do my research in private, and "
"when I am done, you will rue the day you defied me.\"  Dr. Bianchi's work?  "
"Engineering venus fly traps large enough to keep the local stray cat "
"population at bay.  His tenure with the university is reported to have been "
"suspended."
msgstr ""
"¿UN HOMBRE COMIENDO FLORES? El biólogo italiano Dr. Flavio Bianchi respondió"
" a la negación de su trabajo por parte del comité de ética con un anuncio "
"inusual el martes pasado. \"No necesito su permiso para hacer mi trabajo\", "
"dijo el Dr. Bianchi en una carta a la Universidad de Milán. \"Haré mi "
"investigación en privado, y cuando termine, lamentarán el día en que me "
"desafiaron.\" ¿El trabajo del Dr. Bianchi? Diseñar trampas para moscas venus"
" lo suficientemente grandes para mantener a raya a la población local de "
"gatos callejeros. Se informa que su cargo en la universidad ha sido "
"suspendido."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"IT CAME FROM BEYOND.  [Pictured: Margaret Antwerp holds the fragment of "
"alien satellite that landed in her rose garden.]  It was a normal day for "
"Margaret.  Normal, that is, until a thundering crash in her front yard "
"nearly knocked her house over.  \"This damn thing fell right out of space, I"
" tell you,\" she told investigative journalists from our Paranormal "
"Investigations department.  \"It was glowing red hot, and it had burnt my "
"prize-winning roses to a crisp.\"  The US government and air force have "
"declined to comment, as usual."
msgstr ""
"VINO DEL MÁS ALLÁ. [En la foto: Margaret Antwerp sostiene el fragmento del "
"satélite alienígena que aterrizó en su jardín de rosas.] Era un día normal "
"para Margaret. Normal, es decir, hasta que un atronador impacto en su jardín"
" casi derriba su casa. \"Esta maldita cosa cayó del espacio, se lo "
"aseguro\", les dijo a los periodistas de nuestro departamento de "
"Investigaciones Paranormales. \"Estaba al rojo vivo, y había quemado mis "
"galardonadas rosas hasta dejarlas fritas.\" El gobierno y la fuerza aérea de"
" EE.UU. se han declinado hacer comentarios, como de costumbre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"MENDING FENCES.  Growing international tensions have prompted President "
"Oswald to call for unprecedented funding increases for security "
"revitalization.  The president is calling for new \"precision micro\" "
"military installations to be built across the nation, with thousands to be "
"constructed in New England alone.  These come alongside similarly ambitious "
"budget increases for FEMA and scientific research.  A coalition of civil "
"rights orgs, neighborhood associations, and environmental advocates have "
"denounced the initiative."
msgstr ""
"REPARAR LAS VALLAS. Las crecientes tensiones internacionales han llevado al "
"presidente Oswald a pedir un aumento de fondos sin precedentes para la "
"revitalización de la seguridad. El presidente pide que se construyan nuevas "
"instalaciones militares de \"microprecisión\" en todo el país, con miles de "
"ellas sólo en Nueva Inglaterra. Estas medidas se suman a los ambiciosos "
"aumentos presupuestarios para la FEMA y la investigación científica. Una "
"coalición de organizaciones de derechos civiles, asociaciones de vecinos y "
"defensores del medio ambiente han denunciado la iniciativa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"BIGGER BEES.  State biologists are unable to explain the emergence of bees "
"that are two and three times normal size.  Authorities say that bees larger "
"than golf balls are being reported across the state.  As of this time, there"
" have been no reports of increased aggression or other behavioral changes in"
" the oversized insects.  \"I'm glad to see the resurgence in the bee "
"population,\" said Dr. Melissus \"Mel\" Versed, an entomologist at Tufts "
"University.  He added, \"while Anthophila this large are unprecedented in "
"New England, there is nothing particularly harmful about the phenomena.  "
"Think of the honey yields!\""
msgstr ""
"ABEJAS MÁS GRANDES. Los biólogos del estado no pueden explicar la aparición "
"de abejas que tienen un tamaño dos y tres veces superior al normal. Las "
"autoridades afirman que se están registrando abejas más grandes que pelotas "
"de golf en todo el estado. Hasta el momento, no se ha informado de un "
"aumento de la agresividad u otros cambios de comportamiento en los insectos "
"de gran tamaño. \"Me alegra ver el resurgimiento de la población de "
"abejas\", dijo el Dr. Melissus \"Mel\" Versed, entomólogo de la Universidad "
"de Tufts. Añadió que \"aunque las Anthophila de este tamaño no tienen "
"precedentes en Nueva Inglaterra, no hay nada especialmente perjudicial en "
"este fenómeno. ¡Piense en el rendimiento de la miel\"!."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"JAMES HAWTHORNE TWITTER FEUD.  Everyone's talking about the latest trending "
"news on Twitter.  \"Uncanny\" tech magnate and upcoming challenger to the "
"title of \"richest man in America\", James Hawthorne, had a protracted "
"Twitter battle with Minnesota Democratic senatorial candidate Lester "
"Namboney, starting over taxation laws, and running all the way down to grade"
" school insults.  Go to page 5 for the choicest tweets."
msgstr ""
"DISPUTA DE JAMES HAWTHORNE EN TWITTER. Todo el mundo está hablando de la "
"última noticia de moda en Twitter. \"El magnate 'Asombroso' de la tecnología"
" y próximo aspirante al título de \"hombre más rico de Estados Unidos\", "
"James Hawthorne, mantuvo una prolongada batalla en Twitter con el candidato "
"demócrata al Senado por Minnesota, Lester Namboney, que comenzó con las "
"leyes fiscales y llegó hasta los insultos de primaria. Ve a la página 5 para"
" ver los tuits más selectos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"UNCANNY: SHADOWS IN PARADISE.  Uncanny, a tech development firm that has "
"gone from nothing to a household name throughout the United States in the "
"last two years, has been a hot topic since they entered the limelight.  We "
"all know about James Hawthorne and his charismatic combination of sarcastic "
"quipping and insightful observations.  Everyone has seen his tweets, and his"
" TED Talk went viral last year.  Behind the smokescreen, though, hides labor"
" practices that have left employees scarred and, in some cases, permanently "
"unable to work.  Did you know that Uncanny's Portland manufacturing site "
"tried unsuccessfully to unionize last month?  I bet you didn't.  Did you "
"know that four union organizers disappeared prior to the vote?  I bet you "
"didn't.  Are you wondering why none of this was reported?  So am I."
msgstr ""
"ASOMBROSO: SOMBRAS EN EL PARAÍSO. Asombroso, una empresa de desarrollo tecnológico que ha pasado de la nada a ser un nombre conocido en todo Estados Unidos en los últimos dos años, ha sido un tema recurrente desde que entró en escena. Todos conocemos a James Hawthorne y su carismática combinación de chistes sarcásticos y observaciones perspicaces. Todo el mundo ha visto sus tuits, y su charla TED se hizo viral el año pasado. Sin embargo, detrás de la cortina de humo se esconden prácticas laborales que han dejado a los empleados marcados y, en algunos casos, incapacitados permanentemente para trabajar. ¿Sabías que la fábrica de Asombroso en Portland intentó sin éxito sindicarse el mes pasado? Apuesto a que no. ¿Sabías que cuatro organizadores del sindicato desaparecieron antes de la votación? Apuesto a que no. ¿Te preguntas por qué no se informó de nada de esto? Yo también.\n"
"\n"
"Traducción realizada con la versión gratuita del traductor www.DeepL.com/Translator"

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SUPPORT THE COUNTRIES THAT SUPPORT YOURS - PRESIDENT: Earlier today, in an "
"unexpected and unpopular decision, the president suggested the possible "
"institution of a peacetime draft in response to increasing Chinese "
"aggression towards Taiwan and the Philippines.  \"We must pray for the best "
"while preparing for the worst.  We cannot abandon key allies in the face of "
"Chinese bullying.\""
msgstr ""
"SOPORTE A LOS PAÍSES QUE SOPORTAN AL SUYO - PRESIDENTE: Hoy temprano, en una"
" decisión inesperada e impopular, el presidente sugirió la posible "
"institución de un proyecto de paz en respuesta a la creciente agresión de "
"china hacia Taiwán y Filipinas. \"Debemos rezar para que ocurra lo mejor "
"mientras nos preparamos para lo peor. No podemos abandonar a los aliados "
"clave ante la intimidación china\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EVACS UNSTOCKED: TRUTH OR FICTION?  An unidentified government source has "
"suggested that the evacuation centers are unstocked, having \"already "
"accomplished the goal of calming the people\".  He later retracted the "
"comment and is unable to be contacted."
msgstr ""
"EVACUADOS DESABASTECIDOS: ¿REALIDAD O FICCIÓN? Una fuente del gobierno que "
"no se identificó ha sugerido que los centros de evacuación están "
"desabastecidos, luego de haber \"cumplido con el objetivo de calmar a la "
"gente\". Luego desmintió haberlo dicho y ahora no es posible contactarse con"
" él."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SPIKE IN MENTAL HEALTH CONCERNS HAS EPIDEMIOLOGISTS WORRIED.  \"There's no doubt about it,\" said a spokesperson from Mount Sinai Hospital.  \"Hospitals over the US are overwhelmed with an increase in psychiatrically-related violent behavior such as explosivity and aggressive paranoia.  The most likely cause is a new street drug; we have yet to identify any commonality between the affected people.\"\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Andrew Morton, a Harvard epidemiologist, has a different opinion.  \"These people aren't drug users.  They're coming from all walks of life.  Sure, there's a predilection for people who already have some mental illness, but we're seeing perfectly normal people suddenly presenting with violent explosive behavior.  I think the most likely cause is infectious: no other pattern would fit this widespread an outbreak.\""
msgstr ""
"EL AUMENTO DE LOS PROBLEMAS DE SALUD MENTAL HA INQUIETADO A LOS EPIDEMIÓLOGOS. \"No hay duda al respecto\", dijo un portavoz del Hospital Mount Sinai. \"Los hospitales de EE.UU. están abrumados por el aumento de comportamientos violentos relacionados con la psiquiatría como la explosividad y la paranoia agresiva. La causa más probable es una nueva droga callejera; todavía no hemos identificado ningún elemento en común entre las personas afectadas\".\n"
"\n"
"El Dr. Andrew Morton, un epidemiólogo de Harvard, tiene una opinión diferente. \"Estas personas no son consumidores de drogas. Vienen de todos los ámbitos de la vida. Por supuesto, hay una predilección por la gente que ya tiene alguna enfermedad mental, pero estamos viendo gente perfectamente normal que de repente presenta un comportamiento explosivo violento. Creo que la causa más probable es infecciosa: ningún otro patrón encaja con esta expansión salvo la de una epidemia\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"UFO CRASH: TRUTH OR FICTION?  One civilian account claims a shining disk "
"appeared in his field.  \"It kind of glowed, and I could see a strange gray "
"world through it.  Then a shambling hazy purple mushroom came through, "
"man.\""
msgstr ""
"OVNI ESTRELLADO: ¿REALIDAD O FICCIÓN? Un civil asegura que un disco "
"brillante apareció en su campo. \"Más o menos brillaba, y pude ver un mundo "
"raro y gris a través de él. Después, un hongo púrpura borroso y desordenado "
"salió de adentro, loco.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"TIME TRAVEL: TRUTH OR FICTION?  Leaked federal documents describe the "
"formation of a new federal agency called XEDRA, to oversee \"4th Axis "
"technology\" already in use.  Our expert's opinion suggests time-travel or "
"parallel worlds.  The meaning of the acronym is currently unknown."
msgstr ""
"VIAJE EN EL TIEMPO: ¿VERDAD O FICCIÓN? Documentos federales filtrados "
"describen la formación de una nueva agencia federal llamada XEDRA, para "
"supervisar la \"tecnología del 4º Eje\" ya en uso. La opinión de nuestro "
"experto sugiere viajes en el tiempo o mundos paralelos. El significado de "
"las siglas es actualmente desconocido."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE CHINESE CONTROL OUR MEDIA.  No, I don't mean they're writing "
"the articles, but there's no doubt in my mind our social media, from "
"FriendFace to Twitfeed to Eddit, is now run by Chinese influencers.  The "
"real question is not IF they're doing it, but HOW they're using this "
"influence to affect American minds."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LOS CHINOS CONTROLAN NUESTROS MEDIOS DE COMUNICACIÓN. No, no "
"quiero decir que escriban los artículos, pero no hay duda de que nuestros "
"medios sociales, desde FriendFace a Twitfeed y Eddit, están ahora dirigidos "
"por influencers chinos. La verdadera pregunta no es SI lo están haciendo, "
"sino COMO están usando esta influencia para afectar las mentes americanas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: AI IS GETTING AHEAD OF US.  I saw the new article on unmanned "
"robots with the rest of you, and I have to say I'm not as excited as I am "
"worried.  Even the scientists describing these robots say they don't fully "
"understand how this deep learning stuff works, and now we're putting it in "
"cars?  There are some semi-autonomous AI robots even working in prisons now "
"to quell riots.  It's easy to see how this could get out of hand.  We've all"
" seen the movies."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LA I.A. SE ESTÁ ADELANTANDO A NOSOTROS. Vi el nuevo artículo "
"sobre robots no tripulados con el resto de ustedes, y tengo que decir que no"
" estoy tan emocionado como preocupado. Incluso los científicos que describen"
" estos robots dicen que no entienden completamente cómo funciona esto del "
"aprendizaje profundo, y ahora lo estamos poniendo en los coches... Hay "
"algunos robots de IA semi-autónomos que incluso trabajan en las prisiones "
"ahora para sofocar disturbios. Es fácil ver cómo esto podría salirse de "
"control. Todos hemos visto las películas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE SOLDIER OF THE FUTURE, AT LAST.  The military's latest powered infantry "
"exoskeleton has been released for widespread, non-testing use.  Although "
"numbers are still very limited, official sources say that within two years "
"every infantry unit will have access to two powered exoskeletons for heavy "
"operations.  Within five, light exoskeletons will be the standard issue "
"armor for US ground forces.  \"This is going to put our military so far "
"ahead of the rest of the world, it's like we have guns while they have "
"spears,\" General Alex Findlay said in a press release.  The new armor is "
"powered by a proprietary fuel cell developed by the military and hoped to be"
" ready for civilian distribution in the next few years."
msgstr ""
"EL SOLDADO DEL FUTURO, POR FIN. El último exoesqueleto de infantería "
"impulsado por el ejército ha sido lanzado para un uso generalizado, sin "
"pruebas. Aunque los números son todavía muy limitados, fuentes oficiales "
"dicen que dentro de dos años cada unidad de infantería tendrá acceso a dos "
"exoesqueletos con motor para operaciones pesadas. Dentro de cinco, los "
"exoesqueletos ligeros serán el blindaje estándar de las fuerzas terrestres "
"de EE.UU. \"Esto va a poner a nuestro ejército tan por delante del resto del"
" mundo, que es como si tuviéramos armas mientras ellos tienen lanzas\", dijo"
" el general Alex Findlay en un comunicado de prensa. La nueva armadura se "
"alimenta de una pila de combustible patentada desarrollada por el ejército y"
" se espera que esté lista para su distribución civil en los próximos años."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"INCREASE IN \"MONSTER\" SIGHTINGS HAS EXPERTS BAFFLED.  A tenfold spike in "
"sightings of unexplained phenomena, particularly fantastic beasts and "
"monsters, has experts confused.  \"This could be related to the recent rise "
"in hallucinations,\" said Dr. Barb Coulson in an interview on web-based "
"debate show ContraPoints on Friday.  \"It's probably drugs,\" replied debate"
" partner Leanne Jefferson, a spokesperson from MADD.  \"You're both "
"idiots,\" moderator Natalie Wynn interjected.  \"The obvious answer is that "
"it's monsters walking the Earth, preparing to kill us all.\""
msgstr ""
"EL AUMENTO DE AVISTAMIENTOS DE \"MONSTRUOS\" TIENE A LOS EXPERTOS "
"DESCONCERTADOS. Un aumento de diez veces en los avistamientos de fenómenos "
"inexplicables, particularmente bestias y monstruos fantásticos, ha "
"confundido a los expertos. \"Esto podría estar relacionado con el reciente "
"aumento de alucinaciones\", dijo la Dra. Barb Coulson en una entrevista en "
"el programa de debate en la web ContraPuntos el viernes. \"Probablemente "
"sean drogas\", respondió la compañera de debate Leanne Jefferson, portavoz "
"de MADD. \"Ambos son idiotas\", intervino la moderadora Natalie Wynn. \"La "
"respuesta obvia es que son monstruos que caminan por la Tierra, preparándose"
" para matarnos a todos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"FOODPLACE PANTS FEUD.  An ongoing legal battle between popular fast food "
"megalith Foodplace and the non-profit Concerned Consumers of Foodpeople has "
"ended with the determination that the Foodperson costume will remain a "
"gender-neutral, nonrevealing unitard.  \"Superheroes are meant to have "
"exaggerated anatomy and revealing costumes,\" a spokesperson from CCF said "
"in a press release.  \"This is a sad day not just for fans of Foodplace, but"
" for consumers of the fast-food superhero genre overall.\"  A spokesperson "
"from rival food company NourishMart sent out a press release just minutes "
"after the ruling: \"NOURISHMART INFORMS THE PUBLIC THAT NOURISHMATIC DOES "
"NOT WEAR ANY CLOTHES.  NOURISHMATIC IS SOFTWARE.  NOURISHMATIC CAN PRESENT "
"AN AVATAR OF WHATEVER APPEALING MEAT-FORM IS DESIRED BY THE PUBLIC.  EAT AT "
"NOURISHMART.  OUR PRODUCTS CONTAIN A MIX OF FAT, SALT, AND PROTEIN THAT IS "
"HIGHLY DESIRABLE TO HUMAN PALATES.\""
msgstr ""
"PELEA DE PAREJAS EN LUGARCOMIDA. Una batalla legal en curso entre el popular"
" gigante de la comida rápida Lugarcomida y la organización sin ánimo de "
"lucro Consumidores Preocupados de Foodpeople ha terminado con la "
"determinación de que el disfraz de Foodperson permanezca como un uniforme "
"neutral de género y no revelador. \"Se supone que los superhéroes tienen una"
" anatomía exagerada y disfraces reveladores\", dijo un portavoz de CPF en un"
" comunicado de prensa. \"Este es un día triste no sólo para los fanáticos de"
" Lugarcomida, sino para los consumidores del género de superhéroes de comida"
" rápida en general\". Un portavoz de la compañía de alimentos rival "
"NourishMart envió un comunicado de prensa minutos después del fallo: "
"\"NOURISHMART INFORMA AL PÚBLICO QUE NOURISHMART NO USA ROPA. NOURISHMATIC "
"ES UN SOFTWARE. NOURISHMATIC PUEDE PRESENTAR UN AVATAR DE CUALQUIER FORMA DE"
" CARNE ATRACTIVA QUE DESEE EL PÚBLICO. COMAN EN NOURISHMART. NUESTROS "
"PRODUCTOS CONTIENEN UNA MEZCLA DE GRASA, SAL Y PROTEÍNA QUE ES MUY DESEABLE "
"PARA EL PALADAR HUMANO.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ASIAN AGENTS RESPONSIBLE FOR \"MONSTER\" ATTACKS.  Sources have confirmed "
"with photographic evidence that the rise in 'monster' sightings and attacks "
"recently is the work of hostile Eastern agents believed to originate in "
"either China or North Korea.  The government has refused to respond to "
"evidence provided by our investigative journalist team proving that "
"hallucinogenic gases and puppets were used to spawn the widely circulated "
"social media phenomenon."
msgstr ""
"AGENTES ASIÁTICOS RESPONSABLES DE LOS ATAQUES DE \"MONSTRUOS\". Las fuentes "
"han confirmado con pruebas fotográficas que el aumento de los avistamientos "
"y ataques de \"monstruos\" recientemente es obra de agentes orientales "
"hostiles que se cree que son originarios de China o Corea del Norte. El "
"Gobierno se ha negado a responder a las pruebas aportadas por nuestro equipo"
" de periodistas de investigación que demuestran que se utilizaron gases "
"alucinógenos y marionetas para engendrar el fenómeno de los medios de "
"comunicación social de amplia difusión."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOTS CONTINUE IN SOUTH AMERICA, AFRICA.  Although reports are inconsistent,"
" it has been confirmed that widespread rioting in poverty-stricken regions "
"of Africa and South America, as well as some parts of Indonesia, Asia, the "
"Middle East, and Eastern Europe, have continued and only grown in severity."
"  \"It's obvious this is a social media effect,\" said political science "
"professor Dr. Ely Savage.  \"Economists have been saying for some time that "
"the current situation of developed nations forcing underdeveloped nations "
"into semi-slavery couldn't last, and now we're seeing the repercussions.\""
msgstr ""
"CONTINÚAN LOS DISTURBIOS EN AMÉRICA DEL SUR, ÁFRICA. Aunque los informes no "
"son coherentes, se ha confirmado que los disturbios generalizados en las "
"regiones de África y América del Sur afectadas por la pobreza, así como en "
"algunas partes de Indonesia, Asia, el Oriente Medio y Europa oriental, han "
"continuado y aumentado en intensidad. \"Es obvio que se trata de un efecto "
"de las redes sociales\", dijo el profesor de ciencias políticas Dr. Ely "
"Savage. \"Los economistas han estado diciendo durante algún tiempo que la "
"situación actual de las naciones desarrolladas forzando a las naciones "
"subdesarrolladas a la semi-esclavitud no podía durar, y ahora estamos viendo"
" las repercusiones\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOT IN CARLHAVEN.  A riot broke out in a supermarket in Carlhaven, "
"Nebraska, today.  A bystander who left the scene as violence started told "
"police that it began with a dispute over the last box of frozen Foodplace "
"hamburger patties, but quickly escalated \"For no reason at all\".  Police "
"arrived on the scene and were quickly forced to deploy less-lethal weaponry "
"in response to what was described by Sheriff Paul Redekopp as \"A complete "
"sh*t show\".  Seven people are dead, and another six in critical condition "
"in Carlhaven General Hospital."
msgstr ""
"DISTURBIOS EN CARLHAVEN. Hoy ha estallado un motín en un supermercado de "
"Carlhaven, Nebraska. Un transeúnte que abandonó la escena cuando comenzó la "
"violencia dijo a la policía que comenzó con una disputa por la última caja "
"de hamburguesas congeladas de Lugarcomida, pero que rápidamente se "
"intensificó \"sin ningún motivo\". La policía llegó al lugar y se vio "
"obligada a desplegar rápidamente armamento poco letal en respuesta a lo que "
"el sheriff Paul Redekopp describió como \"un completo caos\". Siete personas"
" han muerto, y otras seis están en estado crítico en el Hospital General de "
"Carlhaven."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOT IN BANKSLEY.  Irony was hot and dangerous in Banksley, Vermont today, "
"where a fight broke out in a local coffee shop, reportedly starting over a "
"dispute about the details of a similar riot in Carlhaven, Nebraska.  Within "
"an hour, the fight had expanded to engulf the local downtown core.  Danielle"
" Louiston, a server who fled the scene, was available for phone interview.  "
"\"It was like nothin' I've ever seen,\" describes Danielle.  \"One minute "
"it's a normal Friday morning, the next it's a bar brawl.  By the time I got "
"outta there, most of the restaurant was involved.  I got in my car and just "
"bolted home, then called the cops.  Turns out they're all in the fight!  The"
" secretary and I, we got hold of the military and finally they came in and "
"cleared things up.\"  Stabilizing the riots required the dispatch of three "
"National Guard units.  Casualty reports are, as yet, unavailable."
msgstr ""
"DISTURBIOS EN BANKSLEY. La ironía estaba candente y peligrosa en Banksley, "
"Vermont hoy, donde estalló una pelea en una cafetería local, supuestamente "
"iniciada tras una disputa sobre los detalles de un disturbio similar en "
"Carlhaven, Nebraska. En menos de una hora, la pelea se había expandido hasta"
" abarcar el centro de la ciudad. Danielle Louiston, una camarera que huyó de"
" la escena, estuvo dispuesta para realizar una entrevista telefónica. \"No "
"se parece a nada que haya visto antes\", describe Danielle. \"Un minuto es "
"una mañana de viernes normal, al siguiente es una pelea de bar. Para cuando "
"salí de allí, la mayoría del restaurante estaba involucrado. Me metí en mi "
"coche y me fui corriendo a casa, luego llamé a la policía. Resulta que todos"
" estaban en la pelea. La secretaria y yo, nos comunicamos con los militares "
"y finalmente vinieron y arreglaron las cosas.\" Para estabilizar los "
"disturbios fue necesario enviar tres unidades de la Guardia Nacional. Los "
"informes de víctimas no están todavía disponibles."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ECONOMIC RIOTING SPREADS TO UNITED STATES.  Global economic riots, started "
"in Africa and South America, have spread to the continental United States.  "
"More than thirty riots were reported over the weekend, primarily in poorer "
"regions of the Midwest and South.  \"I don't think this is related to what "
"happened in Carlhaven or Banksley,\" a spokesperson from the National Guard "
"said in response to media inquiry.  \"Those were isolated incidents, while "
"this is very clearly a coordinated social media effort.\"  Police and the "
"National Guard are containing riots as they crop up.  President Oswald, in a"
" speech on Sunday evening, reminded Americans of our solidarity.  \"Enemies "
"perch at our every border, watching for signs of weakness.  Now is not the "
"time to shoot ourselves in the feet.\""
msgstr ""
"LOS DISTURBIOS ECONÓMICOS SE EXTIENDEN A LOS ESTADOS UNIDOS. Los disturbios "
"económicos mundiales, que comenzaron en África y América del Sur, se han "
"extendido a los Estados Unidos continentales. Más de treinta disturbios "
"fueron reportados durante el fin de semana, principalmente en las regiones "
"más pobres del medio oeste y el sur. \"No creo que esto esté relacionado con"
" lo que ocurrió en Carlhaven o Banksley\", dijo un portavoz de la Guardia "
"Nacional en respuesta a la pregunta de los medios de comunicación. \"Esos "
"fueron incidentes aislados, mientras que esto es claramente un esfuerzo "
"coordinado en las redes sociales.\" La policía y la Guardia Nacional están "
"conteniendo los disturbios mientras aparecen. El presidente Oswald, en un "
"discurso el domingo por la noche, recordó a los americanos nuestra "
"solidaridad. \"Los enemigos se posan en cada una de nuestras fronteras, "
"buscando signos de debilidad. Ahora no es el momento de pegarnos un tiro a "
"nosotros mismos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE MAN BEHIND THE RIOTS.  [Photograph: Interpol identification photograph "
"of Qiang Ye, taken in Maastricht airport in June, 2019.]  Our sources in the"
" UN have informed reporters that the investigative committee in charge of "
"the riots currently engulfing most of the world, nicknamed the \"FriendFace "
"Riots\" for the role of social media in spreading the violence, are the work"
" of a discredited Chinese hacker and alleged intelligence agent, Qiang Ye.  "
"Ye is wanted by Interpol for his involvement in a cyberterror attack on "
"Dutch banks in 2018 that led to billions of dollars of losses for European "
"banks.  The Chinese government has disavowed any connection to Ye since "
"2015.  \"One man, with an army of well-programmed bots at his control, could"
" certainly be behind this,\" said Dr. Ely Savage, a professor of political "
"science at Berkeley and our expert correspondent on the riots.  \"Social "
"media is very susceptible to this sort of influence.\""
msgstr ""
"EL HOMBRE DETRÁS DE LOS DISTURBIOS. [Fotografía: Fotografía de "
"identificación de la Interpol de Qiang Ye, tomada en el aeropuerto de "
"Maastricht en junio de 2019.] Nuestras fuentes en la ONU han informado a los"
" periodistas que el comité de investigación a cargo de los disturbios que se"
" están produciendo en la mayor parte del mundo, apodado \"Disturbios "
"FriendFace\" por el papel de las redes sociales en la difusión de la "
"violencia, son el trabajo de un desacreditado hacker chino y presunto agente"
" de inteligencia, Qiang Ye. Ye es buscado por la Interpol por su "
"participación en un ataque cibernético contra bancos holandeses en 2018 que "
"provocó miles de millones de dólares en pérdidas para los bancos europeos. "
"El gobierno chino ha negado cualquier conexión con Ye desde 2015. \"Un "
"hombre, con un ejército de robots bien programados bajo su control, podría "
"ciertamente estar detrás de esto\", dijo el Dr. Ely Savage, profesor de "
"ciencias políticas en Berkeley y nuestro experto corresponsal sobre los "
"disturbios. \"Las redes sociales son muy susceptibles a este tipo de "
"influencia.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"VIOLENT OUTBREAKS CAUSED BY DRUG CONTAMINATION: Reports of riots being a "
"social media effect were disputed today by NSA spokesperson Colonel Shawn "
"Singer.  \"These are isolated incidents.  There is no evidence of any social"
" media articles that are causing them, here or abroad.  The violence is "
"random and senseless.  We are currently investigating a promising theory "
"that a malicious contamination effect of the street drug methothexazole, "
"known as 'Forbidden City', is responsible.  Whatever the cause, the National"
" Guard has these riots very well contained.\""
msgstr ""
"BROTES VIOLESTOS CAUSADOS POR LA CONTAMINACIÓN DE DROGAS: Los informes de "
"los disturbios como un efecto de las redes sociales fueron discutidos hoy "
"por el portavoz de la NSA, el coronel Shawn Singer. \"Estos son incidentes "
"aislados. No hay evidencia de ningún artículo en redes sociales que estén "
"causandolos, aquí o en el extranjero. La violencia es aleatoria y sin "
"sentido. Actualmente estamos investigando una teoría prometedora de que un "
"efecto de contaminación maligna de la droga callejera metoxazol, conocida "
"como 'Ciudad Prohibida', es responsable. Cualquiera que sea la causa, la "
"Guardia Nacional tiene estos disturbios muy bien contenidos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: FORGET DRUGS OR FRIENDFACE, THESE ARE THE GAMER RIOTS.  I can't "
"believe how many idiots are wasting their time blaming social media or drugs"
" on the riots we're facing when the answer is obvious: this is the result of"
" letting our kids fall to the moral iniquity of video games.  Just last week"
" I saw my kid playing one of those stupid bleep-bloop games, all letters and"
" numbers and symbols.  When I asked him what he was doing it was absolutely "
"appalling.  Violence.  Cannibalism.  Humans as cattle.  Mermaid abuse.  "
"Yesterday, he was arrested for participating in the riots.  Coincidence?  "
"Pretty obviously not.  Our government is in the pocket of these video game "
"developers, and we're all paying the price."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: OLVIDA LAS DROGAS O FRIENDFACE, ESTOS SON LAS REVUELTAS DE LOS "
"JUGADORES. No puedo creer cuántos idiotas pierden el tiempo culpando a las "
"redes sociales o a las drogas en los disturbios que enfrentamos cuando la "
"respuesta es obvia: este es el resultado de dejar que nuestros hijos caigan "
"en la maldad moral de los videojuegos. La semana pasada vi a mi hijo jugando"
" a uno de esos estúpidos juegos de \"bleep-bloop\", todos con letras, "
"números y símbolos. Cuando le pregunté qué estaba haciendo fue absolutamente"
" espantoso. Violencia. Canibalismo. Humanos como ganado. Abuso de sirenas. "
"Ayer fue arrestado por participar en los disturbios. ¿Coincidencia? "
"Obviamente no. Nuestro gobierno está en el bolsillo de estos desarrolladores"
" de videojuegos, y todos estamos pagando el precio."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"MORE ORDAINED MINISTERS NEEDED.  Wedlock is down, but last minute nuptials, "
"elopements, vow-renewals and 'micromonies' have been on the rise, supposedly"
" in response to many of the recent events and uneasing developments as more "
"people are feeling less secure about dating in these troubled times, "
"therefore rushing to the altar in preparation for the worst, or to cross "
"items off the bucket list before it's too late.  As a result, the nation is "
"experiencing a shortage of marriage officiants.  Luckily, now more than "
"ever, since the beginning of the 21st century it's become increasingly "
"easier to become qualified to help couples of all kinds celebrate their "
"commitment to each other.  However, not enough people are rising to the "
"occasion."
msgstr ""
"SE NECESITAN ORDENAR MÁS MINISTROS. Los casamientos han bajado pero las "
"nupcias de último minuto, las huidas para casarse, la renovación de votos y "
"las microceremonias han aumentado, supuestamente, en respuesta a los eventos"
" y malestares recientes, ya que más gente se siente insegura de conocer "
"gente en estos tiempos turbulentos, por lo tanto, corren al altar "
"preparándose para lo peor, o solo para tachar pendientes de la lista de "
"cosas para hacer antes de que sea tarde. Como resultado, la nación está "
"experimentando una escasez de ministros para celebrar casamientos. Por "
"suerte, ahora más que nunca, desde el principio del siglo XXI se ha vuelto "
"cada vez más fácil calificarse para ayudar a las parejas de toda clase a "
"celebrar su compromiso. Sin embargo, no son suficientes para las "
"circunstancias."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"BUNKERS OF THE RICH AND FAMOUS.  Forget the backwater \"Last Man on Earth\" "
"shelter you helped your buddy pour the foundations for.  We got a look "
"inside the private bunker of James Hawthorne himself!  Ever wonder what it "
"would feel like to weather a disaster in style?  Wonder no more."
msgstr ""
"BÚNKERES DE LOS RICOS Y FAMOSOS. Olvídate del refugio del \"último hombre en"
" la Tierra\" al que ayudaste a tu amigo a echar los cimientos. Hemos echado "
"un vistazo al búnker privado del mismísimo James Hawthorne. ¿Te has "
"preguntado alguna vez qué se siente al capear un desastre con estilo? No te "
"lo preguntes más."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"POLICE TO INVESTIGATE SHADY HILLS.  There will be a \"thorough "
"investigation\" into the Shady Hills nursing home, owned by Shady Hills "
"Corporation, said police Monday.  The announcement came following several "
"lawsuits launching against the home by family members of residents for "
"alleged elder abuse and neglect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SURGEON GENERAL: DEAD ARE STAYING DEAD: \"Stories about the dead rising are "
"completely unfounded and medically impossible.\", the office of the surgeon "
"general said in a press conference today.  \"It's an obvious hoax by people "
"just looking for five minutes of fame, or to scare people in these uncertain"
" times.  After all, remember the clown thing a few years ago?\"  A critic "
"pointed to the increasingly widespread viral videos of rioters with clearly "
"fatal injuries rising to return to the rioting.  \"Within ten hours, someone"
" will have deep faked this video to make me look like a Star Wars "
"character,\" replied the spokesperson, \"and you're confused by a bit of "
"home grown CGI showing zombies?\""
msgstr ""
"CIRUJANO GENERAL: LOS MUERTOS ESTÁN PERMANECIENDO MUERTOS: \"Las historias "
"sobre los muertos que se levantan son completamente infundadas y médicamente"
" imposibles\", dijo la oficina del cirujano general en una conferencia de "
"prensa hoy. \"Es un engaño obvio de la gente que sólo busca cinco minutos de"
" fama, o para asustar a la gente en estos tiempos inciertos. Después de "
"todo, ¿recuerdan el asunto del payaso de hace unos años?\" Un crítico señaló"
" que los videos virales cada vez más extendidos de los alborotadores con "
"lesiones claramente fatales se elevan para volver a los disturbios. \"Dentro"
" de diez horas, alguien habrá falsificado profundamente este video para "
"hacerme parecer un personaje de Star Wars\", respondió el portavoz, \"¿y "
"estás confundido por un poco de CGI casero que muestra zombis?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GENERAL SAYS AVOID BUNKERS: Even in riot affected areas, do not attempt to "
"flee to military bunkers or outposts!  Understaffed bunkers are defended by "
"automated turrets, which will shoot those without proper registration.  FEMA"
" has authorized use of emergency evacuation shelters for people seeking "
"refuge from riots."
msgstr ""
"EL GENERAL DICE QUE HAY QUE EVITAR LOS BÚNKERES: Incluso en las zonas "
"afectadas por los disturbios, no intenten huir a los búnkeres militares o "
"puestos de avanzada! Los búnkeres sin personal son defendidos por torretas "
"automatizadas, que disparan a los que no están registrados. FEMA ha "
"autorizado el uso de refugios de evacuación de emergencia para las personas "
"que buscan refugio de los disturbios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"VIOLENCE OUTBREAKS ARE UNIVERSAL.  Despite government efforts to claim the "
"situation is \"under control\", sources in the CDC have confirmed our own "
"investigative results: there are now major unchecked riots in every city in "
"the United States.  Similar reports are trickling in from countries across "
"the globe.  We recommend packing a bugout bag and heading to your cabin on "
"the lake, if you have one."
msgstr ""
"LOS BROTES DE VIOLENCIA SON UNIVERSALES. A pesar de los esfuerzos del "
"gobierno por afirmar que la situación está \"bajo control\", fuentes del CDC"
" han confirmado los resultados de nuestra propia investigación: ahora hay "
"importantes disturbios sin control en todas las ciudades de los Estados "
"Unidos. Informes similares están llegando de países de todo el mundo. "
"Recomendamos que preparen una mochilas de emergencia y se dirijan a su "
"cabaña en el lago, si es que tienen una."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ZOMBIE DRUG?  A controversial blogger suggested the recent riots are a "
"chemical attack by China in her latest podcast.  \"They're jealous of our "
"military superiority, so they teamed up with Haiti to put hoodoo drugs in "
"the water making people zombies!  You've all heard of Forbidden City, who "
"hasn't?  well, this is what they were testing, and now we're seeing it "
"everywhere!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SUPERSOLDIER EXPERIMENTS GONE WRONG.  Recently leaked documents from an "
"inside source in a hitherto unknown government agency abbreviated 'XEDRA' "
"confirm that violent riots across the country are the result of an "
"accidentally released self-replicating supersoldier serum.  The serum gives "
"people unprecedented strength and durability, even regenerative capacity, "
"but has the dangerous side effect of causing uncontrolled anger.  Although "
"the leak suggests that the effect should wear off, it may take weeks or even"
" months to reach a stable state."
msgstr ""
"EXPERIMENTOS CON SUPERSOLDADOS QUE SALIERON MAL. Documentos recientemente "
"filtrados de una fuente interna en una agencia gubernamental hasta ahora "
"desconocida, abreviada 'XEDRA', confirman que los violentos disturbios en "
"todo el país son el resultado de un suero de supersoldado auto-replicante "
"liberado accidentalmente. El suero da a las personas una fuerza y "
"durabilidad sin precedentes, incluso capacidad de regeneración, pero tiene "
"el peligroso efecto secundario de causar una ira incontrolada. Aunque la "
"fuga sugiere que el efecto debería desaparecer, puede tardar semanas o "
"incluso meses en alcanzar un estado estable."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"DISTURBING VIDEO SHOWS PSYCHOTIC RIOTERS.  We've all known something was "
"really wrong for a while.  A new, extremely disturbing video has been making"
" the social media rounds in a shocking way.  It depicts a young woman amidst"
" the riots violently and fatally attacking a girl that appears to be her own"
" small daughter.  To many, this is the last straw that confirms a dreadful "
"suspicion: these riots are not the result of some social unrest, but "
"represent a complete breakdown of rationality."
msgstr ""
"UN VIDEO PERTURBADOR MUESTRA ALBOROTADORES PSICÓTICOS. Todos hemos sabido "
"que algo estaba realmente mal desde hace tiempo. Un nuevo y extremadamente "
"perturbador video ha estado rondando por las redes sociales de una manera "
"impactante. Muestra a una joven en medio de los disturbios atacando violenta"
" y fatalmente a una niña que parece ser su propia hija pequeña. Para muchos,"
" esta es la gota que colma el vaso y confirma una terrible sospecha: estos "
"disturbios no son el resultado de un malestar social, sino que representan "
"una completa ruptura de la racionalidad."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT SPEAKS OUT ABOUT 'MIND CONTROL' RUMORS.  Amidst rumors that "
"nation- and world-wide riots are the result of a chemical mind control "
"agent, the NSA held a press conference today.  \"This is not mind control.  "
"These rioters are human beings, normal people, controlled only by feverish "
"violence at a level we've never seen before,\" said a flustered looking "
"representative.  \"Although in some places excessive force has been required"
" to deter rioters, we are treating them as the humans they are, not as some "
"faceless mind-controlled horde.  This is not science fiction, these are our "
"friends and family.\""
msgstr ""
"EL GOBIERNO HABLA DE RUMORES DE \"CONTROL MENTAL\". En medio de los rumores "
"de que los disturbios a nivel nacional y mundial son el resultado de un "
"agente químico de control mental, la NSA celebró una conferencia de prensa "
"hoy. \"Esto no es control mental. Estos alborotadores son seres humanos, "
"gente normal, controlados sólo por una violencia febril a un nivel que nunca"
" hemos visto antes\", dijo un representante de aspecto nervioso. \"Aunque en"
" algunos lugares se ha requerido una fuerza excesiva para disuadir a los "
"alborotadores, los estamos tratando como los humanos que son, no como una "
"horda sin rostro controlada por la mente. Esto no es ciencia ficción, estos "
"son nuestros amigos y familiares.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THEY FLY THE SKIES.  It spreads its wings and the sun blocks out.  It "
"strikes the helicopter from the sky with a simple wave of its claw.  It "
"rains spittle down on our faces and we dissolve.  They are coming.  They are"
" coming.  They are coming."
msgstr ""
"VUELAN LOS CIELOS. Extiende sus alas y el sol se bloquea. Golpea el "
"helicóptero desde el cielo con un simple movimiento de su garra. La lluvia "
"nos escupe en la cara y nos disolvemos. Ya vienen. Ya vienen. Ya vienen."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"HELL ON EARTH?  Boston has been quarantined.  Prior to its complete "
"lockdown, our journalists received a concerning email from a colleague "
"within the city, describing horrendous and inhuman monsters walking the "
"streets amidst the rioters.  \"I don't know who started it, but we call it "
"Hastur.  After the horror novel.  The rioters fall in line behind it like "
"soldiers, living and dead.  Yeah, some of them are dead.  They're lying to "
"us, they've all been lying to us.\"  Our editor-in-chief demanded we keep "
"this article from you.  He has been deposed.  Rise up against the lies."
msgstr ""
"¿EL INFIERNO EN LA TIERRA? Boston ha sido puesto en cuarentena. Antes de su "
"cierre completo, nuestros periodistas recibieron un correo electrónico de un"
" colega de la ciudad, describiendo monstruos horribles e inhumanos caminando"
" por las calles en medio de los disturbios. \"No sé quién lo empezó, pero lo"
" llamamos Hastur. Por la novela de terror. Los alborotadores se alinean "
"detrás de ella como soldados, vivos y muertos. Sí, algunos de ellos están "
"muertos. Nos están mintiendo, todos nos han estado mintiendo\". Nuestro "
"editor en jefe exigió que ocultáramos este artículo. Ha sido destituido. "
"Alzaos contra las mentiras."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"YOUR BUG-OUT BAG.  In this issue we focus on tips and tricks to packing your"
" bug-out bag.  Whether you're near an urban center or in a small town, if "
"you don't already have an emergency kit, you need one while supplies are "
"still available.  Don't be the one person caught without a lighter when you "
"need a fire!"
msgstr ""
"TU MOCHILA DE EMERGENCIA. En este número nos centramos en los consejos y "
"trucos para preparar su mochila de emergencia. Ya sea que esté cerca de un "
"centro urbano o en un pueblo pequeño, si no tienes un kit de emergencia, "
"necesitas uno mientras haya suministros disponibles. No seas la única "
"persona que se quede sin encendedor cuando necesites un fuego!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: MY MOM, THE RIOTER.  My mother was one of the first of the "
"rioters in Jacksonville.  I've been wondering for a long time how a retired "
"sixty-seven year old woman with a passion for day lilies and knitting wound "
"up allegedly beating a police officer to death and getting thrown in a "
"containment tank.  Last week, against all odds and at great personal risk, I"
" managed to get her released into my care.  I thought I could calm her down."
"  When they gave her to me, she was straitjacketed and masked, like Hannibal"
" Lecter.  When I got her home I tried to remove the bindings, and she almost"
" immediately tried to strangle me.  It was all I could do to tie her back up"
" and put her in the guest room.  She still eats and drinks when I give her "
"food, but I haven't seen her sleep.  I don't know what that thing is in "
"there, but it's not my mom.  I hope she comes back soon."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: MI MADRE, LA ALBOROTADORA. Mi madre fue una de las primeras en "
"causar disturbios en Jacksonville. Me he preguntado durante mucho tiempo "
"cómo una mujer jubilada de 67 años, apasionada por los lirios de día y el "
"tejido de punto, terminó presuntamente golpeando a un oficial de policía "
"hasta la muerte y siendo arrojada a un tanque de contención. La semana "
"pasada, contra todo pronóstico y con un gran riesgo personal, me las arreglé"
" para que la pusieran a mi cuidado. Pensé que podría calmarla. Cuando me la "
"entregaron, estaba en camisa de fuerza y enmascarada, como Hannibal Lecter. "
"Cuando la llevé a casa intenté quitarle las ataduras, y casi inmediatamente "
"trató de estrangularme. Fue todo lo que pude hacer para atarla de nuevo y "
"ponerla en la habitación de invitados. Todavía come y bebe cuando le doy de "
"comer, pero no la he visto dormir. No sé qué es esa cosa de ahí, pero no es "
"mi madre. Espero que vuelva pronto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"PSYCHIC EMANATIONS?  A seemingly far-fetched theory about ongoing riots "
"sweeping the nation has been gaining traction after a leaked document about "
"experiments in magnetic control of brain-waves.  \"Two weeks ago, I'd have "
"told you this is ridiculous,\" said Dr. Andrew Morton, an epidemiologist and"
" our leading expert on the medical basis for the riots.  \"Now?  I'll "
"consider anything.  With the caveat that I don't think any of this is "
"possible, magnetic weaponry altering our brain waves and making people into "
"crazy violent psychopaths is more plausible than a lot of the theories "
"running around.  I certainly prefer this one to that 'zombies' suggestion "
"from a few days ago.\""
msgstr ""
"¿EMANACIONES PSÍQUICAS? Una teoría aparentemente descabellada sobre los "
"disturbios que están arrasando el país ha ido ganando adeptos tras la "
"filtración de un documento sobre experimentos de control magnético de las "
"ondas cerebrales. \"Hace dos semanas, te habría dicho que esto es "
"ridículo\", dijo el Dr. Andrew Morton, un epidemiólogo y nuestro principal "
"experto en la base médica de los disturbios. \"¿Ahora? Consideraré cualquier"
" cosa. Con la advertencia de que no creo que nada de esto sea posible, el "
"armamento magnético que altera nuestras ondas cerebrales y convierte a la "
"gente en psicópatas violentos y locos es más plausible que muchas de las "
"teorías que corren por ahí. Desde luego, prefiero ésta a la sugerencia de "
"los \"zombis\" de hace unos días\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"CHINESE SOLDIERS SPOTTED AMIDST RIOTERS.  Concerns that Chinese influence is"
" behind the riots sweeping North America were corroborated today by reports "
"of the appearance of PRC soldiers amongst the rioters in San Diego and San "
"Francisco, apparently unaffected by the otherwise uncontrolled frenzy of "
"violence.  The government continues to deny the truth."
msgstr ""
"SOLDADOS CHINOS VISTOS EN MEDIO DE LOS DISTURBIOS. La preocupación de que la"
" influencia china está detrás de los disturbios en Norteamérica fue "
"corroborada hoy por los informes de la aparición de soldados de la RPC entre"
" los alborotadores en San Diego y San Francisco, aparentemente no afectados "
"por el frenesí de violencia, que de otra manera sería incontrolable. El "
"gobierno continúa negando la verdad."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"IF YOU CAN'T BEAT 'EM.  Riots continue to rage unchecked across the country,"
" maybe the world.  Here in our newsroom we've taken a poll, and it's agreed:"
" if you can't beat 'em, join 'em.  This will be our last issue, we're going "
"out there to show the government exactly what we think of their limp-wristed"
" failures."
msgstr ""
"SI NO PUEDES VENCERLOS. Los disturbios siguen causando estragos sin control "
"en todo el país, tal vez en el mundo. Aquí en nuestra sala de redacción "
"hemos hecho una encuesta y estamos de acuerdo: si no puedes vencerlos, únete"
" a ellos. Este será nuestro último número, vamos a salir para mostrarle al "
"gobierno lo que pensamos de sus fracasos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"WATCH POWER ARMOR IN ACTION.  The National Guard deployed a recently-"
"commissioned unit of heavy riot control power armor exoskeletons to the "
"front lines of the riots in Waterville, Maine.  This state of the art armor "
"is able to repel almost any attack from a civilian rioter, and has been sent"
" forward alongside infantry armed with pepper bullets and sponge rounds to "
"contain rioters.  \"It's an uphill battle, but we've still got it "
"contained,\" said Lieutenant Shawn Bhatti from inside his full-enclosure "
"suit.  \"I can subdue a dozen rioters in this thing, and I've got a dozen "
"men and women with me.\"  Video of the power armor in action will be "
"streamed on our website."
msgstr ""
"VEA LA ARMADURA DE ENERGÍA EN ACCIÓN. La Guardia Nacional desplegó una "
"unidad de exoesqueletos de armadura de energía pesada de control de "
"disturbios en el frente de los disturbios en Waterville, Maine. Esta "
"armadura de última generación es capaz de repeler casi cualquier ataque de "
"un alborotador civil, y ha sido enviada junto a la infantería armada con "
"balas de pimienta y balas de esponja para contener a los alborotadores. \"Es"
" una batalla cuesta arriba, pero aún así la tenemos contenida\", dijo el "
"teniente Shawn Bhatti desde el interior de su traje de recinto completo. "
"\"Puedo someter a una docena de alborotadores en esta cosa, y tengo una "
"docena de hombres y mujeres conmigo.\" El video de la armadura de energía en"
" acción será transmitido en nuestro sitio web."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"LETHAL FORCE DEPLOYED?  Police and military forces deny the use of lethal "
"force in riot control, but reports do not seem to corroborate their claims."
"  From videos of gunshot-riddled corpses to aberrant reports from some "
"military officials, it seems clear that at least in some areas, live fire "
"turrets with fully AI-driven threat recognition are being deployed to "
"bolster an overwhelmed military.  We reached Major Linda Pryce in "
"Montpelier, Vermont, for comment.  \"I don't ******* care what the orders "
"are, I have men and civilians that need protecting,\" she told our "
"reporters.  \"These rioters are worse than any insurgent I ever fought in "
"Afghanistan, and I will use whatever I can to keep them under control.\""
msgstr ""
"¿FUERZA LETAL DESPLEGADA? La policía y las fuerzas militares niegan el uso "
"de fuerza letal en el control de disturbios, pero los informes no parecen "
"corroborar sus afirmaciones. Desde videos de cadáveres acribillados a tiros "
"hasta informes aberrantes de algunos oficiales militares, parece claro que "
"al menos en algunas áreas, torretas de fuego real con reconocimiento de "
"amenazas totalmente impulsado por la IA están siendo desplegadas para "
"reforzar un ejército abrumado. Nos comunicamos con la Mayor Linda Pryce en "
"Montpelier, Vermont, para hacer comentarios. \"No me importa lo que las "
"órdenes sean, tengo hombres y civiles que necesitan protección\", dijo a "
"nuestros reporteros. \"Estos alborotadores son peores que cualquier "
"insurgente que haya luchado en Afganistán, y usaré todo lo que pueda para "
"mantenerlos bajo control\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"LOCAL EVACUATION ORDERS.  FEMA has announced small-scale evacuations of "
"select centers where rioting is most intense.  \"This is a preventive "
"measure,\" Spokesperson Linda Garrison told our correspondent.  \"We expect "
"to have people home in a few days, but it's best we play it safe until "
"then.\""
msgstr ""
"ÓRDENES DE EVACUACIÓN LOCALES. El FEMA ha anunciado evacuaciones a pequeña "
"escala de centros selectos donde los disturbios son más intensos. \"Esta es "
"una medida preventiva\", dijo la portavoz Linda Garrison a nuestro "
"corresponsal. \"Esperamos tener gente en casa en unos pocos días, pero es "
"mejor jugar a lo seguro hasta entonces\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"COPS IN CRISIS.  Law enforcement officials report increasing numbers of "
"officers are calling in sick, have resigned, or are just not showing up to "
"duty.  A lack of sufficient personnel exacerbates the dangers police on-duty"
" face.  In some cases officers are refusing to respond to dispatches in "
"areas with high levels of violence.  A spokesperson for the Worcester County"
" Sheriff's Office confirmed \"It is no longer feasible for us to jeopardize "
"officer lives in some circumstances.  Instead we can continue to rely upon "
"our state-of-the-art AI-powered robotic units.\""
msgstr ""
"POLICÍAS EN CRISIS. Los funcionarios de las fuerzas del orden informan de "
"que cada vez hay más agentes que se dan de baja por enfermedad, que dimiten "
"o que simplemente no acuden al servicio. La falta de personal suficiente "
"agrava los peligros a los que se enfrenta la policía de servicio. En algunos"
" casos, los agentes se niegan a responder a los despachos en zonas con altos"
" niveles de violencia. Un portavoz de la Oficina del Sheriff del Condado de "
"Worcester confirmó que \"ya no es posible poner en peligro la vida de los "
"agentes en algunas circunstancias. En su lugar, podemos seguir confiando en "
"nuestras unidades robóticas de última generación impulsadas por la IA.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"UNCANNY VALLEY.  Faced with accusations of malfeasance in his AI designs, "
"James Hawthorne appears to have *disappeared*.  Hawthorne could not be "
"reached for comment by any major news centers, as questions and even "
"lawsuits about dangerous flaws in his widespread law enforcement AI packages"
" rise."
msgstr ""
"ASOMBROSO EN EL VALLE Ante las acusaciones de mala praxis en sus diseños de "
"IA, James Hawthorne parece haber *desaparecido*. Los principales centros de "
"noticias no han podido contactar con Hawthorne para que haga comentarios, a "
"medida que aumentan las preguntas e incluso las demandas sobre los "
"peligrosos fallos de sus paquetes de IA para el cumplimiento de la ley."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ISS MUTINIES, ABANDONS STATION.  Making their demands known through amateur "
"radio communications, all astronauts and cosmonauts aboard the International"
" Space Station have demanded that NASA and ROSCOSMOS allow them to rejoin "
"their families amidst the recent riots and instability.  Claims have been "
"made that the agencies have shut them out of most controls aboard the "
"station, endangering the lives of all aboard when they were unable to "
"respond to a near-miss with orbital debris.  NASA officials have continued "
"to make no public statements regarding the demands, or the unconfirmed "
"reports that the docked spacecraft have been launched, *without* aid from "
"ground control."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT FACILITIES BOMBED: In an apparent foreign attack (contradicting "
"earlier Department of Defense denials of the disaster being caused by "
"Chinese aggression) a coordinated bombing strike hit a wide number of US "
"governmental facilities simultaneously yesterday, as well as numerous "
"locations in isolate parts of the coastal United States.  A statement from "
"the Pentagon has been issued, stating the strikes were the result of Chinese"
" opportunism during the national crisis, and assured that action would be "
"taken in kind against the aggressors.  Allegations that these sites "
"contained top-secret government research facilities related to the disaster "
"have been vehemently denied."
msgstr ""
"INSTALACIONES GUBERNAMENTALES BOMBARDEADAS: En un aparente ataque extranjero"
" (contradiciendo las anteriores negaciones del Departamento de Defensa sobre"
" el desastre causado por la agresión china), un ataque de bombardeo "
"coordinado golpeó ayer simultáneamente un amplio número de instalaciones "
"gubernamentales estadounidenses, así como numerosos lugares en partes "
"aisladas de la costa de los Estados Unidos. Se ha emitido una declaración "
"del Pentágono en la que se afirma que los ataques fueron el resultado del "
"oportunismo chino durante la crisis nacional y se asegura que se tomarán "
"medidas en especie contra los agresores. Se han negado con vehemencia las "
"acusaciones de que estos sitios contenían instalaciones de investigación "
"gubernamentales de alto secreto relacionadas con el desastre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOTS GROWING?  Communications with government forces have been muddled by a"
" large influx of aggressive armed individuals to nation-wide riots.  \"We "
"have this under control,\" says a local police chief.  \"We are authorizing "
"our forces to use lethal force on combative humans.  In the meantime, people"
" are advised to stay in their homes and avoid any contact with peacekeeping "
"forces to avoid friendly fire.\"  Riots are believed to be affecting cities "
"worldwide since at least three weeks ago."
msgstr ""
"¿CRECEN LOS DISTURBIOS? Las comunicaciones con las fuerzas del gobierno han "
"sido enredadas por una gran afluencia de individuos armados agresivos a los "
"disturbios en todo el país. \"Tenemos esto bajo control\", dice un jefe de "
"policía local. \"Estamos autorizando a nuestras fuerzas a usar fuerza letal "
"en humanos combativos. Mientras tanto, se aconseja a la gente que permanezca"
" en sus casas y evite cualquier contacto con las fuerzas de mantenimiento de"
" la paz para evitar el fuego amigo\". Se cree que los disturbios están "
"afectando a ciudades de todo el mundo desde hace al menos tres semanas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EVACUATION ALERT.  The Federal government has announced a formal evacuation "
"of all major centers, to pre-designated FEMA emergency shelters.  "
"Spokesperson Linda Garrison stated, \"This is not expected to be a permanent"
" issue.  By evacuating to the shelters and camps FEMA set up for just such a"
" situation, we can clamp down on riots without hurting uninvolved people.\""
"  Garrison declined to comment on widespread allegations that the rioters "
"are under the influence of psychosis-inducing biological agents."
msgstr ""
"ALERTA DE EVACUACIÓN. El gobierno federal ha anunciado una evacuación formal"
" de todos los centros principales, a los refugios de emergencia pre-"
"designados por la FEMA. La portavoz Linda Garrison declaró: \"No se espera "
"que esto sea un problema permanente. Evacuando a los refugios y campamentos "
"que FEMA ha establecido para tal situación, podemos reprimir los disturbios "
"sin lastimar a la gente no involucrada\". La guarnición se negó a comentar "
"las acusaciones generalizadas de que los alborotadores están bajo la "
"influencia de agentes biológicos que inducen a la psicosis."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOTERS MUTATING?  Eyewitnesses from the New England Disaster Area have "
"claimed that the allegedly psychotic rioters are displaying inhuman "
"qualities.  \"I swear to God, one of them was the size of a tree!\", said "
"one panicked survivor.  There are also reports of afflicted individuals with"
" acidic or electric properties.  CDC officials could not be reached for "
"comment."
msgstr ""
"¿LOS ALBOROTADORES ESTAN MUTANDO? Testigos oculares de la zona del desastre "
"de Nueva Inglaterra han afirmado que los presuntos alborotadores psicóticos "
"están mostrando cualidades inhumanas. \"¡Juro por Dios que uno de ellos era "
"del tamaño de un árbol!\", dijo un sobreviviente presa del pánico. También "
"hay informes de individuos afligidos con propiedades ácidas o eléctricas. "
"Los funcionarios del CDC no pudieron ser contactados para hacer comentarios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RHODE ISLAND DECLARES SECESSION!  In the midst of a nation-wide disaster, "
"the governor of Rhode Island has declared unilateral secession and war with "
"the government of the US.  \"My loyal Rhodians are withdrawing to Aquidneck "
"and Conanicut Islands,\" said governor Alex Ackerwith in a public "
"announcement this morning.  \"The US government has failed us.  Any attempt "
"by the US to intervene in our affairs will result in military action from "
"the Narragansett Government.  Frankly, I don't think they can get their shit"
" together enough to challenge us.\""
msgstr ""
"¡RHODE ISLAND DECLARA LA SECESIÓN! En medio de un desastre nacional, el "
"gobernador de Rhode Island ha declarado la secesión unilateral y la guerra "
"con el gobierno de los EE.UU. \"Mis leales ciudadadanos se retiran a las "
"islas Aquidneck y Conanicut\", dijo el gobernador Alex Ackerwith en un "
"anuncio público esta mañana. \"El gobierno de los EE.UU. nos ha fallado. "
"Cualquier intento de EE.UU. de intervenir en nuestros asuntos resultará en "
"una acción militar del gobierno de Narragansett. Francamente, no creo que "
"puedan resolver sus problemas en primer lugar para desafiarnos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"Aid Delayed\".  Fighting by the military at "
"the edge of the New England Disaster Area is expected to delay civilian "
"extraction.  Civilians will be forced to supply themselves over the next "
"weeks.  Sources indicate this problem is widespread in other major "
"population centers, but aggravated locally by the very high number of "
"bombing targets over the last two days."
msgstr ""
"ANUNCIO DE SERVICIO PÚBLICO: \"Ayuda retrasada\". Se espera que los combates"
" de los militares en el borde de la zona de desastre de Nueva Inglaterra "
"retrasen la extracción de los civiles. Los civiles se verán obligados a "
"abastecerse en las próximas semanas. Las fuentes indican que este problema "
"es generalizado en otros centros de población importantes, pero se agrava "
"localmente por el gran número de objetivos de bombardeo en los últimos dos "
"días."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"New England Cut Off\".  New England has been "
"quarantined for the safety of the rest of the USA.  No rescue attempts will "
"be funded; it is assumed there are no survivors in the area.  This follows "
"on the heels of the quarantining of large sections of the Midwest last "
"night.  Cellular and land-based communication grids have been blocked by "
"large numbers of people attempting to contact loved ones.  It is recommended"
" that civilians avoid use of these tools for all but the most urgent "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"ANUNCIO DE SERVICIO PÚBLICO: \"Nueva Inglaterra cortada\". Nueva Inglaterra "
"ha sido puesta en cuarentena por la seguridad del resto de los Estados "
"Unidos. No se financiará ningún intento de rescate; se supone que no hay "
"supervivientes en la zona. Esto sigue a la cuarentena de grandes secciones "
"del Medio Oeste anoche. Las redes de comunicación celular y terrestre han "
"sido bloqueadas por un gran número de personas que intentan contactar con "
"sus seres queridos. Se recomienda que los civiles eviten el uso de estas "
"herramientas para todos, excepto para los mensajes más urgentes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"LEAVE IT TO THE EXPERTS -- GENERAL: \"Do not attempt to deal with people "
"acting violent or unusual yourself.  If you see someone dangerous, report to"
" the nearest military or police blockade for assistance!  Even guns are to "
"be avoided: loud gunfire may attract more rioters than you have ammo!\""
msgstr ""
"DÉJELO A LOS EXPERTOS -- GENERAL: \"No intente tratar con gente que actúa de"
" forma violenta o inusualmente. Si ve a alguien peligroso, ¡repórtelo al "
"bloqueo militar o policial más cercano para que le ayuden! Incluso las armas"
" deben ser evitadas: los disparos fuertes pueden atraer a más alborotadores "
"que la munición que pueda tener!\" "

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EVACUATION ALERT: FEMA officials said today \"Do not try to defend your "
"property in towns.  Please retreat to your nearest evacuation center outside"
" town and await extraction to a safe facility.  Military officials require "
"non-hostile civilians to be removed from potential hot sites for ongoing "
"violence.  When the evacuation order is over, you will be able to return to "
"your homes.\""
msgstr ""
"ALERTA DE EVACUACIÓN: Los funcionarios de la FEMA dijeron hoy \"No intenten "
"defender su propiedad en las ciudades. Por favor, retírese a su centro de "
"evacuación más cercano fuera de la ciudad y espere la extracción a una "
"instalación segura. Los oficiales militares requieren que los civiles no "
"hostiles sean removidos de los sitios potencialmente calientes por la "
"violencia en curso. Cuando la orden de evacuación termine, podrán regresar a"
" sus hogares\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITOR SAYS \"DESTROY THE DEAD\".  Recognizable dead left lying in the "
"street may be dangerous!  If you kill a hostile, smash or butcher with a "
"knife until unrecognizable!  These aren't rioters, they're *undead*.  The "
"government has been lying to us all along.  This will be our last issue."
msgstr ""
"EL EDITOR DICE \"DESTRUID A LOS MUERTOS\". ¡Los muertos reconocibles que se "
"dejan en la calle pueden ser peligrosos! ¡Si matas a un hostil, aplastalo o "
"destruyalo con un cuchillo hasta que quede irreconocible! No son "
"alborotadores, son muertos vivientes. El gobierno nos ha estado mintiendo "
"todo el tiempo. Este será nuestro último número."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THEY'RE NOT RIOTS!  According to head officials at the Centers for Disease "
"Control, functional MRI studies of rioters have fit autopsy data that "
"suggests these people are under the influence of some sort of mind-altering "
"agent causing erratic, violent behavior.  A source inside the CDC, who did "
"not wish to be named, informed our reporter \"It's not just the rioters.  "
"They're the heaviest affected, but we scanned our own brains when we found "
"out.  It's everyone.  It's in me, and you.  It's in the government.  The "
"military.  God help us all.\""
msgstr ""
"¡NO SON DISTURBIOS! De acuerdo con los funcionarios del Centro de Control de"
" Enfermedades, los estudios de resonancia magnética funcional de los "
"alborotadores tienen datos de autopsia que sugieren que estas personas están"
" bajo la influencia de algún tipo de agente alterador de la mente que causa "
"un comportamiento errático y violento. Una fuente dentro del CDC, que no "
"quiso ser nombrada, informó a nuestro reportero \"No son solo los "
"alborotadores. Son los más afectados, pero escaneamos nuestros propios "
"cerebros cuando lo descubrimos. Es todo el mundo. Está en mí, y en ti. Está "
"en el gobierno. El ejército. Que Dios nos ayude a todos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE DEAD WALK.  Amidst the violence of the riots, we can no longer disregard"
" reports of fatally wounded rioters and police forces alike rising and "
"joining the ranks of rioters.  Government sources could not be reached to "
"confirm or deny these reports, but our own reporters confirm it with "
"photographic evidence shown below."
msgstr ""
"EL CAMINO DE LOS MUERTOS. En medio de la violencia de los disturbios, no "
"podemos seguir ignorando los informes de alborotadores y fuerzas policiales "
"fatalmente heridos que se alzan y se unen a las filas de los alborotadores. "
"No se pudo contactar con fuentes gubernamentales para confirmar o negar "
"estos informes, pero nuestros propios reporteros lo confirman con la "
"evidencia fotográfica que se muestra a continuación."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"A BRIDGE TOO FAR.  In a statement Monday, the Department of Defense detailed"
" its plans to deploy strategic minefields on key bridge crossings, in order "
"to quarantine high-hostility regions of rioting.  \"Military personnel will "
"be on-site to assist any refugees fleeing the blackout zones.  We urge "
"citizens to comply with all military directives and avoid quarantined areas "
"whenever possible until order can be restored.\""
msgstr ""
"UN PUENTE DEMASIADO LEJOS. En un comunicado del lunes, el Departamento de "
"Defensa detalló sus planes para desplegar campos de minas estratégicos en "
"cruces de puentes clave, con el fin de poner en cuarentena las regiones de "
"alta hostilidad de los disturbios. \"El personal militar estará en el lugar "
"para ayudar a los refugiados que huyan de las zonas de apagón. Instamos a "
"los ciudadanos a que cumplan con todas las directivas militares y eviten las"
" zonas en cuarentena siempre que sea posible hasta que se pueda restablecer "
"el orden\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"PORTALS?  Reports of shimmering gateways opening around the US have been "
"corroborated by our own reporting staff.  One reporter witnessed a creature "
"the size of an apartment building taking a direct hit from an Apache "
"helicopter's weaponry and continuing to fight.  Government officials could "
"not be reached for comment, but a local pastor spoke to our reporter in the "
"field.  \"There can no longer be any doubt,\" she was quoted as saying.  "
"\"These are the end times.\""
msgstr ""
"¿PORTALES? Los informes de portales brillantes que se han abierto en los "
"EE.UU. han sido corroborados por nuestro propio personal de información. Un "
"reportero fue testigo de una criatura del tamaño de un edificio de "
"apartamentos recibiendo un impacto directo del armamento de un helicóptero "
"Apache y continuando la lucha. No se pudo contactar a los oficiales del "
"gobierno para hacer comentarios, pero un pastor local habló con nuestro "
"reportero en el campo. \"Ya no puede haber ninguna duda\", se le citó "
"diciendo. \"Estos son los tiempos finales\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ZOMBIES!  Whether they're all the rioters, or just a few, it is now "
"undeniable: the dead walk among the living, adding to the ranks of the "
"psychos ripping our country apart from the inside.  Full photo evidence "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"¡ZOMBIS! Ya sean todos los alborotadores, o sólo unos pocos, ahora es "
"innegable: los muertos caminan entre los vivos, sumándose a las filas de los"
" psicópatas que desgarran nuestro país desde dentro. Una completa evidencia "
"fotográfica en el interior."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"CHINESE VICTORY AT HAND.  Emperor Tsang Gu Yen of Grand China arrived in "
"full state in Burlington, Vermont today to issue his proclamation that "
"America, like all countries of Earth, now belongs to the New Grand Chinese "
"Empire.  Freedom has fallen.  Rebel against his forces while you still can!"
msgstr ""
"LA VICTORIA CHINA ESTÁ A LA MANO. El emperador Tsang Gu Yen de la Gran China"
" llegó en pleno estado a Burlington, Vermont, hoy para emitir su "
"proclamación de que América, como todos los países de la Tierra, ahora "
"pertenece al Nuevo Gran Imperio Chino. La libertad ha caído. ¡Rebélate "
"contra sus fuerzas mientras puedas!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THEY WALK OUR EARTH.  They are here.  They are here.  They are here.  They "
"are here.  They are here.  They are here."
msgstr ""
"CAMINAN POR NUESTRA TIERRA. Están aquí. Están aquí. Están aquí. Están aquí. "
"Están aquí. Están aquí."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being eaten alive while your friends "
"applaud."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que eras comido vivo mientras tus "
"amigos aplaudían."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being naked in an arctic tundra and "
"freezing to death."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que estabas desnudo en una tundra "
"ártica y te mueres de frío."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about an unseen predator slowly killing you."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que un depredador invisible te mata "
"lentamente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about killing those you love with your bare "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"Despiertas de una pesadilla en la que matas a tus seres queridos con tus "
"propias manos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being finally judged for your ill deeds."
msgstr ""
"Despiertas de una pesadilla en la que te juzgan finalmente por tus malas "
"acciones."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare.  Recent events had not come to pass, and you "
"were stuck in an office job."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare.  This wasn't the end of the world… all those "
"innocents you've murdered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken in a cold sweat, relieved that you weren't being eaten alive by "
"evil Twinkies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken feeling hollow; you dreamt of your friends and family, only to "
"realize your new reality is the nightmare."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas sintiéndote vacío; soñaste con tus amigos y tu familia, sólo "
"para darte cuenta de que tu nueva realidad es la pesadilla."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You abruptly awake, relief washes over you as you were no longer naked in "
"the street, and the zombies weren't laughing at you."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas bruscamente, el alivio te invade porque ya no estabas desnudo "
"en la calle y los zombis no se reían de ti."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You feel something gently embrace you as you sleep.  You open your eyes, but"
" it's too dark to see, you struggle to move, but it has your arms and legs "
"in a cocoon of darkness, it has stolen your mouth and you cannot scream.  It"
" starts to devour you whole, starting with your feet, unable to escape, and "
"unable to scream.  You take your last breaths.  It was just a dream."
msgstr ""
"Sientes que algo te abraza suavemente mientras duermes. Abres los ojos, pero"
" está demasiado oscuro para ver, luchas por moverte, pero tiene tus brazos y"
" piernas en un capullo de oscuridad, te ha robado la boca y no puedes "
"gritar. Comienza a devorarte por completo, empezando por los pies, sin poder"
" escapar y sin poder gritar. Respiras por última vez. Era sólo un sueño."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You are in a meadow, unsure of how you got here.  The sun is shining, the "
"birds are singing, and children are playing; all is peaceful.  So why do the"
" hairs on your neck stand at attention?  Something is not quite right about "
"this peace.  You turn around, and the children have you surrounded.  The "
"faces of the children have vanished, replaced by a shark-like grin and beady"
" black eyes.  They reach out with their pale, claw-like hands.  However, you"
" cannot move, you cannot escape…"
msgstr ""
"Estás en un prado, sin saber cómo has llegado hasta aquí. El sol brilla, los"
" pájaros cantan y los niños juegan; todo está tranquilo. Entonces, ¿por qué "
"se te erizan los pelos de la nuca? Algo no encaja en esta paz. Te das la "
"vuelta y los niños te tienen rodeado. Las caras de los niños desaparecieron "
"siendo sustituidas por una sonrisa de tiburón y unos ojos negros y "
"brillantes. Extienden sus manos pálidas, como garras. Aun así no puedes "
"moverte, no puedes escapar..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You open your eyes, and you are not where you slept.  You have been strapped"
" to a chair in a dimly lit room with damp, rusty walls.  A clown covered in "
"blood splatters approaches you from behind, wielding a rusty drill, dancing "
"around you until he meets you face to face.  He toys with the trigger, "
"enjoying the sound.  You plead for him to let you go, he replies with this "
"maniacal laugh.  He inches the roaring drill towards your face, playing with"
" you, for you are his toy.  You can't help but to watch in horror as the "
"drill bit slowly inches its way towards your eye, unable to look away and "
"unable to close your eyes.  This is it."
msgstr ""
"Abres los ojos y no estás donde te dormiste. Te ataron a una silla en una "
"habitación poco iluminada con paredes húmedas y oxidadas. Un payaso cubierto"
" de salpicaduras de sangre se te acerca por detrás, empuñando un taladro "
"oxidado, bailando a tu alrededor hasta encontrarse contigo cara a cara. "
"Juguetea con el gatillo, disfrutando del sonido. Le suplicas que te deje ir,"
" y él responde con una risa maníaca. Acerca el rugiente taladro a tu cara, "
"jugando contigo, porque eres su juguete. No puedes evitar ver con horror "
"cómo la broca se acerca lentamente a tu ojo, sin poder apartar la vista y "
"sin poder cerrar los ojos. Eso es todo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You regain consciousness and realize you are at the bottom of a deep pit.  "
"You can make out a bucket just opposite of you.  Within the bucket you find "
"a bottle of lotion."
msgstr ""
"Recuperas la conciencia y te das cuenta de que estás en el fondo de un "
"profundo pozo. Puedes distinguir un cubo justo enfrente de ti. Dentro del "
"cubo encuentras un frasco de loción."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You feel as if you are being watched.  Several feet away from you are a pair"
" of burning yellow eyes.  A long, slimy appendage snakes its way towards "
"you, hauling you towards an abyssal pit of serrated teeth."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes como si te estuvieran observando. A varios metros de ti hay un "
"par de ojos amarillos ardientes. Un largo y viscoso tentáculo serpentea "
"hacia ti, arrastrándote hacia un pozo abisal de dientes afilados."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You try to get comfortable.  You hear a loud skittering sound but see "
"nothing.  The sound grows louder, and yet you see nothing.  Desperate, you "
"search for the source of the sound, you find nothing except for an itch in "
"your ear.  You reach to scratch it, causing hundreds of tiny spiders to "
"burst out, you find the source of the sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You open your eyes to a blinding light, surrounded by medical equipment, and"
" a group of panicking individuals dressed in blue scrubs.  They seem to be "
"doctors.  Your vision is blurry from the anesthesia, but one of them seems "
"to be holding a mass of flesh; it appears to be alive.  You glance down and "
"find your chest has been cut open.  The doctors start screaming as the mass "
"of flesh rips them apart.  You are next…"
msgstr ""
"Abres los ojos y te encuentras con una luz cegadora, rodeado de equipos "
"médicos y un grupo de personas aterradas vestidas con batas azules. Parecen "
"ser médicos. Tu visión es borrosa por la anestesia, pero uno de ellos parece"
" sostener una masa de carne; parece estar viva. Miras hacia abajo y "
"descubres que te han abierto el pecho. Los médicos empiezan a gritar "
"mientras la masa de carne los destroza. Tu eres el siguiente..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about the deaths of your loved ones."
msgstr "Despiertas de una pesadilla sobre la muerte de tus seres queridos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being eaten alive by something terrible."
msgstr "Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que te come vivo algo horrible."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about slowly going insane."
msgstr "Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que te vuelves loco poco a poco."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about falling into a lake with a cannonball tied"
" to your feet."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que te caes a un lago con una bala de "
"cañón atada en los pies."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about suffocating in a small metal box."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que te asfixias en una pequeña caja de "
"metal."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being forced to watch as your loved ones "
"are executed."
msgstr ""
"Despiertas de una pesadilla en la que te ves obligado a ver cómo ejecutan a "
"tus seres queridos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about the Cataclysm happening over and over "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que el Cataclismo se repite una y otra "
"vez."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about dying of thirst in a desert."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que mueres de sed en un desierto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about your loved ones stabbing you."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que tus seres queridos te apuñalan."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about the end of the world."
msgstr "Te despiertas de una pesadilla sobre el fin del mundo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about the Cataclysm not having happened and "
"being stuck in an office job."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que el Cataclismo no ha ocurrido y "
"estás atrapado en un trabajo de oficina."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about slipping out of a plane, into a pitch "
"black sky."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being a limbless zombie in a decrepit "
"building."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You're outside in a park, under a dark gray sky.  The air is thick, and "
"smells like earth.  You hear thunder crack above you, and it begins to rain."
"  As you look up, you realize with horror that it's raining spiders.  The "
"creatures land all over your body, and you try to cover your mouth and nose "
"but a few manage to slip through your hands.  You can feel the spiders "
"inside your lungs.  You try to scream, but your mouth is full of them.  "
"Tears stream down your face as you choke on millions of tiny black spiders."
"  You wake up gasping for air."
msgstr ""
"Estás fuera, en un parque, bajo un cielo gris oscuro. El ambiente está "
"pesado y huele a tierra. Oyes un trueno sobre ti y empieza a llover. Al "
"mirar hacia arriba, te das cuenta con horror de que están lloviendo arañas. "
"Las criaturas se posan en todo tu cuerpo, e intentas taparte la boca y la "
"nariz, pero algunas consiguen colarse entre tus dedos. Puedes sentir las "
"arañas dentro de tus pulmones. Intentas gritar, pero tienes la boca llena de"
" ellas. Las lágrimas corren por tu cara mientras te ahogas con millones de "
"pequeñas arañas negras. Te despiertas jadeando."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"It's your first day at work!  Unfortunately, the bus had to take a three-"
"hour detour, so you show up extremely late.  As you walk into the office, "
"you suddenly realize you forgot to put your pants on.  Even worse, your "
"mother walks in behind you and starts berating you in front of all your co-"
"workers.  As the entire office laughs at you, you wake up from your "
"nightmare."
msgstr ""
"Es tu primer día de trabajo. Por desgracia, el autobús ha tenido que dar un "
"rodeo de tres horas, así que llegas muy tarde. Al entrar en la oficina, te "
"das cuenta de que has olvidado ponerte los pantalones. Peor aún, tu madre "
"entra detrás de ti y empieza a regañarte delante de todos tus compañeros. "
"Mientras toda la oficina se ríe de ti, te despiertas de tu pesadilla."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of running in an endless hallway.  You hear something gargantuan "
"chasing you with heavy breaths and wet squelching sounds.  You run until you"
" are out of breath and wake up feeling exhausted."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas que corres por un pasillo interminable. Oyes que algo gigantesco te "
"persigue con una respiración pesada y sonidos sofocantes. Corres hasta "
"quedarte sin aliento y te despiertas agotado."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about drowning in a pit of maggots - chewing and"
" biting your skin, filling your lungs."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas de una pesadilla en la que te ahogas en un pozo de gusanos, "
"masticando y mordiendo tu piel, llenando tus pulmones."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"In your dream, you are tied to a chair.  You hear a deep voice slowly recite"
" what torments await sinners in hell as you are slowly lowered into a dark "
"pit.  As your vision fades, a large metal hatch closes you into the "
"darkness."
msgstr ""
"En tu sueño, estás atado a una silla. Oyes una voz profunda que recita "
"lentamente los tormentos que esperan a los pecadores en el infierno mientras"
" te bajan lentamente a un pozo oscuro. Cuando tu visión se oscurece, una "
"gran escotilla de metal te cierra en la oscuridad."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ Snippet in category "psi_nether_attention_nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of flying.  You fly higher and higher until you are in outer "
"space.  You look back at Earth and see that it's cracked - something is "
"hatching and a thousand crimson eyes are fixated on you."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas con volar. Vuelas cada vez más alto hasta que estás en el espacio "
"exterior. Vuelves a mirar a la Tierra y ves que está agrietada: algo está "
"eclosionando y mil ojos carmesí se te quedan viendo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that you're leaning over a bathroom sink, trying to pull loose a "
"wisdom tooth that's been slicing up your gums.  You succeed in yanking it "
"out and it clatters into the sink - the tooth is six inches long, jagged and"
" serrated like the blade of a nasty dagger, with a crack in the enamel "
"giving way to pink tissue underneath.  The taste of blood still lingers in "
"your mouth for a moment even after you wake up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a long and vivid nightmare about living in an old, poorly "
"ventilated building with countless other people.  The air is humid and "
"stuffy, every room is brightly lit and the people are always yelling and "
"making noise.  You try to get some rest but you can't.  You try using the "
"restroom but it's too cramped.  It gets so unbearable that you feel sick, "
"and you find that you've gagged yourself awake."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about walking through a street from your childhood,"
" where every surface is the same shade of solid red.  You wake up startled "
"after noticing an equally red man down the street, moving quickly in your "
"direction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"In your dreams you feel as though you've learned something really, really "
"important.  You wake up in quiet distress, as you've already forgotten what "
"that something was."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You open your eyes and find yourself in a school hallway.  It's high school."
"  Students are filing past one another to reach their respective classrooms."
"  You begin heading for your class as well, when you distinctly hear a soft "
"voice crying out for help.  Startled, you go into a half-sprint and rush to "
"where the noises are coming from.  You end up in front of one of the student"
" bathrooms.  The weeping seems to be echoing from the ladies' restroom, and "
"you brace yourself for the worst and barge in.  The abrupt silence catches "
"you off guard, and of the four stalls, one seems to be painted entirely "
"black.  You creep towards it and silently push ajar the entrance.  You find "
"with abject terror a naked baby blown to horrific proportions wailing out "
"his lungs.  The macabre dread deadens your heart as you realize.  This was "
"how you were birthed into this world."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You fitfully dreamed horrid, fleeting dreams for the past several days.  "
"Each time you plunged into slumber, you always ended up in the same place.  "
"You would be in one of the decrepit residential flats of an old burned-down "
"building.  The dream merely consisted of you heading to the bathroom to wash"
" your hair over the sink.  The problem was that you could feel someone "
"approaching in the distance.  Every night, footsteps appeared to be getting "
"closer.  Last week, you managed to see the door to your flat opening as you "
"headed for the bathroom.  Outside stood a man, cloaked in heavy shadow, his "
"breathing stifled.  Four days ago, he reached the living room.  Two days "
"ago, he stood right next to you as you entered the restroom.  His eyes were "
"dull and resembled cracked, foggy glass.  His hands clutched a rusty knife."
"  Yesterday, he followed you in.  Today, he stared unblinking as you washed "
"your hair.  Out of the corner of your eye as your cleaned yourself, you saw "
"him scribbling something on the wall with a thick, dark red liquid.  The "
"viscous trail of crimson shocked you awake.  It read: Tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You wake up feeling that you lost something important."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You flee in a panic into a nearby school bathroom.  Mr. ____, he was chasing"
" you.  You had your doubts but now you were sure.  As you try your best to "
"calm your ragged breathing, you rush into an unlocked stall to hide.  The "
"proof was right here.  Every wall of the stall was covered in soulless eyes."
"  They were painted.  Except for one.  One of the eyes was hollow.  It was "
"used as a cover to hide a hole leading to the next-door stall.  Mr. ____ "
"would secretly spy on the students.  You had evidence of his misdemeanor.  "
"You frantically message your friends with the footage, asking them to "
"contact the authorities.  You tell them you are not in a position to call "
"them yourself.  Suddenly, you look up, and find Mr. ____ staring at you as "
"he climbs down from the locked stall door.  You wake up screaming, still "
"reeling from the nightmare."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You hear a voice in the distance proclaiming that the Son of Man would soon "
"arrive.  It was the one we had all been waiting for, for so long.  You smile"
" in quiet rapture as angels start descending from Heaven.  Up above, seated "
"upon a golden throne, brighter than the Sun, and more mysterious than the "
"Moon, you see a blinding white light.  As you shed tears of infinite bliss, "
"you peer deeper into the luminous source out of curiosity, and see… horns?  "
"You are startled awake by the revelation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "purple meteor"
msgstr "meteorito púrpura"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "broken line"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "falling star"
msgstr "estrella fugaz"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "moving stars"
msgstr "estrellas moviendose"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "unusual darkness"
msgstr "oscuridad inusual"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "vanishing stars"
msgstr "estrellas desapareciendo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "shuffled stars"
msgstr "estrellas revueltas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "new constellation of stars"
msgstr "nueva constelación de estrellas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "green moon"
msgstr "luna verde"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "So do you like cats or dogs?"
msgstr "¿Te gustan los gatos o los perros?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "It's nice to know that the <zombies> don't feel pain."
msgstr "Es bueno saber que el <zombies> no siente dolor."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Wherever we end up, at least we're still alive, right?"
msgstr "Dondequiera que acabemos, al menos seguimos vivos, ¿no?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Somehow, I don't think I'll be going back to my old job anytime soon…"
msgstr "De alguna forma, no creo que vuelva a mi antiguo trabajo pronto..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "I am SO glad I don't need to deal with taxes or debt anymore."
msgstr ""
"Estoy TAN contenta/o de no tener que lidiar con los impuestos o las deudas "
"nunca más."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Geez, this is nothing like those Hollywood zombie films!"
msgstr ""
"¡Cielos, esto no se parece en nada a esas películas de zombis de Hollywood!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Do you ever think about the ethics of killing <zombies>?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez pensaste en lo ético de matar a <zombies>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"Do you think living on a farm is dangerous because the roosters might "
"attract <zombies>?"
msgstr ""
"¿Crees que vivir en una granja es peligroso porque los gallos pueden atraer "
"a <zombies>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"I have dreamt of owning a house by the sea, but now I have nightmares of "
"what lurks beneath the waves."
msgstr ""
"He soñado con tener una casa junto al mar, pero ahora tengo pesadillas de lo"
" que acecha bajo las olas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"I liked walking through the forest, listening to the chirping of the birds "
"but now I am afraid that the birds might devour me."
msgstr ""
"Me gustaba caminar por el bosque, escuchando el piar de los pájaros, pero "
"ahora tengo miedo de que los pájaros me devoren."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"So you wet your toothbrush AFTER you apply toothpaste?  That's so weird."
msgstr ""
"¿Así que mojas el cepillo de dientes DESPUÉS de aplicar la pasta de dientes?"
" Eso es muy raro."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "So is it pronounced gif or gif?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿se pronuncia gif o gif?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "What do you think the president is doing right now?"
msgstr "¿Qué crees que está haciendo el presidente en este momento?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"What do you like to listen to?  Personally I'm into bass-heavy post-glam "
"speed polka."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué te gusta escuchar? Personalmente, me gusta la polka de velocidad post-"
"glam con muchos bajos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"Don't tell anyone else, but sometimes I like to sleep holding my teddy bear."
msgstr ""
"No se lo digas a nadie más, pero a veces me gusta dormir abrazado a mi oso "
"de peluche."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Sometimes I see weird shit in the sky at night."
msgstr "A veces veo cosas raras en el cielo por la noche."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Did you see the <weird_sky_thing> in the sky last night, too?"
msgstr "¿Tú también viste el/la <weird_sky_thing> en el cielo anoche?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "I used to have a cat.  I really miss Mr. Cuddles…"
msgstr "Solía tener un gato. Realmente extraño al Sr. Abrazos..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"My friends and I used to play cops-and-robbers, except with zombies.  Never "
"thought I'd be in it for real…"
msgstr ""
"Mis amigos y yo solíamos jugar a policías y ladrones, pero con zombis. Nunca"
" pensé que lo haría de verdad..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"We both need to cheer up, so here is a joke: What do you call a sleepy car?"
"  Tired!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"I still think about when the rioters and my neighbors tore each other to "
"shreds…"
msgstr ""
"Todavía pienso en cuando los manifestantes y mis vecinos se hicieron "
"pedazos..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"One day I greeted the mailman but his eyes were bloodshot and he "
"aggressively threw letters at me."
msgstr ""
"Un día saludé al cartero, pero sus ojos estaban inyectados en sangre y me "
"lanzó las cartas de forma agresiva."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"This is nothing compared to just two months ago.  Everything is getting "
"bigger and more dangerous with each day that passes."
msgstr ""
"Esto no es nada comparado con hace dos meses. Todo es más grande y más "
"peligroso con cada día que pasa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Do you ever think that we're in some kind of simulation?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez has pensado que estamos en una especie de simulación?"

