msgstr "Cápsula de Escape"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Challenge - Abnormal Augmentations"
msgstr "DESAFIO - Mejorado Anormalmente"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Challenge - Abnormal Augmentations"
msgstr "DESAFIO - Mejorado Anormalmente"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Abnormal Augmentations" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've already been modified mutagenically but now you were all ready for a "
"bionic implant or three - the bill footed by the corp., of course - when "
"everything went pear-shaped and all you could hear from the other rooms was "
"screaming.  For a few hours, at least.  Now all you can hear is shuffling, "
"crackling, the occasional gurgling, burbling moan, and heavy, wet thumps.  "
"Hopefully your surgery was registered as an elective because you've elected "
"to get the heck out of here!"
msgstr ""
"Ya has sido modificado mutagénicamente, pero ahora estabas listo para un "
"implante biónico o tres -la factura la pagaba la corporación, por supuesto- "
"cuando de repente todo se fue al garete y todo lo que podías oír de las "
"otras habitaciones eran gritos durante unas horas, al menos. Ahora todo lo "
"que se oye es un arrastre, un crujido, algún gorgoteo ocasional, un gemido "
"burbujeante y golpes fuertes y húmedos. Con suerte, tu cirugía fue "
"considerada como optativa porque has elegido salir de aquí pitando."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Abnormal Augmentations" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've already been modified mutagenically but now you were all ready for a "
"bionic implant or three - the bill footed by the corp., of course - when "
"everything went pear-shaped and all you could hear from the other rooms was "
"screaming.  For a few hours, at least.  Now all you can hear is shuffling, "
"crackling, the occasional gurgling, burbling moan, and heavy, wet thumps.  "
"Hopefully your surgery was registered as an elective because you've elected "
"to get the heck out of here!"
msgstr ""
"Ya has sido modificado mutagénicamente, pero ahora estabas listo para un "
"implante biónico o tres -la factura la pagaba la corporación, por supuesto- "
"cuando de repente todo se fue al garete y todo lo que podías oír de las "
"otras habitaciones eran gritos durante unas horas, al menos. Ahora todo lo "
"que se oye es un arrastre, un crujido, algún gorgoteo ocasional, un gemido "
"burbujeante y golpes fuertes y húmedos. Con suerte, tu cirugía fue "
"considerada como optativa porque has elegido salir de aquí pitando."

