msgstr[2] "capas de centinela-lx"

#. ~ Description of "sentinel-lx cloak"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"The vantablack cloak of sentinel-lx hangs around ones shoulders as a solid, "
"unnatural shadow.  Made from woven graphene, it's lightweight and resistant,"
" but cannot be repaired."
msgstr ""
"La capa vantablack centinela LX cuelga alrededor de los hombros como una "
"sombra sólida y antinatural. Hecho de grafeno tejido, es ligero y "
"resistente, pero no puede ser reparado"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "IX-2110 computer"
msgid_plural "IX-2110 computers"
msgstr[0] "ordenador IX-2110"
msgstr[1] "ordenadores IX-2110"
msgstr[2] "ordenadores IX-2110"

#. ~ Description of "IX-2110 computer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally "
"designed to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the "
"most successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were "
"produced and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the "
"early Hyperspace Era.  By now more than 400 years old, making it boot "
"successfully would be a small adventure all of its own."
msgstr ""
"El Imagos IX-2110 original, un ordenador de muñeca de uso general diseñado "
"originalmente para apoyar las operaciones en entornos peligrosos. Entre las "
"piezas tecnológicas de mayor éxito jamás creadas, millones de ellas se "
"produjeron y vendieron a los exploradores y colonos que domesticaron por "
"primera vez las estrellas durante la primera Era del Hiperespacio. Con más "
"de 400 años de antigüedad, hacerla arrancar con éxito sería una pequeña "
"aventura en sí misma."

