msgid_plural "1025 Goas"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "1025 Goa"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
msgid ""
"A powerful, single shot 25mm rifle, heavy under the weight of several recoil"
" dampening mechanisms.  Designed by the now defunct Goa Firearms, it was "
"originally conceived as a luxury rifle for sport hunting alien megafauna."
msgstr ""
"Un potente rifle 25mm de un solo disparo, pesado por el peso de varios "
"mecanismos de amortiguación de retroceso. Diseñado por la ya desaparecida "
"Goa Firearms, fue concebido originalmente como un rifle de lujo para cacería"
" deportiva de mega fauna extraterrestre."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
msgid "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Armory 2519s"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
msgid ""
"The much feared 2519 smart sniper platform leverages advanced ballistic "
"targeting and guidance computers to deliver heavy munitions with unerring "
"precision.  Its undisputed lethality makes it a rare sight outside of the "
"company's max security divisions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
msgid "eidolon derringer"
msgid_plural "eidolon derringers"
msgstr[0] "derringer eidolon"
msgstr[1] "derringers eidolon"
msgstr[2] "derringers eidolon"

#. ~ Description of gun "eidolon derringer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
msgid ""
"A slick, miniature derringer designed as a backup weapon for covert "
"operations and close-range assassination.  It will fire up to four 5x50mm "
"penetrators simultaneously, to devastating effect."
msgstr ""
"Una elegante derringer en miniatura diseñada como arma de apoyo para "
"operaciones encubiertas y asesinatos a corta distancia. Disparará hasta "
"cuatro penetradores de 5x50mm simultáneamente, con un efecto devastador."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/7.50mm.json
msgid "landfall survival gun"
msgid_plural "landfall survival guns"
msgstr[0] "arma de supervivencia de aterrizaje"
msgstr[1] "armas de supervivencia de aterrizaje"
msgstr[2] "armas de supervivencia de aterrizaje"

#. ~ Description of gun "landfall survival gun"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/7.50mm.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, bolt-action gun that is barely more than a 6.55mm barrel "
"mounted within a flimsy metal assembly.  Cheaply made and outdated in all "
"respects, it's only useful in the most extenuating of circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Un arma ligera de cerrojo que apenas es más que un cañón de 6.55 mm montado "
"dentro de un endeble conjunto metálico. De fabricación barata y anticuada en"
" todos los aspectos, solo es útil en las circunstancias más extenuantes."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/7.50mm.json
msgid "Accipiter Hawk-00"
msgid_plural "Accipiter Hawk-00s"
msgstr[0] "Accipiter Hawk-00"
msgstr[1] "Accipiters Hawk-00"
msgstr[2] "Accipiters Hawk-00"

#. ~ Description of gun "Accipiter Hawk-00"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/7.50mm.json
msgid ""
"A light machine gun manufactured by Accipiter Firearms and distributed by "
"Wraitheon.  The Hawk-00's high rate of fire makes it ideally suited to lay "
"down suppressive fire; but also makes it exceedingly hard to control while "
"unmounted."
msgstr ""
"Una ametralladora ligera fabricada por Accipiter Firearms y distribuida por "
"Wraitheon. La alta cadencia de fuego del Hawk-00 lo hace ideal para matener "
"fuego de supresión, pero también lo hace muy difícil de controlar cuando no "
"está montado."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/7.50mm.json
msgid "G&W SR-P9"
msgid_plural "G&W SR-P9s"
msgstr[0] "G&W SR-P9"
msgstr[1] "G&Ws SR-P9"
msgstr[2] "G&Ws SR-P9"

#. ~ Description of gun "G&W SR-P9"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/7.50mm.json
msgid ""
"An eminently sturdy and reliable bullpup rifle issued by UICA's military "
"during early reclamation expeditions.  Although it's been out of service for"
" nearly two decades, many a private military and contractor has found a use "
"for the SR-P9, and it remains common long past its initial introduction into"
" service."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle bullpup sumamente resistente y fiable usado por el ejército UICA "
"durante las primeras expediciones de recuperación. Aunque ha estado fuera de"
" uso por casi dos décadas, muchos ejércitos privados y contratistas han "
"encontrado uso para el SR-P9 y continúa siendo común tanto tiempo después de"
" haber sido puesto en servicio."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/8x40mm.json
msgid "RM99 revolver"
msgid_plural "RM99 revolvers"
