#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Captain Schwarz Walder, Cannibal"
msgstr "Capitán Schwarz Walder, Caníbal"

#. ~ Description of profession "Captain Schwarz Walder, Cannibal" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Several years ago, you were newly stationed at a remote corporate facility "
"when it came under a personality rewrite attack that affected all of your "
"human coworkers.  It had seemed likely that the few Uplifted staff would "
"perish and most did.  But you disappeared into the wilderness surrounding "
"the facilities and began hunting the things that had been your friends.  "
"Eating them to stay alive and to power your bionics.  Recapturing the "
"facility earned you a buyout of the remainder of your contract, but most "
"people are uncomfortable around you once they realize how very different you"
" are.  Now you are here on a mostly abandoned planet hunting a bounty."
msgstr ""
"Hace varios años, estabas recién destinado en una instalación corporativa "
"remota cuando ésta sufrió un ataque de reescritura de personalidad que "
"afectó a todos tus compañeros humanos. Parecía probable que el escaso "
"personal de los Ascendidos pereciera, y así fue. Pero tú desapareciste en la"
" naturaleza que rodeaba las instalaciones y comenzaste a cazar las cosas que"
" habían sido tus amigos. Comiéndolos para mantenerte vivo y para alimentar "
"tus biónicos. Recuperar la instalación te ganó la compra del resto de tu "
"contrato, pero la mayoría de la gente se siente incómoda a tu alrededor una "
"vez que se dan cuenta de lo muy diferente que eres. Ahora estás aquí, en un "
"planeta casi abandonado, a la caza de una recompensa."

