#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Uplifted Enforcer"
msgstr "Ejecutor Ascenidod"

#. ~ Description of profession "Uplifted Enforcer" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are an uplifted elephant hybrid, a precisely engineered enforcer "
"creature created by combining human, elephant and mastodon DNA.  Unlike most"
" of your war-minded kin, you sought a peaceful retirement after completing "
"your compulsive service period, and even earned the right to be considered a"
" full citizen.  Now, with the end of the world in the horizon, it seems that"
" your combat skills might come useful once again."
msgstr ""
"Eres un híbrido de elefante ascendido, una criatura ejecutora creada con "
"precisión mediante la combinación de ADN humano, de elefante y de "
"mastodonte. A diferencia de la mayoría de tus parientes belicistas, "
"buscastes un retiro pacífico tras completar tu periodo de servicio "
"obligatorio, e incluso te ganastes el derecho a ser considerado un ciudadano"
" de pleno derecho. Ahora, con el fin del mundo en el horizonte, parece que "
"tus habilidades de combate podrían volver a ser útiles."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Uplifted Enforcer"
msgstr "Ejecutor Ascendido"

#. ~ Description of profession "Uplifted Enforcer" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are an uplifted elephant hybrid, a precisely engineered enforcer "
"creature created by combining human, elephant and mastodon DNA.  Unlike most"
" of your war-minded kin, you sought a peaceful retirement after completing "
"your compulsive service period, and even earned the right to be considered a"
" full citizen.  Now, with the end of the world in the horizon, it seems that"
" your combat skills might come useful once again."
msgstr ""
"Eres una híbrida de elefante ascendida, una criatura ejecutora creada con "
"precisión mediante la combinación de ADN humano, de elefante y de "
"mastodonte. A diferencia de la mayoría de tus parientes belicistas, "
"buscastes un retiro pacífico tras completar tu periodo de servicio "
"obligatorio, e incluso te ganastes el derecho a ser considerado una "
"ciudadana de pleno derecho. Ahora, con el fin del mundo en el horizonte, "
"parece que tus habilidades de combate podrían volver a ser útiles."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Operator"
msgstr "Operador Biónico"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Operator" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked as a mercenary across six continents for a dozen corps.  A VP at "
"the last corp decided he wanted to put you on retainer and you agreed to a "
"three month gig in return for some additional bionics.  You woke up with an "
"extra bionic, a cranial bomb that needed to be reset every month or so or it"
" blows up.  Now you have days until the bomb goes off.  Maybe you'll find "
"someone who can remove it.  Can you even sleep, for fear of death?"
msgstr ""
"Has trabajado como mercenario en seis continentes para una docena de "
"corporaciones. Un vicepresidente de la última corporación decidió que quería"
" contratarte y aceptaste un trabajo de tres meses a cambio de algunos "
"biónicos adicionales. Te despertaste con un biónico extra, una bomba craneal"
" que debía ser reiniciada cada mes más o explotaba. Ahora tienes días hasta "
"que la bomba estalle. Tal vez encuentres a alguien que pueda quitarla. "
"¿Puedes siquiera dormir, por miedo a la muerte?"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Operator"
msgstr "Operador Biónico"

