#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
msgid "waycircle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "waycircle"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
msgid ""
"A ritualistic, circular glyph painted onto a sizable boulder and surrounded "
"with primitive decor, with the intent of channeling the natural of ley lines"
" into a functional landing spot for teleportation.  Theoretically, it could "
"receive any manner of targeted teleport, be it magical, ritualistic, or "
"technological.  Examine to link."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
msgid "Waystone"
msgid_plural "Waystones"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Waystone"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
msgid ""
"This large chunk of stone, cut from a paired waycircle, has been enchanted "
"with primitive, ritual power to link it to a network of empowered ley lines."
"  As a result, it is capable of sending the user to any linked waycircle, or"
" to any similar teleport location, be it magical or technological, after "
"performing a brief somatic ritual.  The stone is many, many times heavier "
"than it seems to have any right to be, as if pulled powerfully to the Earth "
"by unseen forces.  Further, though it is only somewhat bulky, it seems to "
"defy proper transport, its own dimensions defying any container or "
"reasonable transport.  Best to craft this where you intend to leave it.  "
"Requires a nearby waycircle to craft."
msgstr ""
"Este pedazo grande de piedra, cortado de un par de circulo-vías, ha sido "
"encantado con energía primitiva y ritual para conectarlo a una red de líneas"
" ley energizadas. Como resultado, es capaz de enviar al usuario hacia el "
"circulo-vía conectado o a algún lugar similar de teleportación, ya sea "
"mágico o tecnológico, luego de realizar un breve ritual somático. La piedra "
"es muchas, muchas veces más pesada de lo que parece, como si estuviera "
"tironeada potentemente hacia la Tierra por fuerzas invisibles. Además, "
"aunque es un poco voluminosa, parece desafiar el transporte apropiado, sus "
"propias dimensiones desafían cualquier recipiente o transporte razonable. Lo"
" mejor es fabricarlo donde tiene intención de colocarlo. Necesita una "
"circulo-vía cercana para poder fabricarla."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
msgid "Red Room Recall"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Red Room Recall"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
msgid "Transports the user to a viable landing pad via strange forces."
msgstr ""
"Transporta al usuario a un punto de aterrizaje mediante fuerzas extrañas."

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/modinfo.json
msgid "Blaze Industries"
msgstr "Blaze Industries"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Blaze Industries"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Introduces the fictional corporation Blaze Industries, bringing advanced "
"vehicle modification to the consumer."
msgstr ""
"Presenta la corporación ficticia Blaze Industries, aportando la modificación"
" avanzada de vehículos al consumidor."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Dream Log 1: I had a dream and I can vaguely remember seeing a strange "
"truck that had overly round edges, it tooted its horn but instead I heard "
"people screaming, and when I blinked suddenly the truck wasn't just rounded,"
" but made of people screaming forever inside a viscous blob.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bitácora de sueño 1: He tenido un sueño y recuerdo vagamente haber visto "
"un extraño camión que tenía los bordes demasiado redondeados, tocaba la "
"bocina pero en su lugar oía a la gente gritar, y cuando parpadeaba de "
"repente el camión no era sólo redondeado, sino que estaba hecho de gente "
"gritando para siempre dentro de una glóbulo viscoso\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Dream Log 2: In last night's dream I was driving a rusty and dusty Humvee,"
" with my trusty companion using a massive pneumatic weapon to shoot rebar "
"pipes into faceless enemies chasing us.  My heart is still pumping, why does"
" it feel like a memory instead of a dream?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Registro de Sueño 2: En el sueño de anoche conducía un Humvee oxidado y "
"polvoriento, con mi fiel compañero usando un arma neumática masiva para "
"disparar tubos de barras de refuerzo a los enemigos sin rostro que nos "
"perseguían. Mi corazón sigue bombeando, ¿por qué se siente como un recuerdo "
"en lugar de un sueño?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Dream Log 3: Another dream.  This time I dropped a diamond on a sea of "
"charcoal dust, and the diamond begun to shine and make the dust glitter "
"until a shape of a car emerged from the dust made entirely of thick, "
"perfectly angular diamond.  A beautiful shape appeared on it, and in a flash"
" of light I was pierced by a glittering lance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bitácora de sueño 3: Otro sueño. Esta vez dejé caer un diamante sobre un "
"mar de polvo de carbón vegetal, y el diamante empezó a brillar y a hacer "
"relucir el polvo hasta que surgió del polvo la forma de un coche hecho "
"enteramente de diamante grueso y perfectamente angular. Apareció una hermosa"
" forma en él, y en un destello de luz fue atravesado por una reluciente "
"lanza\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Dream Log 4: These dreams get weirder.  My companion of mine was driving "
"the RV, and I opened the back of the RV and found there was no roof but a "
"whole tray of gargantuan flowers made of solar panels arching toward the sun"
" greedily, light flowing from them into the RV.  I stepped back and lost my "
"footing, seeing a strange portal on the side before I fell into a limitless "
"darkness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bitácora de sueño 4: Estos sueños se vuelven más extraños. Mi acompañante "
"conducía la autocaravana, abrí la parte trasera de la misma y descubrí que "
"no había techo, sino toda una bandeja de flores gargantuescas hechas de "
"paneles solares que se arqueaban hacia el sol con avidez, fluyendo la luz "
"desde ellas hacia la autocaravana. Retrocedí y perdí el equilibrio, viendo "
"un extraño portal en el lateral antes de caer en una oscuridad sin "
"límites\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Dream Log 5: My most recent dream was better so here it goes.  I was "
"walking in a meadow when a strange stone with a perfect spiral on it fell in"
" front of me.  I picked it up and blew on it, and a tornado roared from the "
"stone.  In its wake, a car appeared, wickedly shaped and the sound of "
"tornadoes coming from its exhaust- and I rode the wind, hurling thunderbolts"
" at any who got in my way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bitácora de sueño 5: Mi sueño más reciente fue mejor así que aquí va. "
"Estaba caminando por un prado cuando una extraña piedra con una espiral "
"perfecta cayó frente a mí. La recogí y soplé sobre ella, y de la piedra "
"surgió un tornado. A su paso, apareció un coche, con una forma malvada y el "
"sonido de los tornados saliendo de su tubo de escape, y monté en el viento, "
"lanzando rayos a cualquiera que se interpusiera en mi camino\"."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/furniture_and_terrain/blaze_appliances.json
msgid "full-size washing machine"
msgstr "lavadora de tamaño normal"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "full-size washing machine"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/furniture_and_terrain/blaze_appliances.json
msgid ""
"A medium-sized household washing machine, converted to utilize vehicle "
"power.  When turned on, filthy items will be laundered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "vehicle refrigerator"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/furniture_and_terrain/blaze_furniture.json
msgid ""
"This fridge has been converted to run off of a vehicle's power supply.  "
"You'll need to take it down first."
msgstr ""
"Este refrigerador ha sido convertido para funcionar sin la fuente de "
"alimentación de un vehículo. Tendrás que desmontarlo primero."

#. ~ Description of furniture "vehicle freezer"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/furniture_and_terrain/blaze_furniture.json
msgid ""
"This fridge has been further refurbished, and runs at a much lower "
"temperature.  You'll need to take it down first."
msgstr ""
"Este frigorífico ha sido renovado y funciona a una temperatura mucho más "
"baja. Tendrás que desmontarlo primero."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/items/vehicle/blaze_engine.json
msgid "large steam engine"
msgid_plural "large steam engines"
msgstr[0] "motor de vapor grande"
msgstr[1] "motores de vapor grandes"
msgstr[2] "motores de vapor grandes"

#. ~ Description of "large steam engine"
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/items/vehicle/blaze_engine.json
msgid ""
"A large steam engine.  An integrated boiler burns coal to heat water into "
"steam, driving a reciprocating shaft.  A condensor recaptures the water, "
"making this a closed cycle system."
msgstr ""
"Un motor de vapor grande. Una caldera integrada quema carbón para calentar "
