"A French baguette, sharpened into a blade and toasted for durability.  "
"Truly, the best weapon to smite the gluten-intolerant."
msgstr ""
"Una baguette francesa, afilada en forma de hoja y tostada para mayor "
"durabilidad. Verdaderamente, la mejor arma para derrotar a los intolerantes "
"al gluten."

