#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid "Dimorphodon zombie"
msgid_plural "Dimorphodon zombie"
msgstr[0] "zombi Dimorphodon"
msgstr[1] "zombis Dimorphodon"
msgstr[2] "zombis Dimorphodon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Dimorphodon zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The raggedly flying corpse  of a feathered reptile over three feet long, "
"with short wings and a big colorful beak."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un reptil emplumado de más de un metro de largo, con alas "
"cortas y un gran pico colorido."

#. ~ Description of monster "Winged Horror"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The flying corpse of a feathered reptile over three feet long, with short "
"wings and a big colorful beak.  Its entire body bulges with distended "
"muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver volador de un reptil emplumado de más de un metro de largo, con "
"alas cortas y un gran pico colorido. Todo su cuerpo abulta con músculos "
"distendidos y heridas hinchadas y supurantes."

#. ~ Monster name
