#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Good soldier.  Killed 40 dinos."
msgstr "Buen soldado. Mató 40 dinosaurios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Bad soldier.  Killed 3 dinos."
msgstr "Mal soldado. Mató 3 dinosaurios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Fed the great Eaters.  Will be honored for all time."
msgstr "Alimenta a los grandes Devoradores. Serás honrado para siempre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Meh scientist but a good friend."
msgstr "Un científico mehh pero un buen amigo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Loved dinosaurs.  Should have run."
msgstr "Me encantaban los dinosaurios. Debería haber corrido."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Died tragically rescuing his family from a burning tyrannosaurus."
msgstr ""
"Murió trágicamente rescatando a su familia de un tiranosaurio en llamas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Died wrestling a mosasaurus.  It was not just a big gator."
msgstr "Murió luchando contra un mosasaurio. No era sólo un gran caimán."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Built a beautiful farm and filled it with dangerous dinosaurs."
msgstr "Construyó una hermosa granja y la llenó de peligrosos dinosaurios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Life did not find a way."
msgstr "La vida no encontró el camino."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid ""
"The greatest dinosaur expert of our times.  Crushed to death by an "
"apatosaurus."
msgstr ""
"El mayor experto en dinosaurios de nuestros tiempos. Murió aplastado por un "
"apatosaurio."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid ""
"Fool hid in a cardboard box from a deinonychus, shouting Dino Dave!  Didn't "
"work."
msgstr ""
"El tonto se escondió en una caja de cartón de un deinonychus, gritando ¡Dino"
" Dave! No funcionó."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid "Here lies a dinosaur, don't know what kind.  Hated shovels."
msgstr "Aquí yace un dinosaurio, no sé de qué tipo. Odiaba las palas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
msgid ""
"Alonso did not know her, but she was beautiful and majestic and she deserved"
" the proper burial.  Alonso will remember this dinosaur for some of the "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Alonso no la conocía pero ella era hermosa y majestuosa y se merecía un "
"entierro apropiado. Alonso recordará este dinosaurio por mucho tiempo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"I've seen some big dinosaurs out there.  I know that should be scary, but "
"all I felt was hungry."
msgstr ""
"He visto grandes dinosaurios por ahí. Sé que debería dar miedo, pero todo lo"
" que sentí fue hambre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"I think those little dinosaurs are kind of cute, like a cat kind of.  Do you"
" think they eat cat food?"
msgstr ""
"Creo que esos pequeños dinosaurios son bastante lindos, como una especie de "
"gato. ¿Crees que comen comida para gatos?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid "Dinosaurs are a bow hunter's best friend.  Feathers forever!"
msgstr ""
"Los dinosaurios son el mejor amigo del cazador con arco. ¡Plumas para "
"siempre!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"I saw one of those feathered dinosaurs up close and it had these beautiful "
"soft downy feathers under the big ones.  I bet if you could pluck one you "
"could make a nice dino feather mattress."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"Those big dinosaurs make a big mess.  If only there was some way to harness "
"the power of those poops for the uplift of all mankind.  Maybe a renewable "
"energy source, or a construction material, or super dino fertilizer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"A buddy of mine wandered close to the swamps and was eaten by a T-Rex, a big"
" lizard.  I'd be careful unless you have a gun and plenty of ammo."
msgstr ""
"Un amigo mío se acercó a los pantanos y se lo comió un T-Rex, un gran "
"lagarto. Yo tendría cuidado a menos que tengas un arma y mucha munición."

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"I hear the zombies have been in the swamps.  Bad news if they bite a "
"dinosaur before it bites them."
msgstr ""
"He oído que los zombis han estado en los pantanos. Malas noticias si muerden"
" a un dinosaurio antes de que los muerda a ellos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"I know there aren't alligators in the sewer, but I heard there was some kind"
" of big lizard down there.  Probably not a good idea to check."
msgstr ""
"Sé que no hay caimanes en las alcantarillas, pero he oído que había algún "
"tipo de lagarto grande ahí abajo. Probablemente no sea una buena idea "
"comprobarlo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"Some of those big dinosaurs seem halfway all right.  I bet if you fed them "
"something nice and gave them a pet you could ride them like a pony.  Or "
"maybe they'd eat you instead."
msgstr ""
"Algunos de esos grandes dinosaurios parecen estar medio bien. Apuesto a que "
"si los alimentaras con algo bueno y les dieras una mascota podrías montarlos"
" como un poni. O tal vez te comerían en su lugar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"I saw something with a large fin in the water.  It was the size of a whale "
"and gave me a menacing feeling.  I'm gonna think twice before going back "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Vi algo con una gran aleta en el agua. Era del tamaño de una ballena y me "
"dio una sensación amenazante. Me lo voy a pensar dos veces antes de volver "
"allí."

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"One time I found a strange egg out in the woods.  It was probably a "
"dinosaur, but I cooked it and it was pretty good!"
msgstr ""
"Una vez encontré un huevo extraño en el bosque. Probablemente era un "
"dinosaurio, pero lo cociné y estaba muy bueno."

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"One time I found a giant egg out in the woods.  I ate it raw all at once and"
" then got sick all over.  Maybe I should have cooked it and eaten it bit by "
"bit?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"I got a bunch of these big lizards to follow me around and it was great and "
"then they smashed up the place I was staying and then a bunch of other "
"places I wanted to set up camp in.  Maybe I should have tied them down?"
msgstr ""
"Conseguí que un montón de estos grandes lagartos me siguieran y fue genial y"
" entonces destrozaron el lugar donde me alojaba y luego un montón de otros "
"lugares en los que quería acampar. ¿Tal vez debería haberlos atado?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
msgid ""
"I heard some loud smashing outside a cabin I was in out in the swamp and "
"figured it was nothing.  Then a hungry dinosaur smashed right through the "
"wall and I ran!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local wildlife exhibit, claiming to have new "
"and exciting animals on display.  Strangely, the only imagery on it is a "
"stylized silhouette of a T. Rex.  The flier reads \"Witness the rebirth of "
"the extinct, grand opening this week!\""
msgstr ""
"Esto es un anuncio de una exposición de fauna local, alegando tener animales"
" nuevos y emocionantes en pantalla.  Curiosamente, las imágenes son solo una"
" silueta estilizada de un T. Rex.  El panfleto dice \"¡Presenciad el "
"renacimiento de la extinción, gran apertura esta semana!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "\"SWAMPS BAD TEETH HUGE OHGOD\""
msgstr "\"¡INUNDAN LOS DIENTES MALOS DE UN GRAN, OH  DIOS!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "\"Why is that place just fucking crawling with lizards?\""
msgstr "\"¿Por qué este lugar está jodidamente plagado de lagartos?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I bet dinosaurs can read and play chess so don't eat us because we can "
"teach you important things like magnets and ramen\""
msgstr ""
"\"Seguro que los dinosaurios saben leer y jugar al ajedrez, así que no nos "
"comeran porque podemos enseñarles cosas importantes como los imanes y el "
"ramen\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "\"where's some .700 t-rex medicine when you need it?\""
msgstr "\"¿Dónde hay algunas medicinas t-rex .700 cuando uno las necesita?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"So is this what happens when you stray off the path and step on a "
"butterfly?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Entonces, ¿es esto lo que sucede cuando te desvías del camino y pisas una "
"mariposa?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"But even a much older gent  Sees itself forced to wander  He goes by the "
"name Diplodocus  And belongs among the fossils  Mr. Carnegie packs him "
"joyfully  Into giant arks  And sends him as gift  To several monarchs\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pero incluso un caballero mucho más viejo se ve obligado a vagar Se llama "
"Diplodocus Y pertenece a los fósiles. El Sr. Carnegie lo embala alegremente "
"en arcas gigantes Y lo envía como regalo A varios monarcas\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"What the hell is a brown and magenta 4 legged juvenile?!  Fucker took a "
"dozen or more .308 rounds to put down.  Gives a ton of fucking meat\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué demonios es un menor de 4 patas marrón y magenta? El cabrón necesitó "
"una docena o más de balas del calibre 308 para ser abatido. Da una tonelada "
"de puta carne\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "\"I saw the most beautiful dinosaur today.  I must dress her.\""
msgstr "\"Hoy he visto la dinosauria más bonito. Debo vestirla\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw this one dinosaur and I was like gorge.  And then I saw this other "
"dinosaur and I was like gooorge!  And then I saw this other one and I was "
"like gorgosaurus!  Like for real.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vi este dinosaurio y me sentí como gorge. Y luego vi a este otro "
"dinosaurio y me quedé como ¡gorge! Y luego vi este otro y me quedé como "
"¡gorgosaurio! Como si fuera de verdad\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"KILL ALL DINOSAURS.  DO NOT TAKE THEIR DRUGS.  DO NOT LISTEN TO THEIR "
"LIES.  THEY ARE BEAUTIFUL AND WE WILL KILL THEM UNTIL WE DIE AND THEN WE "
"WILL RISE AGAIN AND KILL THEM SOME MORE.  ANYONE WHO SAYS DIFFERENT IS THE "
"ENEMY.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"MANY MISSING: A wave of missing persons reports have shaken an already "
"troubled nation, especially among members of the popular Swampers religion "
"and hotel and casino chain.  Asked to comment, their charismatic CEO Bo "
"Baronyx refused to explain their whereabouts, saying only 'The great eaters "
"have returned and they will be sated' and winked and smiled in the most "
"charming way.  The Swampers are doing their part in this crisis and are "
"accepting donations of meat and money to feed the hungry."
msgstr ""
"MUCHOS DESAPARECIDOS: Una oleada de denuncias de personas desaparecidas ha "
"sacudido a una nación ya atribulada, especialmente entre los miembros de la "
"popular religión, cadena de hoteles y casinos de las Marismas. Cuando se le "
"pidió que comentara, su carismático director general, Bo Baronyx, se negó a "
"dar explicaciones sobre su paradero, limitándose a decir: \"Los grandes "
"devoradores han vuelto y serán saciados\", y guiñó un ojo y sonrió de la "
"forma más encantadora. Los habitantes de las Marismas están cumpliendo co su"
" parte en esta crisis y aceptan donaciones de carne y dinero para alimentar "
"a los hambrientos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"CUTEST VISITORS: A mysterious portal of shimmering blue energy and flashing "
"lights opened above Cretaceous Kindergarten today, showering children with "
"the cutest tiny fuzzy dinosaurs and dinosaur babies.  Local paleontologist "
"and exotic dancer Othniel Marsh expressed skepticism that dinosaurs had not "
"died out millions of years ago but 'at this point why not, at least they're "
"cute'.  And cute they are!"
msgstr ""
"LOS VISITANTES MÁS GUAPOS: Un misterioso portal de energía azul brillante y "
"luces parpadeantes se ha abierto hoy por encima del jardín de infancia del "
"Cretácico y bañando a los niños con los dinosaurios peludos más bonitos y "
"crías de dinosaurio. El paleontólogo local y bailarín exótico Othniel Marsh "
"se mostró escéptico ante la posibilidad de que los dinosaurios no se "
"hubieran extinguido hace millones de años, pero \"a estas alturas, por qué "
"no, al menos son bonitos\". Y lo son."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"DENIES DINOSAURS: FEMA official Ernst Stromer said late last night that the "
"cities are not safe and reports of dinosaurs outside the cities are wrong "
"and 'possibly drug-related' but cautioned refugees to 'get all the guns you "
"can' because 'it's bad out there'."
msgstr ""
"NIEGA LA EXISTENCIA DE DINOSAURIOS: El funcionario de la FEMA, Ernst "
"Stromer, dijo anoche que las ciudades no son seguras y que los informes "
"sobre dinosaurios fuera de las ciudades son erróneos y \"posiblemente "
"relacionados con las drogas\", pero advirtió a los refugiados que \"consigan"
" todas las armas que puedan\" porque \"está mal ahí fuera\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"NEVER HUMANS?: Swamper scientists report that in every historical simulation"
" they have run, humans never evolve, with dinosaurs remaining the dominant "
"life form to present day in every model unless an artificial disaster event "
"is introduced.  'Fear not, this world is healing, we will return to normal "
"soon' reports Swamper CEO Bo Baronyx confidently.  Sounds like good news "
"ahead!"
msgstr ""
"¿NUNCA HUMANOS? Los científicos de las Marismas informan de que en todas las"
" simulaciones históricas que han realizado, los humanos nunca evolucionan, y"
" los dinosaurios siguen siendo la forma de vida dominante hasta el día de "
"hoy en todos los modelos, a menos que se introduzca un evento de desastre "
"artificial. No teman, este mundo se está curando, pronto volveremos a la "
"normalidad\", informa con confianza el director general de las Marismas, Bo "
"Baronyx. Parece que se avecinan buenas noticias."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"GOD IS A DINOSAUR?:  Colorful FEMA official and slug mutant Ernst Stromer "
"reported this morning that he has 'seen god and she is a hungry torvosaurus "
"too beautiful for this world'.  He says that she 'cannot be harmed by "
"bullets' and that she is 'made of beautiful golden light from above' and she"
" demands human flesh.  Stromer says that every fighting man and woman must "
"go to her to be destroyed by her 'atomic majesty'.  Good news America!"
msgstr ""
"¿DIOS ES UN DINOSAURIO? El colorido funcionario de la FEMA y babosa mutante "
"Ernst Stromer informó esta mañana que ha \"visto a Dios y es un torvosaurio "
"hambriento demasiado hermoso para este mundo\". Dice que 'no puede ser "
"dañado por las balas' y que está 'hecho de una hermosa luz dorada de lo "
"alto' y exige carne humana. Stromer dice que todos los hombres y mujeres que"
" luchan deben ir a él para ser destruidos por su \"majestad atómica\". "
"Buenas noticias, América."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dino-reports"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"IMMERSION LOG: 30D-A\n"
"\n"
"PRELIMINARY REPORT:\n"
"\n"
"SUMMARY:\n"
"Exploration into sub-scape 30-D revealed biosphere similar to prime, similar to previous sub-scapes in same frequency.  Expedition team reported visual contact with several reptoids ('dinosaurs') and warm, humid conditions.  Though one reptoid made visual contact with the expedition team and approached, all members were returned with no incident.  Refer to previous sub-scape system 30 reports and meta-comparison report for further information."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"REGISTRO DE INMERSIÓN: 30D-A\n"
"\n"
"INFORME PRELIMINAR:\n"
"\n"
"RESUMEN:\n"
"La exploración en el subespacio 30-D reveló una biosfera similar a la primaria y a los subespacios anteriores en la misma frecuencia. El equipo de la expedición informó de un contacto visual con varios reptoides (\"dinosaurios\") y de condiciones cálidas y húmedas. Aunque un reptoide hizo contacto visual con el equipo de la expedición y se acercó, todos los miembros fueron devueltos sin ningún incidente. Para más información, véanse los informes anteriores del sistema de subespacio 30 y el informe de metacomparación."

