#. ~ Description of "rifle ammo, ball"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
msgid ""
"Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for "
"international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defense, and "
"these days, zombies.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets "
"which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved "
"penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr ""
"Munición de rifle moderna, ubicua y asequible. Es adecuada para conflictos "
"internacionales, caza menor y mayor, defensa personal y, hoy en día, zombis."
" \"Bola\" es un antiguo término para las balas con chaqueta metálica que "
"ofrecen menos retroceso, mayor fiabilidad y una penetración ligeramente "
"mejorada en comparación con el plomo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
