msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've loved death since you can remember, always attracted to that cold and"
" fair skeletal hand, but love is often unrequited, you have not been allowed"
" a meeting yet.  One night, you had a dream, since you are not allowed to "
"meet death, why not bring that joy to everyone else instead?  After much "
"training and hardship you have now become the Grim Reaper itself."
