msgid_plural "demon chitin armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de quitina demonio"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de quitina demonio"
msgstr[2] "armaduras de quitina demonio"

#. ~ Description of "demon chitin armor"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Leg and body armor crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red "
"exoskeletons of demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr ""
"Las piernas y la armadura del cuerpo están hechas de exoesqueletos de arañas"
" demonio rojas cuidadosamente limpiados y podados. Resistentes al fuego y "
"muy duraderas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "XL demon chitin armor"
msgid_plural "XL demon chitin armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de quitina demonio XL"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de quitina demonio XL"
msgstr[2] "armaduras de quitina demonio XL"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "demon chitin helmet"
msgid_plural "demon chitin helmets"
msgstr[0] "casco de quitina demonio"
msgstr[1] "cascos de quitina demonio"
msgstr[2] "cascos de quitina demonio"

#. ~ Description of "demon chitin helmet"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A helmet crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of "
"demon spiders.  Covers the entire head; fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr ""
"Un casco hecho a mano con los exoesqueletos de arañas demonio rojas "
"cuidadosamente limpiados y podados. Cubre toda la cabeza, resistente al "
"fuego y muy duradero."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "XL demon chitin helmet"
msgid_plural "XL demon chitin helmets"
msgstr[0] "casco de quitina demonio XL"
msgstr[1] "cascos de quitina demonio XL"
msgstr[2] "cascos de quitina demonio XL"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of demon chitin gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of demon chitin gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "par de guanteletes de quitina demonio"
msgstr[1] "pares de guanteletes de quitina demonio"
msgstr[2] "pares de guanteletes de quitina demonio"

#. ~ Description of "pair of demon chitin gauntlets"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Gauntlets crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of "
"demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr ""
"Guanteletes hechos a partir de los exoesqueletos de arañas demonio rojas "
"cuidadosamente limpiados y podados. Resistentes al fuego y muy duraderos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL demon chitin gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL demon chitin gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "par de guanteletes de quitina de demonio XL"
msgstr[1] "pares de guanteletes de quitina de demonio XL"
msgstr[2] "pares de guanteletes de quitina de demonio XL"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of demon chitin boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of demon chitin boots"
msgstr[0] "par de botas de quitina demonio"
msgstr[1] "pares de botas de quitina demonio"
msgstr[2] "pares de botas de quitina demonio"

#. ~ Description of "pair of demon chitin boots"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Boots crafted from carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of demon "
"spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr ""
"Botas fabricadas con exoesqueletos de arañas demonio rojas cuidadosamente "
"limpiados y podados. Resistentes al fuego y muy duraderas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL demon chitin boots"
