#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Biokinetic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Biokinetic" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You feel in "
"better shape than you ever have in your life, like you could run ten miles "
"and climb a mountain and then wake up and do it again.  You'll probably need"
" it."
msgstr ""

