#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The wound on your left arm you tried to cauterize is starting to itch and "
"swell.  It's probably infected."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The wound on your right arm you tried to cauterize is starting to itch and "
"swell.  It's probably infected."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The wound on your head you tried to cauterize is starting to itch and swell."
"  It's probably infected."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The wound on your left leg you tried to cauterize is starting to itch and "
"swell.  It's probably infected."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The wound on your torso you tried to cauterize is starting to itch and "
"swell.  It's probably infected."
