msgid_plural "glade banshees"
msgstr[0] "banshee de claro"
msgstr[1] "banshees de claro"
msgstr[2] "banshees de claro"

#. ~ Description of monster "glade banshee"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"With its ragged looks and overgrown coverage this zombie looks like a hag "
"from some cursed forest."
msgstr ""
"Con su aspecto andrajoso y su cobertura exagerada, este zombi parece una "
"bruja de algún bosque maldito."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
