"When underground or on natural earth, the Ierde recovers Stamina 50% faster."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "The Stone Endures"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Stone Endures"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
