msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Theta 1, also known as \"kindergarten\" between other task forces, is used "
"when missions are expected to be too dangerous to send people or when "
"reconnaissance can't obtain any important information about the target, "
"which is why otherworldly creatures, summoned by dreamers, are sent.  It's "
"not the best course of action, but the unit's nearly zero fatality rate "
"makes it worth using."
