msgstr "Chamán"

#. ~ Description of profession "Shaman" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've trained in the medical arts, refining natural remedies into real "
"cures for disease.  Your tribe would have lived long and healthy lives, were"
" they still here."
msgstr ""
"Estas entrenado en las artes médicas, refinando remedios naturales en curas "
"reales para enfermedades. Tu tribu hubiera vivido una vida larga y "
"saludable, si estuvieran vivos."

