msgid "Tribal Warrior Recruit"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Warrior Recruit" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the tribal guard has been your dream for years.  You finally got in,"
" just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, the elders abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en el ejército ha sido tu sueño durante años. Finalmente lo "
"conseguiste, justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido "
"por una especie de emergencia nacional. Por lo que puedes ver, el mando "
"militar te abandonó en este agujero infernal cuando te perdiste la "
"evacuación de emergencia."

