msgstr[1] "trozos de cobre nativo"
msgstr[2] "trozos de cobre nativo"

#. ~ Density of one liter of copper, item is native metal.
#. ~ Description of "chunk of native copper"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of copper, in its native state.  It only needs to be worked "
"into a more usable shape."
msgstr ""
"Un gran trozo de cobre, en su estado natural. Solo hay que trabajarlo para "
"darle una forma más útil."

#. ~ Density of one liter of silver, item is native metal.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
