#: src/construction.cpp:1369
msgid ""
"You feel relieved after providing last rites for this human being, whose "
"name is lost in the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes aliviado después de dar la extremaunción a este ser humano, cuyo "
"nombre se pierde en el cataclismo."

#: src/construction.cpp:1371
msgid "You bury remains of a human, whose name is lost in the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Se entierran los restos de un humano, cuyo nombre se pierde en el "
"cataclismo."

#: src/construction.cpp:1378
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You feel sadness, but also relief after providing last rites for %s, whose "
"name you will keep in your memory."
msgstr ""
"Sientes tristeza, pero también alivio después de dar la extremaunción a %s, "
"cuyo nombre conservarás en tu memoria."

#: src/construction.cpp:1382
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You bury remains of %s, who joined uncounted masses perished in the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Se entierran los restos de%s,  que se unieron a incontables masas que "
"perecieron en el cataclismo."

#: src/construction.cpp:1392
msgid "Inscribe something on the grave?"
msgstr "¿Inscribir algo en la tumba?"

#: src/construction.cpp:1396
msgid ""
"Unfortunately you don't have anything sharp to place an inscription on the "
"grave."
msgstr ""
"Desafortunadamente no tienes nada afilado para hacer una inscripción en la "
"tumba."

#: src/construction.cpp:1424 src/veh_interact.cpp:2064
msgid "Enter new vehicle name:"
msgstr "Ingresa el nuevo nombre del vehículo:"

#: src/construction.cpp:1428
msgid "Car"
msgstr "Coche"

#: src/construction.cpp:1503 src/construction.cpp:1552
#, c-format
msgid "That %s can not be disassembled!"
msgstr "¡Ese %s no puede ser desmontado!"

#: src/construction.cpp:1526 src/construction.cpp:1564
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is disassembled."
msgstr "Se ha desmontado %s."

#: src/construction.cpp:1558
#, c-format
msgid "That %s can not be disassembled, since there is furniture above it."
msgstr "Ese %s no se puede desmontar, ya que tiene muebles encima."

#: src/construction.cpp:1600
msgid "The rock feels much warmer than normal.  Proceed?"
msgstr "La roca se siente mucho más caliente de lo normal. ¿Procedes?"

#: src/construction.cpp:1604
msgid "You just tunneled into lava!"
msgstr "¡Acabas de hacer un túnel hacia la lava!"

#: src/construction.cpp:1614
msgid "You dig into a preexisting space, and improvise a ladder."
msgstr "Cavaste en un espacio preexistente, e improvisaste una escalera."

#: src/construction.cpp:1616
msgid "You dig a stairway, adding sturdy timbers and a rope for safety."
msgstr ""
"Cavaste una escalera, añadiendo madera fuerte y una soga para mayor "
"seguridad."

#: src/construction.cpp:1618
msgid "You drill out a passage, heading deeper underground."
msgstr "Perforaste un pasaje, dirigiéndote más profundamente bajo tierra."

#: src/construction.cpp:1638
msgid "Something crawls out of the coffin!"
msgstr "¡Algo se arrastra fuera del ataúd!"

#: src/construction.cpp:1685
msgid "The rock overhead feels hot.  You decide *not* to mine magma."
msgstr ""
"La piedra arriba tuyo se siente caliente. Decidiste *no* cavar hacia el "
"magma."

#: src/construction.cpp:1693
msgid "The rock above is rather damp.  You decide *not* to mine water."
msgstr ""
"La piedra arriba tuyo está bastante húmeda. Decidiste *no* cavar hacia el "
"agua."

#: src/construction.cpp:1706
msgid "You drill out a passage, heading for the surface."
msgstr "Perforaste un pasaje, dirigiéndote hacia la superficie."

#: src/construction.cpp:1728
msgid "After boarding up the window the curtains and curtain rod are left."
msgstr ""
"Luego de poner tablas en la ventana, sobran las cortinas y la barra para "
"colgarlas."

#: src/construction.cpp:1739
msgid "You gather some clay."
msgstr "Recoges algo de arcilla."

#: src/construction.cpp:1741
msgid "You gather some sand."
msgstr "Recoges algo de arena."

#: src/construction.cpp:1744
msgid "You gather some materials."
msgstr "Recoges algo de materiales."

#. ~ Sound of a shovel digging a pit at work!
#: src/construction.cpp:1777
msgid "hsh!"
msgstr "¡hsh!"

#: src/construction.cpp:1791
msgid "Would you really touch the sacred resting place of the dead?"
msgstr "¿Realmente tocarías el lugar sagrado de descanso de los muertos?"

#: src/construction.cpp:1792
msgid "Exhuming a grave is really against your beliefs."
msgstr "Exhumar una tumba va realmente en contra de tus creencias."

#: src/construction.cpp:1802
msgid "Exhuming a grave is fun now, when there is no one to object."
msgstr ""
"Exhumar una tumba es divertido ahora, cuando no hay nadie que se oponga."

#: src/construction.cpp:1805
msgid "You wonder if you dig up anything useful."
msgstr ""

#: src/construction.cpp:1808
msgid "Exhuming this grave is utterly disgusting!"
msgstr "¡Exhumar esta tumba es completamente detestable!"

#: src/construction.cpp:1819
msgid "You cannot build there!"
msgstr "¡No puedes construir ahí!"

#: src/construction.cpp:1824
msgid "You cannot deconstruct this!"
msgstr "¡No puedes deconstruir esto!"

#: src/construction.cpp:2109
msgid "Time to complete: "
msgstr "Tiempo para completarlo: "

#: src/consumption.cpp:743 src/consumption.cpp:762
msgid "That doesn't look edible."
msgstr "Eso no parece ser comestible."

#: src/consumption.cpp:758
msgid "That doesn't look edible to you."
msgstr "Eso no parece ser comestible para ti."

#: src/consumption.cpp:767 src/consumption.cpp:789
msgid "That doesn't look edible in its current form."
msgstr "Eso no parece ser comestible en su forma actual."

#: src/consumption.cpp:772
msgid "This is full of dirt after being on the ground."
msgstr "Esto está lleno de suciedad después de estar en el suelo."

#: src/consumption.cpp:783 src/creature.cpp:270 src/iuse_actor.cpp:1328
#: src/iuse_actor.cpp:1950 src/iuse_actor.cpp:2211
msgid "You can't do that while underwater."
msgstr "No puedes hacer eso abajo del agua."

#: src/consumption.cpp:795
msgid "We can't eat that.  It's not right for us."
msgstr "No podemos comer eso. No es adecuado para nosotros."

#: src/consumption.cpp:802
msgid "It's frozen solid.  You must defrost it before you can eat it."
msgstr ""
"Está congelado. Tienes que descongelarlo antes de que lo puedas comer."

#: src/consumption.cpp:805
msgid "You can't drink it while it's frozen."
msgstr "No puedes beber un líquido congelado."

#: src/consumption.cpp:819 src/consumption.cpp:839 src/consumption.cpp:1775
#: src/game_inventory.cpp:1101 src/game_inventory.cpp:1113
#, c-format
msgid "You need a %s to consume that!"
msgstr "¡Necesitas  %s para consumir eso!"

#: src/consumption.cpp:846
msgid "Ugh, you can't drink that!"
msgstr "¡Joder, no te puedes beber eso!"

#: src/consumption.cpp:852
msgid "Eww.  Inedible plant stuff!"
msgstr "¡Qué asquito! ¡Sustancia vegetal intragable!"

#: src/consumption.cpp:859
msgid "The thought of eating that makes you feel sick."
msgstr "La idea de comerte eso te provoca nauseas."

#: src/consumption.cpp:869
msgid "You're still not going to eat animal products."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:874
msgid "You can't eat this."
msgstr "No puedes comer esto."

#: src/consumption.cpp:882
msgid "You deserve better food than this."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:888
msgid "You are not going to drink this."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:920
msgid "This is rotten and smells awful!"
msgstr "¡Esto está podrido y apesta!"

#: src/consumption.cpp:929
msgid "The thought of eating human flesh makes you feel sick."
msgstr "La idea de comer carne humana te provoca nauseas."

#: src/consumption.cpp:934
#, c-format
msgid "Consuming this %s probably isn't very healthy."
msgstr "Consumir %s probablemente no es muy sano."

#: src/consumption.cpp:942
msgid "You still feel nauseous and will probably puke it all up again."
msgstr ""
"Aún te sientes nauseas y lo mas seguro que acabes vomitándolo todo otra vez."

#: src/consumption.cpp:947
msgid "Your stomach won't be happy (allergy)."
msgstr "A tu estomago no le hará gracia (alergia)."

#. ~ No, we don't eat "rotten" food. We eat properly aged food, like a normal
#. person.
#. ~ Semantic difference, but greatly facilitates people being proud of their
#. character.
#: src/consumption.cpp:955
msgid "Your stomach won't be happy (not rotten enough)."
msgstr "A tu estomago no le hará gracia (no suficientemente podrido)."

#: src/consumption.cpp:962
msgid "You're full already and will be forcing yourself to eat."
msgstr "Ya estas lleno y te estarás obligando a comer."

#: src/consumption.cpp:964
msgid "You're full already and will be forcing yourself to drink."
msgstr "Ya estas lleno y te estarás obligando a beber."

#: src/consumption.cpp:981
#, c-format
msgid "Eat your %s anyway?"
msgstr "¿Comes tu %s de todas formas?"

#: src/consumption.cpp:983
#, c-format
msgid "Drink your %s anyway?"
msgstr "¿Bebes tu %s de todas formas?"

#: src/consumption.cpp:985
#, c-format
msgid "Consume your %s anyway?"
msgstr "¿Consumes tu %s de todas formas?"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1043
msgid ""
"You've begun stockpiling calories and liquid for hibernation.  You get the "
"feeling that you should prepare for bed, just in case, but… you're hungry "
"again, and you could eat a whole week's worth of food RIGHT NOW."
msgstr ""
"Has empezado a acumular calorías y líquido para la hibernación. Tienes la "
"sensación de que deberías prepararte para ir a la cama, por si acaso, "
"pero... tienes hambre de nuevo, y podrías comer toda una semana de comida "
"AHORA MISMO."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1052
#, c-format
msgid "Ick, this %s doesn't taste so good…"
msgstr "Agh, %s no sabe tan bien..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1057
#, c-format
msgid "Mmm, this %s tastes delicious…"
msgstr "Mmm, %s sabe muy bien..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1093
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> assimilates a %s."
msgstr "<npcname> asimila %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1093
#, c-format
msgid "You assimilate your %s."
msgstr "Te incorporás tu %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1100 src/consumption.cpp:1111
#, c-format
msgid "Ick, this %s (rotten) doesn't taste so good…"
msgstr "Ick, este %s (podrido) no sabe tan bien..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1101
#, c-format
msgid "You drink your %s (rotten)."
msgstr "Te bebes tu%s (putrefacción)."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1103
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> drinks a %s."
msgstr "<npcname> bebe %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1103
#, c-format
msgid "You drink your %s."
msgstr "Te tomas tu %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1112
#, c-format
msgid "You eat your %s (rotten)."
msgstr "Te comes tu %s  (podrido)."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1114
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> eats a %s."
msgstr "<npcname> come %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1114
#, c-format
msgid "You eat your %s."
msgstr "Te comes %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1136
msgid ""
"You try to ignore its mushy texture, but it leaves you with an awful "
"aftertaste."
msgstr ""
"Intentas ignorar su textura blanda, pero te deja con un sabor espantoso."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1140
msgid "You can't taste much of anything with this cold."
msgstr "No se puede saborear mucho de nada con este frío."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1143
msgid "You can't taste much of anything with this flu."
msgstr "No puedes saborear nada con esta gripe."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1305
msgid "You feast upon the human flesh, and in doing so, devour their spirit."
msgstr ""
"Te haces un festín con la carne humana, y de esa manera, devorás su "
"espíritu."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1309
msgid "You feast upon the human flesh."
msgstr "Te haces un festín con la carne humana."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1312
msgid "You consume the sacred human flesh."
msgstr "Consumes la sagrada carne humana."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1316
msgid "You eat the human flesh, and in doing so, devour their spirit."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1319
msgid "You indulge your shameful hunger."
msgstr "Satisfaces tu hambre vergonzosa."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1322
msgid "You greedily devour the taboo meat."
msgstr "Devoras con voracidad la carne tabú."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1326
msgid "Meh.  You've eaten worse."
msgstr "Bah. Has comido cosas peores."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1328
msgid "Mmh.  Tastes like venison."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1331
msgid ""
"This is probably going to count against you if there's still an afterlife."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente, esto te restará puntos si es que hay algo después de la "
"muerte."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1334
msgid "You find this meal distasteful, but necessary."
msgstr "Encontró esta comida desagradable, pero necesaria."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1337
msgid "You feel horrible for eating a person."
msgstr "Te sientes horrible por haberte comido una persona."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1357
msgid "As you tear into the raw flesh, you feel satisfied with your meal."
msgstr ""
"Mientras desgarras la carne cruda, te sientes satisfecho con tu comida."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1362
msgid "Raw flesh doesn't taste all that bad, actually."
msgstr "La carne cruda no sabe tan mal, en realidad."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1367
msgid "This doesn't taste very good, but meat is meat."
msgstr "Esto no sabe muy bien, pero carne es carne."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1375 src/consumption.cpp:1394 src/consumption.cpp:1403
msgid "Your stomach begins gurgling and you feel bloated and ill."
msgstr "Tu estómago empieza a borbotear y te sientes hinchado y enfermo."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1380
msgid "Mmm, junk food."
msgstr "Mmm, comida basura."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1385
msgid "When life's got you down, there's always sugar."
msgstr "Cuando la vida te trata mal, siempre te queda el azúcar."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1387
msgid "They may do what they must… you've already won."
msgstr "Pueden hacer lo que deben... ya has ganado."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1411
msgid "You find the sweet taste of honey surprisingly palatable."
